window.FWN_FEY_EVOLUTION_MERCHANT_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_FEY_EVOLUTION_MERCHANT_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3101,"title":"Chapter 3101 The Zhao Family’s Chance!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3101 The Zhao Family’s Chance!","“We’re not like you, who manages a huge city outside and has a rich family background. The resources we have are basically used to increase our strength. We have very little in stock.”","....","This red-haired woman’s words were not only to flatter Zhao Chen but also to ask him a question.","Zhao Chen had been waiting for someone to ask him this question.","Zhao Chen smiled mysteriously and said loudly, “The trade fair organized by Young Master Lin is naturally very generous. All the resources that will used to trade are crystalized pure spirit qi. The trade fair organized by Young Master Lin is naturally very generous. All the resources used to trade are crystalized pure spirit qi.”","Zhao Chen’s words caused an uproar among the members of the local forces in South Face City.","What? He would be using crystallized pure spirit qi to exchange for resources? Pure spirit qi could be said to be the most representative material among the Creator resources at all levels. Most of the time, it could be used as currency. Who was this Young Master Lin that Zhao Chen was talking about? He actually gave such a benefit in order to gather people!","This Young Master Lin was definitely not someone from South Face City. Creators rarely came to places like South Face City where danger lurked everywhere. This made the resources from high-grade Creators in South Face City even harder to obtain.","Since they had organized this trade fair with such a huge commotion, they should not end the trade fair with just a few items.","The faction behind the person who could take out so many resources must be extremely terrifying. Contact with such a person was both an opportunity and a risk.","However, no one would not fight for the opportunity in front of them. They began to contact their families.","After reporting the situation to their families, they would prepare the supplies.","The families behind these people who had taken root in South Face City also went crazy because of this. They began to prepare numerous resources that were qualified to exchange for Grade 4 Creation resources.","They wanted to use this transaction to find out the background of Young Master Lin that Zhao Chen had mentioned.","Zhao Chen was one of the more outstanding direct descendants of the Zhao family.","Zhao Chen was in charge of hosting this trade fair so he probably would not let it end badly.","By relying on the transaction volume of this Young Master Lin, they could find out the background of the faction behind Young Master Lin.","Zhao Chen was indeed an extremely smart person. If he had not traded with Lin Yuan many times, he would have known how many resources Lin Yuan had.","If someone else had asked Zhao Chen for help, he would have rejected them without hesitation.","By helping Lin Yuan host this trade fair, Zhao Chen was essentially helping Lin Yuan as a guarantor.","This incident also alarmed the faction behind Zhao Chen.","Many elders in the family used communication tools to contact Zhao Chen.","Zhao Chen enjoyed the feeling of being valued and watched by his family. This was a feeling that Zhao Chen rarely had the chance to experience before.","However, ever since he had interacted with Lin Yuan, Zhao Chen had been able to sense this feeling frequently.","The person who was closest to Zhao Chen in the family was the Fourth Elder.","Zhao Chen said in an extremely serious tone as he listened to Fourth Elder’s questioning of him, “Fourth Uncle, you know my personality. Since I’ve accepted this matter, I’ve already thought of the consequences. I can vouch for Young Master Lin! This is an opportunity for the other factions, as well as for the Zhao family. Fourth Uncle, please prepare more resources!”","When Zhao Wei heard Zhao Chen’s words, he did not look surprised, but worried.","Zhao Wei had no children and no descendants in the family.","Zhao Wei had always been working with Zhao Chen’s father. Zhao Qi.","Zhao Qi was once a strong competitor for the position of the family leader. Although Zhao Chen’s strength was not the strongest among the direct descendants, he was the most scheming and shrewd one.","Unfortunately, Zhao Qi had been schemed against for some reason, causing him to lose the ability and opportunity to compete for the position of the Zhao family head. Otherwise, with Zhao Chen’s talent, he would definitely have received the most resources from the family. The status of their parents in the family would affect the future of their children.","That incident had a huge impact on Zhao Qi, and he still could not get rid of the consequences of it. This also caused Zhao Chen to be ostracized in the family.","Zhao Wei’s status in the family was already about to surpass Zhao Qi’s. Zhao Wei and Zhao Qi had racked their brains to plan for Zhao Chen to become the City Lord of Diverse City. Both of them had high hopes for Zhao Chen.","Zhao Chen had indeed lived up to Zhao Qi and Zhao Wei’s expectations all these years. Zhao Wei treated Zhao Chen as his son.","Zhao Wei knew how critical the situation in South Face City was.","Now, it was difficult for the family to even protect themselves. Otherwise, they would not have asked a few direct descendants to retreat from South Face City to preserve their seed.","Zhao Chen kept this opportunity to explore top-grade blessed land in his hand. It was a hot potato to begin with.","Zhao Wei had always wanted to persuade Zhao Chen to give up and not put himself in danger.","However, not only did Zhao Chen not listen, he even wanted to hold a trade fair at this juncture.","Zhao Wei was afraid that Zhao Chen would be cheated. Zhao Wei did not believe that someone would use so many Grade 4 Creation resources to exchange for so many ordinary spiritual ingredients.","Zhao Wei did not believe that any faction would disregard the resources of Creators like this, even those powerful factions. The stronger the faction, the more manpower it would have, and the greater the demand for resources.","Zhao Wei had always been a cautious person. Even though Zhao Qi had lost his power, the main family and the other branches who were competitors with him, had never been able to find fault with him.","After thinking about it, Zhao Wei reminded Zhao Chen, “LittleChen, you used to be a reliable person. Why did you do such an outrageous thing at this juncture? Regardless of whether this trade fair is successful or not, you will be noticed by the various factions that have come to South Face City. It’s not a good thing for you to be noticed by various factions in this chaotic situation!","“You’ve already been the City Lord of a super city for so many years. With the lifespan of our species, you can only be considered a young man. But in the end, you’ve already gained a lot of experience!”","Zhao Chen heard a few words from Zhao Wei and knew what he was thinking.","Zhao Chen knew very well that his uncle had always been cautious. His uncle had always been like this.","In Zhao Chen’s opinion, this cautious personality could only protect himself. It was very difficult for him to seize opportunities. This was the reason why his uncle was inferior to his father.","Zhao Chen also had a cautious side to him. Zhao Chen had always blamed it on being influenced by Zhao Wei. When Zhao Chen was young, he spent much more time with Zhao Wei than he did with his father.","However, Zhao Chen had seen the nearly 100 million spirit qi crystals in Lin Yuan’s equipment with his own eyes. Lin Yuan’s attitude toward the spirit qi crystals during the transaction did not seem to be fake and he indeed looked down on them.","Moreover, Lin Yuan had casually sent an intermediate Grade 5 Creator to Diverse City to concoct medicine and strengthen his feys.","When Zhuo Yan came to Wanduan City, Zhao Chen treated her as a VIP. Zhao Chen had practically taken out his most precious resources to entertain Zhuo Yan and he treated her even better than he treated Lin Yuan.","Firstly, Zhao Chen had never come into such close contact with an intermediate Grade 5 Creator and enjoyed the service of a Grade 5 Creator.","The high-grade Creator resources in the family were usually given priority to the older generation members. Young people like Zhao Chen did not have many opportunities to obtain Grade 5 Creator resources.","Zhao Chen wanted to curry favor with Zhuo Yan because he wanted to form a good relationship with her. Secondly, he wanted to find out more about Lin Yuan through Zhuo Yan. Zhao Chen’s probing had no malicious intent.","Zhuo Yan could tell what Zhao Chen was thinking. A sly old fox like Zhuo Yan naturally knew what to do when she knew that Lin Yuan intended to form a good relationship with Zhao Chen.","Moreover, after witnessing Lin Yuan’s strength and Sky City’s ability to harvest faith, Zhuo Yan felt that the faction behind Lin Yuan must be exceptionally powerful!","Zhuo Yan did not say much. After proving that Lin Yuan had Grade 6 Creator resources, Zhao Chen could no longer leave Lin Yuan.","Zhao Chen knew that if he did not explain the situation to his uncle, not only would his uncle not prepare the supplies according to his request but he would also ask him to stop the operation.","Zhao Chen explained seriously, “Fourth Uncle, you might not know this, but I’ve already privately traded with Young Master Lin for Grade 5 Creator resources. Young Master Lin didn’t just give me ready-made potions.","“He also sent an intermediate Grade 5 Creator to serve me. This intermediate Grade 5 Creator evolved all my contracted fey bloodlines in one go. I also gave this intermediate Grade 5 Creator a communication fey. If you don’t believe me, I can contact her anytime.","“Fourth Uncle, with your knowledge, you should be able to imagine what kind of foundation Young Master Lin has.","“Young Master Lin asked me to help organize this trade fair. How can I refuse? Do you think that there’s no need for me to befriend Young Master Lin?”","Zhuo Yan had informed Lin Yuan about this as soon as Zhao Chen had sent the message to the fey. She was afraid that Lin Yuan would think that she had been sent out on a mission and had the idea of colluding with an external faction.","What surprised Zhuo Yan was that Lin Yuan did not confiscate the communication fey that Zhao Chen had given her. Instead, he allowed her to decide if she wanted to trade with the faction behind Zhao Chen.","Lin Yuan would not interfere too much with this.","Lin Yuan’s actions made Zhuo Yan feel Lin Yuan’s respect for her. It also confirmed that joining Sky City was not equivalent to losing her freedom.","Lin Yuan had indeed fulfilled the promise he had made to Zhuo Yan and the others. This made Zhuo Yan full of energy.","Especially when Zhuo Yan heard that Lin Yuan had sent Si Xue out.","Zhuo Yan and Si Xue had always been at odds with each other. This was not a secret.","Ever since Si Xue and Zhuo Yan arrived at Sky City, there had been more than one conflict. Si Xue’s departure made Zhuo Yan extremely happy.","At the same time, it also let Zhuo Yan know that if she really did not want to stay in Sky City anymore, Lin Yuan would agree to her request.","Furthermore, Zhuo Yan learned from Lin Yuan that Lin Yuan did not mistreat Sun Yin because of his initial resistance. On the other hand, Sun Yin had obtained more opportunities than them because of his talent!","While envious of Sun Yin, Zhuo Yan was more optimistic about her future, as well as her prospects and development in Sky City.","When Zhao Wei heard Zhao Chen’s words, a shocked expression appeared on his face. Then, his breathing suddenly quickened. Zhao Wei really did not expect Zhao Chen to be so capable. Moreover, he was really calm about such a big matter. If he had not taken the initiative to ask, who knew how long Zhao Chen would have held it in?","“I’ve always believed what you said. If this matter is really as you said, I’ll prepare as many resources as possible to exchange for more pinnacle Grade 4 Creator resources. There’s something I haven’t told you. I’m afraid you’ll be under too much pressure.","“Big Brother has always been injured because of the previous storm. After the dust settled in the election, the Grade 5 Creators in the family stopped healing your father because of the new family head. If you have the contact information of that Grade 5 Creator, you can see if she’s willing to treat Big Brother. If this Grade 5 Creator is willing to help, your father’s hidden injuries will be healed!”","Zhao Chen frowned when he heard this. He could not believe that he did not know about such a big matter!","Zhao Chen was not sure if he could invite Zhuo Yan. After all, Zhuo Yan’s attitude towards him was not considered close.","After thinking about it, Zhao Chen felt that if he really wanted to ask Zhuo Yan for help, he would have to ask Lin Yuan. It was not good to go past Lin Yuan to contact Zhuo Yan alone.","“Fourth Uncle, I’ll think of a way to treat my father’s internal injuries! However, before that, we have to prepare for this trade fair first! ourth Uncle, if you have the chance to interact with Young Master Lin in the future, you must be extremely polite to him and treat him as a distinguished guest.","“It’s very likely that the faction behind Young Master Lin has a Grade 6 Creator. I’ve already verified this with that intermediate Grade 5 Creator. In the future, it’s very likely that we can trade for Grade 6 Creator resources from Young Master Lin!”","Zhao Wei was once again stunned by Zhao Chen’s words.","What, Grade 6 Creator resources?","If the family knew about this, Zhao Chen’s status in the family might even surpass the current patriarch of the Zhao family.","It was unknown how much the Zhao family’s elders yearned to obtain Grade 6 Creator resources. If they could obtain Grade 6 Creator resources, several of the Zhao family’s elders would probably be able to improve further.","Zhao Wei said, “Chen, you have to treat Young Master Lin well. This is a good thing. There’s no need to hide it. Report to the family in advance so that you can obtain more benefits! I’ll tell Big Brother about this. Then, I’ll get your father to speak to the family. It’s time to get back what Big Brother lost because of the accident all those years ago!”"]},{"number":3102,"title":"Chapter 3102 The Astonishment of Various Factions!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3102 The Astonishment of Various Factions!","Previously, Zhao Wei could not see any hope of revenge. Now, the hope of revenge finally appeared in front of him again.","....","Zhao Chen had only wanted his fourth uncle to prepare more resources to exchange for more Creator resources from Lin Yuan, but he did not expect to find out about the family’s secrets.","This made Zhao Chen even more aware of Lin Yuan’s importance. He could no longer leave Lin Yuan’s side.","Zhao Chen was interacting with Lin Yuan not only for himself but also for his father.","“Fourth Uncle, I know what to do. It’s just that the storm in South Face City this time is too big. It keeps giving me an ominous feeling. Since we have to inform the family about this matter, I hope that the family can help us find out more information about South Face City.","“Although Young Master Lin only brought four people over this time, I heard from Young Master Lin that you have the intention to fight for this top-grade blessed land. If the family can help Young Master Lin obtain more information about South Face City, even if we can’t make Young Master Lin owe us a favor, we can at least prove the value of our Zhao family to Young Master Lin.","“Otherwise, the value of the two sides will not be equal during the interaction. I’m afraid Young Master Lin will not be willing to be close to the Zhao family in the future!”","Zhao Wei naturally knew what a benign deal was like, but Zhao Chen’s words made Zhao Wei’s paranoia flare up again.","The four of them wanted to snatch this top-grade blessed land. In Zhao Wei’s opinion, it was like a joke.","“I want to see this Young Master Lin you’re talking about. When I send you the supplies later, it’ll be an opportunity. Arrange for me to meet Young Master Lin!”","If someone else from the Zhao Family said that to him, Zhao Chen would definitely be unwilling. He was afraid that someone would steal his channel with Lin Yuan.","But now, it was his fourth uncle who was talking to him.","Zhao Chen would not reject Zhao Wei’s suggestion. Letting Zhao Wei, an elder of the Zhao Family, meet Lin Yuan would also show the Zhao Family’s sincerity.","However, Zhao Chen was a little afraid that his fourth uncle would not be able to grasp the limits while communicating with Lin Yuan. It would not be good if something caused Lin Yuan to be displeased.","Zhao Chen thought about it and specially reminded Zhao Wei, “Fourth Uncle, I’ve already told you that Young Master Lin has an impressive background. When you see Young Master Lin, you must pay attention to your attitude when talking to him. Don’t be too domineering and make Young Master Lin unhappy. Otherwise, it’s very likely to cut off my friendship with Young Master Lin.”","Zhao Chen thought about it and specially reminded Zhao Wei, “Fourth Uncle, I’ve already told you that Young Master Lin has an impressive background. When you see Young Master Lin, you must pay attention to your attitude when talking to him. Don’t be too domineering and make Young Master Lin unhappy. Otherwise, it’s very likely to cut off my friendship with Young Master Lin.”","Zhao Wei laughed and scolded, “Do I need you to remind me of such things? I know what to do.”","Although Zhao Wei said that, if Zhao Chen had not said that Lin Yuan could provide Grade 6 Creator resources, it was very likely that the faction behind him had a Grade 6 Creator.","Zhao Wei probably would not lower himself.","Zhao Wei was an elder with real power in the Zhao family. The Zhao family had a stable channel to obtain Grade 5 Creator resources.","It was normal for Zhao Wei to put on airs in front of a junior.","However, the faction behind Lin Yuan had a Grade 6 Creator. The faction behind Lin Yuan was much stronger than the Zhao Family.","No matter how much Zhao Wei cared about his status, he would still put on a low profile and never do anything out of line.","Zhao Chen was relieved.","“Fourth Uncle, I’ll tell Young Master Lin first and see if Young Master Lin is willing to see you. If Young Master Lin wants to see you, I’ll arrange make the arrangements. If Young Master Lin doesn’t have such thoughts, I think there’s no need for you to insist on meeting Young Master Lin. Do you agree with me?”","This was an important matter. Even though he was facing his fourth uncle, Zhao Chen, he was still extremely cautious. Everything was based on Lin Yuan’s wishes.","“Of course. When the family finds out about this, the others in the family will definitely have the thought of meeting Young Master Lin. At that time, the main family will definitely look for you.","“When the time comes, you should think about what to do to prevent the people from the main family from forming a relationship with the Young Master Lin you mentioned. At the same time, if you reject the main family’s request, the family head won’t be able to object to you.”","Zhao Chen could not help but laugh bitterly when he heard this. Zhao Chen knew that his fourth uncle still did not understand what he meant after saying so much. How could he decide who Lin Yuan interacted with?","If Lin Yuan really wanted to interact with the main branch of the Zhao family, Zhao Chen could only introduce Lin Yuan enthusiastically and not restrict him if he wanted to maintain a good relationship with Lin Yuan. There were so many factions in the world and Lin Yuan had the absolute right to choose.","Even if they did not choose to befriend him, some factions would line up to befriend Lin Yuan and he would not have a choice.","This was because not everyone could casually send a Grade 5 Creator to help them. Not everyone could produce Grade 6 Creator resources.","Zhao Wei did not understand this so Zhao Chen decided not to mention Zhao Wei’s invitation to meet Lin Yuan.","As the saying went, it was better to avoid trouble. Even if it was not for his family or his father, even if it was purely for himself, Zhao Chen did not want to have any animosity with Lin Yuan.","Zhao Chen could not tell Zhao Wei about this plan. In such a large family, even father and son would fight for resources, let alone uncle and nephew.","After ending the call with Zhao Wei, Zhao Chen began to run around for Lin Yuan’s upcoming trade fair.","Those old friends that Zhao Chen had called over were basically communicating with their families.","The trade fair that Lin Yuan was going to hold was becoming grander and grander, which was just as he had expected.","The water in South Face City was already mixed enough, so Lin Yuan did not mind letting it mix a little more.","This was a good opportunity for Lin Yuan to use a portion of his spirit qi crystals to exchange for various resources.","Lin Yuan had taken in many Creators into Sky City, so he was definitely responsible for these high-grade Creators.","As these high-grade Creators could not leave North of the Lonely River, Lin Yuan had to prepare the materials needed to concoct the spirit fluid for them.","Apart from these dozens of high-grade Creators, the Hundred Questions Beast army, who were all Creators, had a greater demand for resources.","It was all thanks to Lin Yuan’s large transactions in Fortune Treasure Palace. Otherwise, the Hundred Questions Beast army would have long ceased operations.","Apart from ordinary resources, Lin Yuan wanted to find more rare resources for Genius.","Genius could use its ability and exclusive skill to analyze items in depth. The more Genius analyzed items, the more capable it would be at increasing the grade of Creators.","As news of the trade fair continued to spread, many factions took the initiative to look for Zhao Chen, hoping to participate in the trade fair.","Zhao Chen could not make a decision on his own so he went to look for Lin Yuan.","“Brother Lin, after the news of you holding a trade fair spread, many factions contacted me to participate in this trade fair. Do you think we should give them a chance?”","Zhao Chen only asked Lin Yuan routinely. But in Zhao Chen’s heart, Lin Yuan would most likely reject him.","After all, in Zhao Chen’s opinion, Lin Yuan’s purpose in this trade fair was to increase his reputation and open up a situation in South Face City.","To put it bluntly, Lin Yuan would make a loss during this trade fair. The more people who participated, the more Lin Yuan would lose.","However, Lin Yuan did not reject him as Zhao Chen had expected. Instead, he spoke in his usual calm tone. “It’s a good thing for me to have more people at this trade fair. Those factions that take the initiative to contact you can participate, but there’s one thing you have to say to them first. You can come, but don’t cause trouble. Those who cause trouble have to bear the consequences!”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, Zhao Chen felt that he could not understand him anymore.","Since Lin Yuan was not afraid of losses and allowed many factions to participate in the trade fair, Zhao Chen naturally would not stop him.","Helping Lin Yuan host the trade fair was equivalent to borrowing Lin Yuan’s glory. The more factions that came, the more benefits Zhao Chen would have.","“Brother Lin, if you’re willing to let those forces participate in the trade fair, there will be a lot of people participating. I propose to find a larger venue to accommodate these guests. Then, each faction will send out an expert to ensure the safety of the trade fair. The various factions will restrain each other so that there won’t be chaos!”","Autumn could not help but snort when he heard Zhao Chen’s words. In Autumn’s opinion, Zhao Chen’s words were equivalent to belittling his strength in front of Lin Yuan.","With Autumn’s usual temper, he could not stand this at all. If not for Lin Yuan, he would have already started to pressure Zhao Chen.","Zhao Chen did not understand why the expert beside Lin Yuan would throw a tantrum at him.","Zhao Chen admitted that he had not done anything to harm Lin Yuan. At the same time, he was somewhat nervous. It was not good news for Zhao Chen that the experts around Lin Yuan had a problem with him.","Just as Zhao Chen was considering whether he should lower his head and apologize to Autumn, Lin Yuan said, “Brother Zhao, since I suggested holding this trade fair, I can naturally guarantee your safety. You don’t have to go through so much trouble.","“However, if there are many factions participating in the trade fair, there is indeed a need to find a larger venue. The people who came to participate in the venue are all in contact with you, so you can find the venue! If you need to spend money on the venue, I’ll settle it with you.”","Zhao Chen hurriedly waved his hand and said, “Brother Lin, you also know that my family is in South Face City. There are plenty of places. You trust me so much just and asked me to preside over the transaction. If I arrange a place for Brother Lin and ask you to spend money, I’ll be mocked! Don’t worry, the venue will definitely be clean, neat, and gorgeous!”","After promising Lin Yuan, Zhao Chen went to make preparations like a lackey.","He did not have the aura of a City Lord at all.","Previously, Lin Yuan had helped Blackie reach the Holy Spirit Realm and spent a large number of spirit qi crystals. However, as Morbius’ collection of spirit qi crystals became faster and faster, Lin Yuan would still be able to quickly accumulate a large amount of spirit qi crystals again even if he spent all of them.","Lin Yuan sorted out all the spirit qi crystals and took out 400 million as a bargaining chip for the upcoming transaction.","Lin Yuan could not help but think, It will be best if these factions that came to participate in the transaction don’t disappoint me and trade away all these spirit qi crystals. This way, the resources that I had accumulate will probably last the Hundred Questions Beast army and the Grade 4 and 5 Creators of Sky City for a long time.","When he was in the main world, the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce had spread its influence across the main world. As long as Lin Yuan asked Listen for any resources, Listen could immediately go to the warehouse to get them for him.","However, Lin Yuan needed to find whatever resources he needed in the Sky Beyond the Clouds himself.","Finding resources was a time-consuming and laborious matter. Lin Yuan did not want to waste too much time on such matters in the future.","However, if the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce wanted to set up a channel in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, it would not be as simple as setting up a channel in the main world.","Therefore, Lin Yuan could only use this method to obtain resources.","The trade fair would be held in three days. In these three days, Zhao Chen had personally come into contact with more than a thousand factions.","On average, he would end his conversation with a faction every few minutes. Zhao Chen’s energy was limited. There were many factions that Zhao Chen had arranged for his subordinates to interact with.","Although this was a little impolite, as if he looked down on those factions, Zhao Chen really did not have any other good ideas. If he was worried about all the factions, Zhao Chen would not even be able to finish in 30 days, let alone three days.","Many factions in the alliance that Spring was in had thought of participating in this trade fair when they heard the news.","When Spring received the news, she immediately told Lin Yuan.","Not long after Spring contacted Lin Yuan, Winter also used the Thoughts Letter Paper to contact Lin Yuan and inform him that South Face City’s City Lord, Xie Lin, was extremely concerned about this trade fair.","Many of the factions that Xie Lin recruited had already contacted Zhao Chen.","Xie Lin even had the idea of participating in this trade fair himself.","Lin Yuan knew that this trade fair was the best time for him to interact and communicate with Xie Lin. If he wanted to know what Xie Lin was up to, it was obviously not enough to rely on Winter alone to gather information.","When the trade fair started, Xie Lin would see the resources he possessed.","As long as Xie Lin was not a fool, he would definitely be able to recognize his background.","Under such circumstances, if Xie Lin chose to cooperate with him, at least he would explain his purpose.","...","Three days passed quickly. Lin Yuan only needed to prepare the spirit qi crystals and did not need to make any additional preparations.","This was unlike the factions that came to participate in the trade fair, who were desperately trying to gather resources.","Although most of the factions were skeptical about Zhao Chen’s idea of using the resources of a pinnacle Grade 4 Creator to exchange for supplies, no faction was willing to give up this opportunity.","At the same time, all the factions were very curious about who Zhao Chen had been working so hard for these past few days.","At the beginning of the trade fair, the various factions finally found out about the situation. However, this situation shocked them.","The various factions could not help but doubt the accuracy of the news.","This was because the person Zhao Chen had been trying his best to help these days was actually a newborn who had less than a hundred years of lifespan."]},{"number":3103,"title":"Chapter 3103 Ancient Snake Gu Palace!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3103 Ancient Snake Gu Palace!","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, regardless of the species, a lifespan of less than a hundred years was absolutely considered a young one. Moreover, the aura of lifespan could not be concealed. Even if someone underwent reincarnation through a specific method, they would still be detected.","....","The various factions that had come to South Face City were all here for top grade blessed lands, without any weaklings to speak of.","Zhao Chen originally intended to advise his fourth uncle not to get involved. Within the Zhao family, his participation alone was sufficient. However, Zhao Wei insisted on representing the Zhao family and staying there. He wanted to use this trade fair to test Lin Yuan’s strength.","Upon seeing Lin Yuan, a few of the faction members deliberately released their auras toward him. On the one hand, they wanted to probe Lin Yuan’s background, and on the other hand, they also wanted to deliberately witness him being put in his place.","Unexpectedly, before the aura could hit Lin Yuan, a murderous aura was emitted from Autumn, who was standing in front of him.","A few fallen leaves flashed past, and those who had just released their auras at Lin Yuan had their necks and heads cut off by the leaves.","With Lin Yuan’s current strength, he would not be able to withstand the aura if it landed on him.","These individuals came to Lin Yuan’s trade fair looking for trouble as soon as they arrived, even threatening Lin Yuan’s safety with covert actions. Autumn would by no means tolerate such behavior.","As soon as they arrived, the organizer proceeded to kill those causing trouble, leading to chaos erupting on the scene.","The individuals slain by Autumn belonged to various factions. Now, representatives from these factions all demanded an explanation.","“We came to attend this trade fair as guests. What’s the meaning behind your actions? Aren’t you afraid of us turning against you by doing this? Our people cannot die in vain. You must give us an explanation. As the organizer, indiscriminate killing at the trade fair shows blatant disregard for all the attendees.”","Members of these factions were frantically causing trouble for Lin Yuan. On the one hand, they sought to continue probing into Lin Yuan’s background. On the other, it was driven by fear.","Upon arrival, these experts had already investigated Autumn’s aura, yet they couldn’t detect even the slightest trace of it emanating from him. However, Autumn’s sudden display of astonishing strength instilled fear in them.","This was also the reason these troublemaking factions aimed to drag down other factions present, subtly coercing them into involvement through their words.","Autumn was only in charge of protecting Lin Yuan. With Lin Yuan around, Autumn would not rashly say anything.","These clamorous individuals dared not use their aura to confront Lin Yuan anymore, so after a cold snort from Autumn, he remained silent and refrained from speaking further.","Lin Yuan said in a calm and loud voice. “I don’t mean anything. Since this is a trade fair organized by me, I naturally set the rules. Of course you have to pay the price for using your aura to attack me. They have already paid the price for their actions. Why do you want to follow in their footsteps?”","Lin Yuan swept his gaze across everyone who had come to participate in the trade fair and said slowly, “Anyone who wants to turn against me for the sake of these people can step forward now. Causing trouble here will only lead to a dead end. I think the various factions have come here to exchange for Creator resources. If any faction regrets participating in this trade fair, you can leave now. Those who don’t leave must abide by the rules I set.”","As Lin Yuan finished speaking, the entire place fell silent. Even those factions that had lost their experts no longer dared to open their mouths.","As soon as Autumn made a move, he intimidated all the experts present.","The City Lord of South Face City, Xie Lin, did not personally attend this auction but instead dispatched one of his trusted subordinates.","After thinking about it, Xie Lin felt that it wasn’t appropriate for him to attend such a gathering as the City Lord.","Xie Lin ensured his trusted subordinate had ample resources on hand. If this wasn’t a hoax, he could guarantee that his subordinate would be able to secure a significant amount of Grade 4 Creator resources. If it was false, deceiving so many factions would surely come with consequences.","Jia Mingda was a general under Xie Lin and was highly valued by Xie Lin. Normally, it was Jia Mingda who went around threatening others, but now it was the first time he had been threatened by someone else. However, Jia Mingda dared not say much in the crowd because he realized he couldn’t fully gauge Autumn’s strength.","In this situation, even if Jia Mingda were audacious by nature, he wouldn’t dare to provoke trouble. Even though he might be bold, Jia Mingda was also very clever. He was well aware that the current situation in South Face City was different from usual.","Many powerful factions had come to South Face City, and these truly formidable factions might not necessarily fear Xie Lin. Otherwise, with Lin Yuan, an outsider, openly killing experts from the local faction within South Face City, Jia Mingda would inevitably have to make a statement.","Allowing the local factions of South Face City to be killed under their noses would significantly diminish the City Lord’s prestige. However, Jia Mingda dared not speak up due to the circumstances.","After nearly five minutes, not a single faction left the trade fair, so Lin Yuan said bluntly, “Since everyone aims to gain from this trade fair, let’s refrain from causing trouble. Now, all factions should register with Zhao Chen first, then exchange their rightful resources from him.","“Ultimately, the decision to summon is up to your personal discretion, with no coercion involved. However, once a bid is made, it cannot be changed, so there’s no point in bargaining as it won’t lead to any changes in price.”","Lin Yuan raised his hand and released a total of 120 Deposit Vegetable Pods that had taken human form. He let them verify the resources with the factions present before conducting the transaction.","Lin Yuan did not intend to hold a bidding auction like Zhao Chen did when selling talents back then. He had already informed these Deposit Vegetable Pods about the assessment method for pricing.","These Deposit Vegetable Pods simply needed to be exchanged according to the prices set by Lin Yuan. Their role was merely to assist in the transactions.","As Lin Yuan understood the importance of Creator resources to the various factions, he lowered the exchange ratio of various items and spirit qi crystals. This allowed Lin Yuan to use limited spirit qi crystals to exchange for more resources.","Although Lin Yuan had lowered the exchange ratios of various resources with spirit qi crystals, the various factions were still desperately trying to sell all the resources they had once the actual trading began. This was because even if Lin Yuan had raised the ratio, it was still extremely cost-effective for the various factions.","Lin Yuan had sent these Deposit Vegetable Pods to filter the resources. Those resources that were too low grade or not very useful had been filtered out by the Deposit Vegetable Pods.","Zhao Chen was busy at the trade fair and had been communicating with the Deposit Vegetable Pods at the event.","Soon, Zhao Chen realized that the hundreds of millions of spirit qi crystals that Lin Yuan had prepared were probably going to be used up because the various factions had prepared too many resources.","In Zhao Chen’s eyes, the Grade 4 Creator resources that were allocated were much more precious than these raw materials.","Zhao Chen’s heart ached when he saw Lin Yuan.","“Young Master Lin, the spirit qi crystals you prepared are most likely about to be sold out. All the factions have gathered here. Do you think we should end this trade fair? I see that many factions have arranged for people to continue gathering resources. They clearly want to use this opportunity to make a fortune from Young Master Lin.”","Lin Yuan raised an eyebrow at the remark. Zhao Chen clearly presumed too much. It was still uncertain who would truly prosper here!","“If all the spirit qi crystals I prepared previously are used up, I can take out another batch.”","Zhao Chen had always regarded Lin Yuan as extremely mature and shrewd. However, upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, Zhao Chen couldn’t help but feel that Lin Yuan was merely a pampered and sheltered individual.","In Zhao Chen’s opinion, there was no need for Lin Yuan to sell these spirit qi crystals. No matter how many spirit qi crystals the various factions traded with Lin Yuan, they would not remember his kindness.","Seeing Lin Yuan’s attitude, Zhao Chen did not know what to say. If the various factions present knew that he had messed up this trade fair, they would definitely find trouble with him.","The trade fair lasted for three days. Since all the resources that the various factions could exchange for had been exhausted, the entire trade fair officially ended.","Genius was extremely happy with the resources Lin Yuan had obtained from the transaction in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. If it gave these various resources to the Hundred Questions Beast Army, they would be able to advance to a higher level.","...","After the trade fair ended, Lin Yuan did not speak immediately, but none of the people present had any intention of leaving.","Jia Mingda was the first to express his desire to visit Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan did not meet with Jia Mingda. Instead, he let the Deposit Vegetable Pod reply to Jia Mingda arrogantly, “My master has stated a preference for communicating only with the leader of a faction. I’m sorry, but you’re not quite qualified to communicate with him.”","After this Deposit Vegetable Pod replied to Jia Mingda, it said to the various factions present, “Now, everyone should be gathered in South Face City for the top grade blessed land. Any faction that aims to cause trouble and make a quick profit are all inferior factions.","“My master intends to establish an alliance, where we cooperate to compete for this top grade blessed land. This will facilitate mutual trading of resources in the future. If the leaders of the various factions are present and are interested in joining the alliance, come to me. I’ll bring you to meet my master later.”","The Deposit Vegetable Pod’s words made Jia Mingda’s expression change. It turned out that the mysterious youth had set his sights on that top grade blessed land.","Having the ability to casually throw out so many Creator resources, he indeed possessed the confidence to compete for this blessed land. In this manner, the intentions of this young man and Xie Lin seemed to be in perfect harmony. The two sides became competitors.","After all, there was only one top grade blessed land. After thinking about it, Jia Mingda felt that he should go back and tell Xie Lin the information first. In the end, Xie Lin would make the decision himself.","Upon learning about Lin Yuan’s intentions, the expressions of the members from various factions couldn’t help but become complex. Not only did Lin Yuan have the same goal as Xie Lin, the City Lord of South Face City, but he also had the same goal as many factions.","Of course, there were also factions present that Lin Yuan just referred to as inferior.","Indeed, many factions arrived here with the intention of making some extra profit. However, these factions dare not openly cause trouble for Lin Yuan.","Despite knowing their own faction’s limited strength, these factions still harbored the idea of forming an alliance with Lin Yuan. It was for no other reason than to continue trading resources from Lin Yuan in the future.","Ling Muzhuo, the Palace Master of Fortune Treasure Palace, arrived in South Face City a little later, but he still successfully participated in this trade fair.","At that moment, Ling Muzhuo’s heart was filled with a mixture of shock and joy. Ling Muzhuo felt fortunate that he had formed a good relationship with Lin Yuan early on. However, he was surprised because although he had already held Lin Yuan in high regard to the best of his ability, he hadn’t anticipated Lin Yuan’s remarkable capabilities.","Upon arriving in South Face City, Lin Yuan directly adopted the posture of a strong dragon looking to dominate over the local snake.","Originally, Fortune Treasure Palace also wanted to compete for this top grade blessed land. Ling Muzhuo personally led the team along with the experts that Fortune Treasure Palace had spent a lot of resources to consecrate.","Ling Muzhuo knew very well that if Fortune Treasure Palace insisted on fighting for this top grade blessed land, they would become Lin Yuan’s competitors regardless of whether they succeeded or not—this was not the outcome that Ling Muzhuo wanted to see.","Moreover, after evaluating the situation in South Face City, Zhao Chen couldn’t shake off a strange feeling that the circumstances in South Face City were somewhat unusual.","From the strength he currently possessed, it was evident that he didn’t have enough to compete for this top grade blessed land.","At present, most of the people in Fortune Treasure Palace were exploring the abyss, so they could not send experts here.","Ling Muzhuo silently acknowledged that since Fortune Treasure Palace’s chance of obtaining the top grade blessed land was slim, it might be better to lower his sights and not vie for it. Instead, he could choose to assist Lin Yuan and strive to gain more of his friendship.","Ling Muzhuo did not rely on his special relationship with Lin Yuan to contact him directly through the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower.","Ling Muzhuo followed Lin Yuan’s protocol and reported to the Deposit Vegetable Pod. With the decision to give up on competing for the top grade blessed land, Ling Muzhuo suddenly felt a sense of relief. It would not be too late for him to meet Lin Yuan alone after Lin Yuan had interacted with the factions that wanted to cooperate.","In addition to negotiating cooperation, Ling Muzhuo also wanted to discuss with Lin Yuan about the turmoil and crisis in South Face City, as well as his lingering sense of unease.","Ling Muzhuo’s sense of unease did not come out of nowhere, but through some information he had obtained.","Ling Muzhuo secretly thought that by now, Lin Yuan probably had some information. If he provided his own information to Lin Yuan, it would likely be of considerable help to him.","The Ancient Snake Gu Palace, which once brought chaos to the four universes and plunged the West Universe into turmoil, reemerged in the world. It was feared that it would undoubtedly bring about a great deal of bloodshed and turmoil.","As for the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, they were most likely targeting this top grade blessed land. This was because the people from Fortune Treasure Palace had discovered traces of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace when they were investigating this top grade blessed land.","Ancient Snake Gu Palace respected the snake species and ruled other lifeforms with all kinds of Gu. It was unknown how many factions had been infiltrated by Ancient Snake Gu Palace."]},{"number":3104,"title":"Chapter 3104 High-Profile Lin Yuan!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3104 High-Profile Lin Yuan!","Nearly half of the 10,000 factions present already had their own alliances, so it was really inconvenient for them to join Lin Yuan’s side and leave. More than 30% of the faction leaders were in contact with Lin Yuan. It was all worth it just to be able to continue trading Creator resources.","....","Lin Yuan’s original intention of cooperating with these factions was to gather some factions around him. He did not really take these factions seriously. Lin Yuan knew very well that these factions that had chosen to join his alliance had their own ulterior motives. If he believed these people, he would inevitably be stabbed in the back.","If he were in the main world, Lin Yuan would definitely treat the various factions that cooperated with him sincerely. However, now that he understood the survival laws of the Sky Beyond the Clouds more and more, Lin Yuan was no longer so naive.","Lin Yuan looked at the leaders of the various factions and said loudly, “Since you’re willing to join my alliance, you must understand that everything in my alliance will be subject to my will. Should anyone among you find it challenging to adhere to this principle, staying in the alliance might not be suitable.","“As leaders of various factions, the commitments you make represent the intentions of all members of your respective factions. If you decide to join the alliance today, and later someone from your faction violates my will, I will handle the matter decisively and without compromise.”","In the process of various factions forming alliances, those trying to create an alliance often sought to appease the factions, rarely making excessive demands. Unlike Lin Yuan, who insisted that each faction joining the alliance adhere strictly to his will.","Although Lin Yuan did not demand direct control over the factions, his approach effectively required them to submit to his authority in this operation. This immediately sparked discontent among the assembled factions.","An old man with a malicious gaze and a thin frame said, “We are here to seek cooperation, not to be controlled by you. I hope you understand that.”","The elder’s dissatisfaction was evident as he glared at Lin Yuan.","Unfazed, Lin Yuan addressed the other factions, “If anyone shares his sentiments, feel free to step forward now!”","After speaking, Lin Yuan’s sharp gaze swept across the room. Less than one-tenth of the factions objected to his words.","“In our collaboration, it’s crucial to consider each other’s perspectives. How can our cooperation continue smoothly if we only heed one side? Do you all agree?”","The speaker was a middle-aged woman, astutely seeking support from others after her remark. Her words prompted some response from the attendees.","To this woman, Lin Yuan’s statements seemed to infringe upon the interests of various factions.","At the moment, no one spoke out, intimidated by the power Autumn had displayed earlier. Any protest now could likely cause more factions to dissent.","As the middle-aged woman anticipated, the factions opposing Lin Yuan’s proposal visibly increased.","Before she could smile, Lin Yuan waved his hand and said, “If that’s the case, there’s no need for you all to remain here any longer. Leave immediately. If your retreat is too slow, I won’t hesitate to kill all of you. I proposed the idea of the alliance, so the rules of this alliance can only be set by me.”","While Lin Yuan’s approach might appear domineering, he used this method to prioritize eliminating factions with rebellious intentions that couldn’t cooperate.","Lin Yuan had only Spring, Autumn, and Winter under his command. His limited manpower was a weakness, making it essential to gather more people.","The factions that had clamored to leave fell silent after Lin Yuan finished speaking. Most did not choose to leave, doubting that Lin Yuan could eliminate so many with just one expert. As the saying went, “The law does not punish the masses.”","If Lin Yuan dared to act against so many at once, wouldn’t he fear inciting mass retaliation?","Observing their reactions, just as Autumn was about to act, Ling Muzhuo, who had been among the crowd, spoke loudly. “I am the Palace Master of Fortune Treasure Palace. Many of you here know me. Our Fortune Treasure Palace is willing to follow Young Master Lin’s arrangements and cooperate closely in the quest for this top grade blessed land.","“If the factions that have just opposed Young Master Lin’s authority over the alliance don’t leave, our Fortune Treasure Palace will cooperate with Young Master Lin to eliminate them. We’re giving you a chance. I believe none of you want to die.”","Fortune Treasure Palace spanned the four major universes—East, South, North, and West. Although its influence varied by universe, it held overlord status compared to the other factions present.","The factions did not expect Fortune Treasure Palace to express their support for Lin Yuan. They sensed that Ling Muzhuo must have a connection with him. Otherwise, even if he supported Lin Yuan, he wouldn’t have openly threatened to eradicate the opposing factions, a move that would instantly offend them.","Fortune Treasure Palace had always advocated cooperation and harmony, but Ling Muzhuo’s current actions were a stark departure from its traditional values and approach.","With Fortune Treasure Palace joining the alliance, following it seemed wise. The alliance’s strength was now assured.","As Ling Muzhuo spoke, he radiated a fierce aura that swept through the entire scene, causing the factions that had spoken up against Lin Yuan to quickly retreat.","For those factions that didn’t leave despite Ling Muzhuo’s warning, Autumn didn’t hold back. He casually released a few leaves and used them to kill all the troublemakers.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, gentle methods didn’t earn respect. Instead, they often led others to perceive one as weak and exploitable.","Before leaving North of the Lonely River, Lin Yuan had learned a harsh lesson from the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","Lin Yuan looked at Ling Muzhuo but said nothing further.","After negotiating with these factions and forming the alliance, Lin Yuan planned to meet with Ling Muzhuo privately.","Since Lin Yuan’s alliance was established solely for exploring the top grade blessed land, it would lose its cohesion once the exploration was complete. This temporary nature made the factions more willing to join the alliance.","While the leader of the alliance might appear domineering, and regardless of whether he had the power to back it up, the access to Grade 4 Creator resources alone was enough to make the factions within the alliance tolerate it.","A single trade had now placed Lin Yuan in a position of greater power than the City Lord, Xie Lin.","Lin Yuan did not hide the fact that he had formed an alliance. The various factions in South Face City watched helplessly as Lin Yuan’s alliance took shape.","...","Xie Lin couldn’t sit still anymore. “Are you sure that Young Master Lin took out so many Grade 4 Creator resources according to the promise and arrogantly killed those people who caused trouble at the scene?”","Jia Mingda hurriedly said, “City Lord, I brought back all the spirit qi crystals I traded for you. The things the other factions traded with various resources are the same as what we traded.","“That Young Master Lin really doesn’t take Grade 4 Creator resources seriously at all. He cleaned up a wave of troublemakers before the trade fair began. When he formed the alliance, he was also extremely domineering. I’m sure that this Young Master Lin is definitely from a ridiculously powerful faction!”","Xie Lin had never interacted with Lin Yuan personally, and Jia Mingda was Xie Lin’s confidant. Xie Lin fully trusted what Jia Mingda said and didn’t believe for a moment that Jia Mingda would deceive him.","Xie Lin muttered to himself in frustration, wondering about the true background of Lin Yuan. It baffled him that he hadn’t obtained any information at all!","Jia Mingda said in a low voice, “City Lord, Ling Muzhuo of Fortune Treasure Palace should know Young Master Lin’s background. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have supported Young Master Lin in front of so many factions. If you really want to know Young Master Lin’s identity, we can actually contact him.","“Your relationship with Fortune Treasure Palace has always been quite good, and Fortune Treasure Palace also has influence within our South Face City. You are also a special guest of Fortune Treasure Palace. I believe if Palace Master Ling knew about Lin Yuan’s identity, he wouldn’t hide it from you, even if he kept it from others!”","Hearing that, Xie Lin thought for a moment and said, “It’s meaningless for me to ask about Young Master Lin from Ling Muzhuo. However, it’s indeed possible to use Ling Muzhuo’s connections to reach out and establish some contact with him.”","Jia Mingda could not help but whisper, “City Lord, what we’re doing is also for that top grade blessed land, where there are things we must obtain. This Lin Yuan is, to us, essentially a competitor. Do you really need to reach out to him?”","Upon hearing this, Xie Lin snorted and said unhappily, “After all these years, you still haven’t broadened your perspective and only see things at face value. Before we ultimately compete for this top grade blessed land, how can there be any so-called competitors?","“Young Master Lin has indeed formed an alliance, but the members of this alliance are scattered and lack unity. How many factions in this alliance can truly be loyal to him? He is still too young to realize this. He exchanged so many resources for such a loose alliance. Perhaps I might be able to obtain some benefits by befriending such a foolish kid.","“You know better than me how much pure spirit qi we need. The spirit qi crystals you traded this time should be enough to revive the Snake Lords. If we can seize some additional opportunities to obtain more spirit qi crystals to revive the four Snake Lords, the competition for the top grade blessed land will basically be assured!”","Xie Lin paused for a moment, then continued. “It would be best for Young Master Lin to withdraw from the competition for this top grade blessed land as early as possible. This way, we can maintain the channel for trading Creator resources. I don’t want to ruin this rare channel unless absolutely necessary.","“Mingda, help me contact Ling Muzhuo. Tell him I wish to invite him for a discussion at the City Lord Manor. Make sure he helps me extend an invitation to Young Master Lin as well.”","Hearing this, Jia Mingda felt somewhat dissatisfied. How could he have been so short-sighted? But in front of Xie Lin, Jia Mingda didn’t dare to argue back and could only reluctantly follow Xie Lin’s arrangement.","...","Lin Yuan didn’t bother with the factions that joined the alliance. He understood well that as long as he held the Grade 4 Creator resources, these factions would be dependent on him. Regardless of how he managed them now, these factions wouldn’t truly pledge allegiance to him.","Lin Yuan poured two cups of Three Treasures Tea from the main world and poured them into the cups in front of Zhao Chen and Ling Muzhuo, “Brother Zhao, Brother Ling, try this tea!”","Although Lin Yuan had brought the Three Treasures Tea from the main world, the ingredients for brewing the Three Treasures Tea had already been nurtured by Lin Yuan using the best Creator resources available to him.","Lin Yuan had already evolved the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. Every osmanthus flower produced by the Cinnabar Sweet Osmanthus was a supreme treasure.","Zhao Chen had drunk Lin Yuan’s wine before, and the Three Treasures Tea was as shocking to him as the spirit wine he had drunk back then.","Upon being treated to Lin Yuan’s Three Treasures Tea, Ling Muzhuo gained a clear understanding of Lin Yuan’s refined lifestyle.","Ling Muzhuo said with a smile, “Brother Lin, I’ve known you for quite some time. In my impression, you’ve always kept a low profile. I never expected that when you decide to be high-profile, you would exude such dominance. I am afraid that your single statement that intimidated countless factions is bound to become widely known throughout the Sky Beyond the Clouds!”","Ling Muzhuo was not just flattering Lin Yuan. He was genuinely surprised by Lin Yuan’s actions today. It turned out that the usually low-key guy in his impression could actually make such a high-profile move.","Upon hearing this, Lin Yuan smiled and said, “Brother Ling, I don’t believe that you can’t tell that those factions are willing to stay in the alliance because they fancy the Creator resources I have. To be honest with you, I’m not prepared to manage this alliance.","“It’s just that I have too few people on hand, and I need more manpower to compete for this top grade blessed land. The reason they can be so obedient is that Autumn has enough strength. If not for this, I’m afraid there would have been trouble before the trade fair even began.”","Ling Muzhuo couldn’t help but praise Lin Yuan inwardly. Despite his youth, he displayed neither arrogance nor rashness, leaving a profound impression on Ling Muzhuo. In his view, even the descendants of those hidden factions couldn’t hold a candle to Lin Yuan.","Since it was now clear that Lin Yuan was determined to compete for this top grade blessed land, Ling Muzhuo voiced his thoughts to Lin Yuan."]},{"number":3105,"title":"Chapter 3105 Ling Muzhuo’s Plan!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3105 Ling Muzhuo’s Plan!","“Brother Lin, to be honest, I initially came here to compete for this prime blessed land. However, if you have decided to contend for it, Fortune Treasure Palace will withdraw from the competition. I am willing to mobilize all our resources to support you in securing this top grade blessed land.","....","“I’ve gathered extensive information about South Face City, which I will now share with you. Have you heard of a faction called Ancient Snake Gu Palace?”","Lin Yuan was surprised by Ling Muzhuo’s statement. He hadn’t expected Ling Muzhuo to give up his pursuit of this valuable land for his sake.","Previously, Lin Yuan didn’t take Fortune Treasure Palace or Ling Muzhuo very seriously. He viewed the faction merely as a resource provider and thought Ling Muzhuo’s friendship was based solely on his Creator resources.","However, Ling Muzhuo’s offer made Lin Yuan reconsider his opinion. With Fortune Treasure Palace showing genuine support, Lin Yuan’s attitude towards them would naturally improve.","When Ling Muzhuo mentioned the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, Autumn’s expression changed.","Before Lin Yuan could respond to Ling Muzhuo, he heard Autumn’s voice transmission. “Young Master, the Ancient Snake Gu Palace is a faction formed by the ten major snake species. They gathered all the poisonous insects in the world, making the palace exceptionally powerful.","“A few eras ago, the Ancient Snake Gu Palace caused significant catastrophes. Its foundation is comparable to that of Faerie Institution. If this top grade blessed land is connected to the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, the City Lord of South Face City is likely linked to them as well.”","Lin Yuan initially intended to tell Ling Muzhuo that he wasn’t familiar with the Ancient Snake Gu Palace. However, after Autumn’s explanation, he spoke to Ling Muzhuo. “I have heard of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, but I thought they had withdrawn from the world. Could it be that they have resurfaced in South Face City to compete for this prime blessed land?”","If Lin Yuan was unaware of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, showing such a reaction was perfectly understandable. However, if Lin Yuan has heard of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, he should know what it signified.","How could Lin Yuan show no surprise upon hearing about it? It did seem rather unusual. Could it be that the Ancient Snake Gu Palace still wasn’t enough to pressure Lin Yuan?","Ling Muzhuo had decided to relinquish the competition for this top grade blessed land partly because of Lin Yuan and partly because of the appearance of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace. He dared not guarantee that the manpower he brought could defeat the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.","A faction that had been hidden for so many years suddenly reemerging undoubtedly had ulterior motives, and these motives were likely significant.","Ling Muzhuo reminded Lin Yuan, “The Ancient Snake Gu Palace is ruthless. If they set their sights on this top grade blessed land, there’s a high chance that the factions in South Face City who are interested in fighting for it will be attacked by the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.","“The Ancient Snake Gu Palace is extremely skilled at controlling other lifeforms. Brother Lin, if we’re involved, we’re just as much prey to them. You mustn’t let your guard down!","“In the past, our Fortune Treasure Palace had dealings with the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, and it’s safe to say we were thoroughly deceived by them. There are several Snake Kings in the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, each of whom possesses strength far surpassing that of the Holy Spirit level.”","Upon hearing Ling Muzhuo’s reminder, Lin Yuan said, “I suspect that the City Lord of South Face City has something to do with the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.”","Lin Yuan didn’t shy away from Zhao Chen, who was sitting beside him. Instead, he directly addressed both of them, discussing the information he possessed.","Zhao Chen and Ling Muzhuo could be considered old acquaintances. While Zhao Chen held a noble status within Diverse City, outside the city, there was still a slight disparity in status between Zhao Chen and Ling Muzhuo.","Zhao Chen’s family was active at the border between the East Universe and the South Universe, so Zhao Chen was quite knowledgeable about the situation at the border. However, he did not know much about factions like the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.","Lin Yuan and Ling Muzhuo’s conversation sounded like thunder to Zhao Chen’s ears, as if he were a duck listening to thunder. However, Zhao Chen was aware of Xie Lin. The latter actually came from a cruel and powerful hidden faction.","Zhao Chen listened attentively to Lin Yuan and Ling Muzhuo’s conversation and quickly digested this information.","At that moment, he heard Ling Muzhuo say to him, “City Lord Zhao, the information you heard today is a secret to us. I hope you won’t reveal this information. If this news is leaked, it will definitely bring you a lot of trouble.”","Zhao Chen hurriedly said, “If Palace Master Ling hadn’t mentioned this, I might have divulged the information. But now that I have your assurance, I won’t disclose it, not even to my family. You can trust me on that!”","After instructing Zhao Chen, Ling Muzhuo lowered his head and asked Lin Yuan solemnly, “Brother Lin, why did you determine that Xie Lin is from the Ancient Snake Gu Palace?”","Although Xie Lin did have the bloodline of the snake species, it was somewhat arbitrary to make such a judgment just based on his bloodline. The Ancient Snake Gu Palace had been in seclusion, and Xie Lin had been serving as the City Lord of South Face City for many years.","Lin Yuan did not tell Ling Muzhuo and Zhao Chen that he had annihilated the star pirate group alliance composed of 50 snake-species feys. He only smiled mysteriously.","“I have my own method of judging. It won’t be hard to verify what I’ve said. I anticipate that the City Lord of South Face City will soon seek to reach out and communicate with me.”","Lin Yuan then said, “Brother Zhao, you’re also a City Lord. Even though South Face City is a mega city at the border of two major universes and has a very strong martial force, this martial force is not solely confined to the hands of Xie Lin. Since Xie Lin dared to fight for this top grade blessed land, he must have some backing.","“When I meet with Xie Lin, I will further assess his identity. In the current chaotic situation, it’s better to be patient than to act impulsively. We just need to quietly wait for the situation to unfold.”","With that, Lin Yuan picked up the Three Treasures Tea and began to savor it.","Zhao Chen had been preoccupied with thoughts of the internal injuries his father had suffered, but he refrained from broaching the idea of trading for Grade 5 Creator resources with Lin Yuan at that moment.","If he really wanted to trade Grade 5 Creator resources, he would definitely have to wait until Lin Yuan was done fighting for this top grade blessed land.","Zhao Chen couldn’t help but feel some regret for divulging the news about the opening of a top grade blessed land in South Face City. He feared that Lin Yuan might die in the pursuit of top grade blessed land.","If such a scenario were to happen, his father would not only fail to recover, but he would also lose a channel for trading Grade 5 Creator resources.","...","As Lin Yuan had predicted, shortly after Ling Muzhuo ended his conversation with Lin Yuan and left, Jia Mingda, the executive officer from the City Lord Manor, approached Ling Muzhuo. Jia Mingda politely expressed his desire for Ling Muzhuo to introduce Lin Yuan through the connections of Fortune Treasure Palace.","Ling Muzhuo looked at Jia Mingda with a scrutinizing gaze, recalling Lin Yuan’s suspicion that Xie Lin might belong to the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.","Under normal circumstances, Ling Muzhuo wouldn’t act as a middleman, bringing members of other factions directly to Lin Yuan. The complex relationships behind each faction made such a role inappropriate.","However, since Lin Yuan had already expressed his intention to contact Xie Lin and wanted to confirm his identity through direct contact, Ling Muzhuo was willing to help.","Smiling, Ling Muzhuo responded to Jia Mingda’s request. “I remember seeing you at the trade fair earlier. Why didn’t you join the alliance then? Now you need me to introduce you to Young Master Lin? If you had joined the alliance earlier, couldn’t you have communicated with him directly?”","Jia Mingda replied awkwardly, “I am a subordinate of the City Lord. How could I casually join another person’s alliance? If I did and incurred the displeasure of the City Lord, I wouldn’t be able to bear the consequences. I hope Palace Master Ling won’t tease me anymore!”","Feigning seriousness, Ling Muzhuo asked, “Our Fortune Treasure Palace has a branch in South Face City. Although our branch is often plundered there, it’s thanks to City Lord Xie’s care that our losses haven’t escalated further.","“I’d like to know, is City Lord Xie truly interested in contending for this top grade blessed land? Our Fortune Treasure Palace is also here with the intention of competing for it.”","Jia Mingda’s tone was firm. “Palace Master Ling, our City Lord is determined to secure this top grade blessed land. It’s essential for him to obtain it, and he doesn’t wish to sour relations with you over this matter. I hope you won’t make it difficult for him. If possible, you can even cooperate with our City Lord. If he obtains this top grade blessed land, he will definitely reward you handsomely!”","Ling Muzhuo observed Jia Mingda’s confident expression and asked curiously, “In these years of development in South Face City, it seems Lord Xie has undoubtedly amassed considerable strength to even consider competing with the heroes arriving from all over. Fortune Treasure Palace lacks such boldness!","“Nevertheless, even if we fail to seize this top grade blessed land, we must still contend for the resources within. Regarding collaboration, I am quite intrigued by the extent of Xie Lin’s influence. Fortune Treasure Palace doesn’t ally with the feeble. If Xie Lin is confident in his strength, he can approach me.”","Having already partnered with Lin Yuan, Ling Muzhuo was unlikely to cooperate with Xie Lin. His question was mainly intended as a probe.","After Ling Muzhuo made it clear that he was determined to fight for the resources in the top grade blessed land, Jia Mingda unexpectedly showed hostility toward him.","The fleeting hostility Ling Muzhuo sensed from Jia Mingda suggested one thing: Jia Mingda believed Xie Lin’s power could rival that of Fortune Treasure Palace.","Ling Muzhuo couldn’t understand where Jia Mingda’s confidence came from, but subconscious emotional expressions like this were usually genuine and couldn’t be faked. He began to trust Lin Yuan’s words.","After a brief probing, Ling Muzhuo said, “Your City Lord is an honored guest of Fortune Treasure Palace. Coincidentally, so is Young Master Lin. There’s no issue with introducing them. However, how does your City Lord plan to contact Young Master Lin?","“Lin Yuan is our esteemed guest at Fortune Treasure Palace. Poor hospitality on our part could jeopardize the relationship between Lin Yuan and Fortune Treasure Palace if I were to introduce him elsewhere.”","Jia Mingda felt somewhat dissatisfied with Ling Muzhuo’s attitude. As a member of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, even as a subordinate, Jia Mingda harbored considerable pride.","“The City Lord has already arranged a banquet at the City Lord Manor. He wishes to invite Palace Master Ling and Young Master Lin. Could you please inform me of your intended time of attendance?”","Ling Muzhuo responded with a faint smile. “Heh, it seems City Lord Xie sees me merely as a tool to entertain Young Master Lin. It’s the first time I’ve heard of a banquet arranged to entertain two distinguished guests.”","Though Ling Muzhuo spoke politely, giving Xie Lin a lot of respect, he was actually extremely dissatisfied with Xie Lin.","Fortune Treasure Palace had suffered significant losses in South Face City over the years.","Not only were Fortune Treasure Palace’s caravans frequently plundered, but two of the leaders sent to South Face City had died within 1,000 years. These leaders were vital assets painstakingly cultivated by Fortune Treasure Palace. Ling Muzhuo had personally asked Xie Lin about this matter, but Xie Lin had not provided a response, leaving Ling Muzhuo extremely dissatisfied.","Despite Ling Muzhuo’s repeated belittling remarks, Jia Mingda clearly ignored them. Ling Muzhuo had decided to ask Xie Lin for an explanation in person when they met.","To avoid disrupting the main agenda, Ling Muzhuo chose not to further trouble Jia Mingda. Before Jia Mingda could speak, Ling Muzhuo said, “In two hours, I’ll accompany Young Master Lin to the banquet. Ensure your City Lord hosts Young Master Lin well.”","After saying that, Ling Muzhuo left to inform Lin Yuan of the situation.","...","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “I originally thought the City Lord of South Face City would ask to meet me alone. Since he’s invited Brother Ling as well, it’s perfect. When I test the City Lord later, you can observe and judge whether my suspicions are correct.","“I’m not here in South Face City just to compete for this top grade blessed land. Besides Autumn, there are others with me, including my subordinates in the City Lord Manor.","“Brother Ling, you might not know, but Xie Lin’s alliance includes a large number of snake-species feys. These snake-species feys are obviously not all from external factions. If they were, why would they be gathered and controlled by the City Lord of South Face City? Xie Lin’s connection to the Ancient Snake Gu Palace is almost certain in my eyes.","“After you left, Brother Zhao and I discussed further, and he also senses something suspicious about Xie Lin. If our meeting with Xie Lin confirms his link to the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, what are your plans, Brother Ling?”"]},{"number":3106,"title":"Chapter 3106 Mental Gu!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3106 Mental Gu!","....","Upon hearing this, Ling Muzhuo laughed. “I’m going to help Brother Lin fight for this top grade blessed land this time. Xie Lin’s identity is not important to me. Even if it’s truly confirmed that he’s associated with the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, if he wants to compete with you, Brother Lin, I will still lead Fortune Treasure Palace to help you.”","Ling Muzhuo was a courageous and intelligent person. Since he had already decided to help Lin Yuan compete for the top grade blessed land, he would not hesitate in his actions.","If Xie Lin was really from the Ancient Snake Gu Palace and had great ambitions for this top grade blessed land, Fortune Treasure Palace itself would probably become the target of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace. No one would concede when facing resources of such caliber!","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “Brother Ling, thank you for your help. I will definitely repay you handsomely after this is done!”","Ling Muzhuo said generously, “Brother Lin, your gratitude will surely have its own significance, but what I value more than your gratitude is the friendship with you. I believe you can sense that my intention in befriending you has always been different from how Fortune Treasure Palace treats its special honor guests. My intention behind befriending you can represent both Fortune Treasure Palace and myself personally.”","Hearing Ling Muzhuo and Lin Yuan’s conversation, Zhao Chen, who was sitting at the side, could not help but feel envious.","Zhao Chen also intended to befriend Lin Yuan as boldly as Ling Muzhuo, but Zhao Chen was limited by his family and did not possess the same abilities as Ling Muzhuo. Moreover, many times Zhao Chen could not represent his family clan in making commitments to Lin Yuan.","In the end, Zhao Chen said, “Brother Lin, you’re aware of my situation. In many matters, I have to follow the instructions of my family. I’m not the decision-maker for the family, so I can’t represent them. However, from a personal standpoint, I’m willing to do everything I can to help you.”","When Zhao Chen said these words, he felt somewhat embarrassed as he realized that his words seemed too empty. In the past, Zhao Chen always had absolute confidence when communicating with anyone. But now, while talking with Lin Yuan, Zhao Chen felt an emotion he had never experienced before.","Lin Yuan patted Zhao Chen’s shoulder. “Brother Zhao, if it weren’t for you, I wouldn’t have known about the opening of this top grade blessed land so quickly. Compared to befriending your family, your personal friendship is more than enough for me. Your family will surely take action when fighting for this top grade blessed land.","“Brother Zhao, there’s no need to worry too much. Whether you stick with your family or join me, it’s all good. However, I have to be clear about this. If you choose to accompany me and act together with me, I can’t guarantee your safety. But after everything is done, I will still express my gratitude.”","Lin Yuan had never considered coercing Zhao Chen into cooperation. If he wanted Zhao Chen’s cooperation, he could have pressured him into it. However, Lin Yuan had no intention of doing so.","Zhao Chen was extremely touched by Lin Yuan’s words and began to ponder.","In the end, Zhao Chen said firmly, “Brother Lin, I’d like to cooperate with you this time. I’ll inform my family about it.”","With that, Zhao Chen left and prepared to communicate with his family.","Apart from communicating with his family, there was another important reason why Zhao Chen decided to leave, and that was because he knew that he and Ling Muzhuo were on different levels. If Lin Yuan had anything to say to Ling Muzhuo, it would be quite inappropriate for him to stay there.","Zhao Chen suddenly had an idea to accumulate as much strength as possible.","Ling Muzhuo said after Zhao Chen left. “Brother Lin, despite being the City Lord of Diverse City, Zhao Chen’s position mainly relies on the power of his family. In the battle for this top grade blessed land, Zhao Chen won’t be of much help.”","Although Ling Muzhuo’s tone didn’t show overt disdain, it was evident that he didn’t hold Zhao Chen in high regard.","Lin Yuan did not continue discussing this topic with Ling Muzhuo. In fact, rather than seeking to cooperate with Zhao Chen, Lin Yuan was more interested in nurturing him.","Lin Yuan could sense that Zhao Chen was already thinking of relying on him. Regardless of whether it was the relationship between South Face City and Diverse City, it was very beneficial to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan had asked Zhao Chen to help him organize the auction, and Zhao Chen had completed the mission perfectly. Now, Zhao Chen had begun to lean toward aligning with him over his family. In this situation, Lin Yuan was willing to give Zhao Chen a chance.","Supported by the presence of Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter, Lin Yuan’s side likely boasted superior high-end combat capabilities compared to Fortune Treasure Palace.","Nonetheless, in terms of information networks and social connections, Fortune Treasure Palace held a significant advantage over him. Sky City could not even compare to many third-rate factions in terms of connections and information channels.","Fortunately, Sky City had recruited so many Grade 4 and 5 Creators. Each of them was equivalent to a network of connections. However, even if he controlled these high-grade Creators through the Lifespan Mouse, Lin Yuan could not possibly allow them to be sent out.","“Brother Ling, it’s about time. Bring me to the City Lord Manor to meet this City Lord of South Face City. Didn’t you just say that I was high-profile? Well, I intend to be even more high-profile and arrogant when I meet him.”","Lin Yuan was certain of Xie Lin’s identity. Upon arriving in South Face City, he swiftly annihilated Xie Lin’s alliance of 50 star pirates. If Xie Lin learned of this, he and Lin Yuan would instantly become archenemies.","Therefore, there was no need for Lin Yuan to forge a friendship with Xie Lin. Of course, the most crucial reason was that Lin Yuan looked down on Xie Lin and was greatly repulsed by his actions as a City Lord.","Even if Xie Lin really wasn’t a member of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace and had no intention of competing for the top grade blessed land, Lin Yuan’s attitude toward him would remain unchanged.","Ling Muzhuo was somewhat surprised by Lin Yuan’s boldness, as Lin Yuan had just mentioned that Xie Lin was likely a member of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.","Lin Yuan’s plan to confront Xie Lin with an arrogant attitude showed that he didn’t regard the Ancient Snake Gu Palace as a threat.","From their recent conversation, Ling Muzhuo could tell that Lin Yuan was well aware of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace’s information. This suggested that Lin Yuan believed the faction behind him was stronger than the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, so he didn’t regard the Ancient Snake Gu Palace as a significant threat.","Ling Muzhuo felt that he had to remind Lin Yuan, “If the Ancient Snake Gu Palace really intends to snatch this top grade blessed land, they will send at least two Snake Lords. Apart from me, no one else in our Fortune Treasure Palace can compete with the Snake Lords of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.","“Furthermore, their use of poison is extraordinarily unpredictable. Therefore, we have to be extremely careful when dealing with the Ancient Snake Gu Palace!”","Lin Yuan could sense the gravity in Ling Muzhuo’s words.","He didn’t underestimate the Ancient Snake Gu Palace. However, since he had chosen to compete for the top grade blessed land against it, he couldn’t afford to show any weakness. How could Ling Muzhuo, who had actively partnered with him, feel reassured otherwise?","“Brother Ling, thank you for the reminder. I’m well aware of the strength of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace. If I realize that I can’t compete with it, I will inform you immediately. Then, we can discuss whether to cooperate with the Ancient Snake Gu Palace or withdraw from the competition.”","Lin Yuan spoke with confidence.","When Autumn heard Ling Muzhuo mention the Snake Lord of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, he told Lin Yuan with a tone of disdain, “Young Master, although the Snake Lords of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace are strong, they’re not a concern for us.","“Spring’s ability is particularly effective against creatures that use poison. The Ancient Snake Gu Palace has been secluded for many years. Even at its peak, the Ancient Snake Gu Palace was not a significant threat. There’s still a gap between the truly powerful factions in the Sky Beyond the Clouds and the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.","“I used to think that Fortune Treasure Palace had influence across the four universes and connections with various factions, suggesting a deep foundation. But considering Fortune Treasure Palace’s attitude toward the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, I think we might have overestimated their influence. Alternatively, Ling Muzhuo might be overly cautious.”","Autumn’s disdainful words made Lin Yuan feel calm. Despite Autumn’s apparent arrogance, he always acted prudently. His dismissive attitude toward the Ancient Snake Gu Palace indicated that he did not view them as serious competitors for the top grade blessed land.","Lin Yuan’s confident response boosted Ling Muzhuo’s morale.","...","Regardless of Xie Lin’s background, he treated Lin Yuan and Ling Muzhuo with great importance. He personally led his two adjutants to the door to wait for their arrival.","While waiting, Xie Lin’s eyes were filled with curiosity and calculation.","An adjutant who had never interacted with Lin Yuan asked Xie Lin in a puzzled tone, “Lord, we’ve formed an alliance with various factions. Now is a critical time to invest in managing the alliance. Why are we receiving an outsider at this crucial moment?","“This outsider has already formed his own alliance and clearly intends to compete for this blessed land. Instead of befriending him, shouldn’t we focus on how to deal with him? The Snake Lord is about to arrive. We should ensure the alliance is stable for him.”","Xie Lin glared at the adjutant. “Do I need you to tell me what to do? Whether the Snake Lords come or not, you only need to follow my orders. In South Face City, I am the City Lord. In the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, I rank two levels above you. If you dare to question my decisions again, you can become the leader of a star pirate group!”","Xie Lin turned to Jia Mingda. “Tell him about the benefits you gained from the last transaction with Young Master Lin. Securing more pure spirit qi will please the Snake Lords more than managing this alliance.","“Half of our allies are mere servants and cannon fodder, while the rest are food for the Snake Lords. What’s there to manage? Among them, I’ve identified a few promising individuals with decent strength.","“Unfortunately, they’re likely not of our species or the insect species. When the time comes, I’ll have the Snake Lords arrange for a few Mental Gu to control them. Our Ancient Snake Gu Palace has been dormant for many years. We need to replenish our snake servants.”","As he spoke, Xie Lin looked longingly at the City Lord Manor behind him. After this operation, he would expose his identity as the Guardian of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, so he was likely not qualified to be the City Lord of South Face City anymore.","The Ancient Snake Gu Palace had always been frowned upon by official factions across the four universes due to its excessive penchant for killing. Furthermore, during the heyday of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, it had slaughtered the representatives of the official factions in the four universes.","Xie Lin couldn’t help but feel somewhat reluctant about the impending loss of his position as the City Lord of South Face City.","Hearing that, Yang Xuzhang didn’t dare to say anything else for fear of angering Xie Lin. The Ancient Snake Gu Palace was a faction that was extremely particular about seniority. The higher-ups could easily take the lives of the low-ranking members. If Xie Lin intended to kill him, he wouldn’t even be able to resist.","This time, Xie Lin had invited Ling Muzhuo with his identity as the City Lord to bring Lin Yuan over.","Firstly, he wanted to establish contact with Lin Yuan and see if there was any possibility of Lin Yuan cooperating with the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.","Secondly, he had also prepared a batch of resources. He wanted to use his personal identity to exchange these resources for pure spirit qi from Lin Yuan.","Xie Lin had always excelled at infiltrating the camp. Otherwise, with strength comparable to Jia Mingda and Yang Xuzhang, there would be no reason for him to become a Guardian in the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.","Once assigned to South Face City by the faction, he ascended to the position of City Lord, firmly subduing Jia Mingda and Yang Xuzhang.","If he could personally deliver a batch of pure spiritual qi crystals to the Snake Lords, they would undoubtedly be pleased, and Xie Lin would likely gain from it as well.","With these thoughts, Xie Lin was enthusiastic upon meeting Lin Yuan, greeting him with a hearty laugh. “You must be the renowned Young Master Lin, correct? Your arrival in South Face City for this trade fair has benefited numerous factions.","“Almost all the factions near South Face City are now talking about you. It’s said that those who didn’t attend the trade fair are regretting it. Young Master Lin, your reputation and influence here have already surpassed mine as the City Lord.”","Regardless of Xie Lin’s intentions, his words to Lin Yuan were impeccable. However, Lin Yuan did not forget his purpose for visiting.","As the saying wenr, “Don’t bite the hand that feeds you.”","Despite Xie Lin’s smiling demeanor, Lin Yuan remained boldly assertive. “I heard Brother Ling mention you on the way here. Your name is Xie Lin, right? What you said is only half true.”","Lin Yuan’s tone was calm, without a hint of emotion, yet his words made it clear to Xie Lin that Lin Yuan didn’t take him seriously at all."]},{"number":3107,"title":"Chapter 3107 Spirit World Barrier Turtle!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3107 Spirit World Barrier Turtle!","Not only did this young fellow, who hadn’t even lived a century, address him by name, but he also claimed that he had only spoken half the truth.","Xie Lin’s words were meant as compliments, yet somehow, they were misinterpreted. However, Xie Lin didn’t become hostile due to Lin Yuan’s attitude. After all, Xie Lin had never expected Lin Yuan to be so young!","Even as someone from the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, Xie Lin didn’t dare to underestimate Lin Yuan, who could mobilize so many high-grade Creator resources and provide for tens of thousands of people at such a young age. In fact, he even found Lin Yuan’s attitude acceptable.","“I wonder, Young Master Lin, which of my words do you think I misspoke? I welcome your guidance and teachings.”","Lin Yuan had heard from Ling Muzhuo that Xie Lin had a bad temper and was extremely strict in his actions. Lin Yuan’s words were actually meant to gauge Xie Lin’s attitude toward him.","Now that Lin Yuan had assessed that Xie Lin’s attitude toward him was relatively favorable, it indicated that Xie Lin approved of his capabilities. He just didn’t know how Xie Lin would react if he knew that the 50 star pirates under him had been wiped out by Lin Yuan.","“Since you want to know, I’ll tell you. Before coming to South Face City, I couldn’t care less about your reputation and power as the City Lord here. But now that I’m here, your reputation and authority in South Face City will naturally be inferior to mine.","“I heard from Brother Ling that you want to invite me to a banquet. My time is very precious. Don’t make me feel that your banquet is a waste of my time!”","No matter how highly Xie Lin thought of Lin Yuan’s background, he was red-faced with anger upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words. What did he mean by his time was precious? Wasn’t his time valuable too?","This was the first time Xie Lin had encountered such arrogance from a young person. Prior to this, Xie Lin had only interacted with Ling Muzhuo, who in his impression, was very arrogant.","Now, Xie Lin was very curious about how Ling Muzhuo had befriended Lin Yuan. From the looks of it, the two of them had a good relationship. Lin Yuan had even addressed Ling Muzhuo as Big Brother Ling.","Suppressing his displeasure, Xie Lin said, “Young Master Lin, your work is indeed not something I can compare to. The banquet is ready, and I believe you must be curious about the current situation in South Face City, aren’t you?","“As the City Lord, I know the situation in South Face City best. I can explain it to you in detail and share some information about this top grade blessed land with you.","“From the moment the phenomenon appeared, I’ve been paying attention to the situation of this top grade blessed land. No faction knows it better than me. However, I believe Palace Master Ling and Young Master Lin won’t let me reveal such precious information for nothing.”","Before Lin Yuan could speak, Ling Muzhuo frowned and addressed Xie Lin. “Rumors about this top grade blessed land are widespread. Numerous local factions in South Face City have been aware of it from the beginning.","“Our Fortune Treasure Palace doesn’t depend solely on you for this information, City Lord Xie. I didn’t request any favors when I introduced Young Master Lin to you. Now, you’re trying to call in favors from me!","“If you genuinely want to befriend me and Young Master Lin, then you should directly provide us with information about the top grade blessed land.","“We’re all competing for this top grade blessed land based on our own abilities. Even if you share this information with us, how would it affect your City Lord Manor?”","Ling Muzhuo was well aware his words might offend Xie Lin. However, he chose to speak out because he needed to support Lin Yuan and couldn’t let him face the situation alone. If both he and Lin Yuan adopted a firm stance, even if Lin Yuan’s words struck a nerve with Xie Lin later, Xie Lin wouldn’t react explosively. Ling Muzhuo wouldn’t have dared to be so confrontational otherwise.","Fortune Treasure Palace would still need to establish branches in South Face City in the future. A major city like this, located at the border of two universes, was a crucial strategic resource for Fortune Treasure Palace.","Besides aiding Lin Yuan, Ling Muzhuo also felt some discontent toward Xie Lin’s attitude. If Xie Lin expected gratitude after dismissing him with superficial information, wouldn’t that be treating him like a fool?","Hearing Ling Muzhuo’s words, Xie Lin looked at him in surprise.","In Xie Lin’s eyes, no matter how esteemed Lin Yuan’s background or how arrogant he was, Lin Yuan had no foundation in South Face City. Xie Lin considered leveraging information about the top grade blessed land for practical benefits.","With Ling Muzhuo disrupting the situation, Xie Lin, feeling dissatisfied, could only smile and respond. “Besides the information known to various factions, there are also some secretive details known only to me.","“Palace Master Ling, if you say otherwise, you would be unjustly accusing me. I have no intention of withholding these exclusive details from you and Young Master Lin.”","Xie Lin thought the matter would end there, but Ling Muzhuo persisted. “I wonder what exclusive information City Lord Xie is referring to?”","At this point, Xie Lin’s dissatisfaction with Ling Muzhuo had peaked. However, he realized he couldn’t avoid addressing the situation without revealing some genuine information.","“According to reliable sources, apart from the factions in the South and East Universe, some factions in the West Universe and North Universe are also interested in fighting for this top grade blessed land.","“These include the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, Abyssal Beast Domain, and Faerie Institution. Top grade blessed lands are very beneficial to higher faeries. Faerie Institution will send at least two higher faeries. I don’t suppose Palace Master Ling has heard of this information before, right?”","Xie Lin was right. Ling Muzhuo hadn’t heard this information before. If he had, he would have informed Lin Yuan, especially since he was committed to assisting him.","Ling Muzhuo had initially doubted Lin Yuan’s claim about Xie Lin’s affiliation with the Ancient Snake Gu Palace. However, with this new information, Ling Muzhuo keenly felt that Lin Yuan’s claim was likely true.","Even if Xie Lin wasn’t directly affiliated with the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, he must still be connected to a vast and ancient faction. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have had access to this kind of information.","Determined to verify further, Ling Muzhuo said, “City Lord Xie, while there’s much I may not know, I also possess information that you may not. If I share this with you, it will be a fair exchange.”","Hiding his anger, Xie Lin smiled and said, “Trading information can be beneficial, but it’s crucial to ensure that the exchanged intelligence is of equal value for both sides.”","While Ling Muzhuo maintained a calm demeanor on the surface, he had already begun to activate his soul power. Once the emotions of Xie Lin and the two retainers beside him fluctuated violently, Ling Muzhuo would be able to sense it immediately.","“City Lord Xie, I believe you should approve of the credibility of our Fortune Treasure Palace’s intelligence sources. I’ve heard that the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, this ancient and malevolent faction, has resurfaced and intends to vie for this top grade blessed land.”","After uttering these words, Ling Muzhuo keenly sensed that Xie Lin’s emotions were undergoing intense fluctuations. However, the fluctuation didn’t last, as Xie Lin swiftly suppressed it once again, almost in an instant.","Unlike Xie Lin, his two attendants didn’t immediately suppress their surprise. Instead, they cast scrutinizing glances, as if their inner thoughts had been exposed.","Ling Muzhuo’s ability to sense emotions was related to his contracted fey. Now, he was increasingly confident about Xie Lin’s background.","Thinking of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace’s way of doing things and the losses suffered by Fortune Treasure Palace in South Face City over the years, Ling Muzhuo had a sense of having discovered the main culprit. No wonder there had been no peace in South Face City. It was most likely Xie Lin’s doing.","“Oh? I haven’t heard of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace. But if they’ve set their sights on this top grade blessed land, then there’s no doubt that this land will be theirs. When the various factions vie for it, the outcome will undoubtedly be in favor of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.”","At that moment, Lin Yuan once again displayed his arrogant demeanor.","“It seems you not only know about the Ancient Snake Gu Palace but also have a deep understanding of it. Otherwise, you wouldn’t be so confident in the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.","“I remember your adjutant saying that you also have the intention to fight for this top grade blessed land. If you think so highly of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, why are you still fighting for this top grade blessed land?","“Moreover, since you know that the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, Abyssal Beast Domain, and Faerie Institution will also contend for this top grade blessed land, do you think that the Ancient Snake Gu Palace is stronger than these three factions?","“City Lord Xie, if you’re afraid of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace and know that you don’t have the ability to compete with it, why don’t you cooperate with me and Palace Master Ling?”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, Xie Lin’s face flushed with anger, but considering that he still needed to negotiate with Lin Yuan for Creation Master resources later, Xie Lin forcefully suppressed his emotions.","At the same time, he couldn’t help but become suspicious. Could it be that Lin Yuan and Ling Muzhuo knew that he was from the Ancient Snake Gu Palace?","In the past, Xie Lin might have been somewhat nervous because he didn’t want to reveal his identity. However, now that action was imminent, Xie Lin was not concerned at all about his identity being discovered.","After leading Lin Yuan and Ling Muzhuo to the banquet hall, Xie Lin took out his precious wine to entertain them.","However, Lin Yuan didn’t give Xie Lin any face at all. Not only did he refuse to drink Xie Lin’s wine, but he also took out three jugs of wine, claiming that Xie Lin’s wine wasn’t good enough, and shared them with Ling Muzhuo.","Xie Lin could no longer tolerate Lin Yuan and Ling Muzhuo singing the same tune, so he finally spoke directly. “Young Master Lin, I was originally planning to attend the trade fair you organized, but unfortunately, timing wasn’t on my side. Some issues arose within the alliance I had formed, and if I didn’t address them, the alliance would surely fall apart.","“Therefore, I had my adjutant attend the trade fair in my place. At that time, he left in haste and didn’t bring back many resources. I wonder if I still have the opportunity to trade with you, Young Master Lin?”","Lin Yuan didn’t give Xie Lin any face. “Creator resources aren’t particularly valuable in my hands, but I won’t trade with just anyone. As I mentioned at the trade fair before, in the future, only factions within my alliance will be able to enjoy such treatment.","“However, no one from the City Lord Manor has joined the alliance I established, so I have no reason to trade resources with you after the trade fair. Surely, you wouldn’t think that trading Creator resources for spiritual ingredients benefits me, would you?”","Lin Yuan’s words were equivalent to rejecting Xie Lin’s request for a trade. Had it not been for Autumn accompanying Lin Yuan, Xie Lin might have already taken action. His uncertainty about Autumn’s capabilities made him hesitate. If they couldn’t trade, then there was no reason to keep Lin Yuan and Ling Muzhuo here.","Just as Xie Lin was about to find a reason to chase them away, he heard Lin Yuan say, “However, considering your hospitality, I’m not entirely inclined to refuse your request. Yet, the level of goods exchanged must inevitably be raised compared to before.”","Upon hearing that they could still continue trading supplies, a smile finally returned to Xie Lin’s face.","“All the spiritual ingredients I offer for exchange are at Grade 4 Creator resources. Many of them are even suitable for concocting potions by Grade 5 Creator standards. Since I proposed the trade, you can be assured of my sincerity.”","With that, Xie Lin took out all those resources from his spatial equipment.","When Xie Lin typically hosted a banquet for his guests, Jia Mingda and Yang Xuzhang would usually have the privilege to attend. However, Xie Lin wanted to keep his dealings with Lin Yuan confidential, so he discreetly dismissed them beforehand.","Although Yang Xuzhang and Jia Mingda felt uncomfortable about this decision, Xie Lin was indifferent to their feelings. He knew that this time he could successfully offer resources to the two Snake Lords.","With these two Snake Lords as his guarantors, he would likely be promoted from his position as Guardian in the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, perhaps even gaining entry to the Ancient Snake Training Camp. Completing the training there would give him a chance to become a preparatory Snake Lord.","By then, the gap between his status and that of Jia Mingda and Yang Xuzhang would be insurmountable. Even if they wanted to curry favor with him, they wouldn’t have the opportunity. Xie Lin couldn’t care less about their feelings.","Lin Yuan was already planning to use spirit qi crystals to exchange for various goods in large quantities, so Xie Lin’s initiative to bring it up again meant that Lin Yuan could gain even more. Moreover, the resources Xie Lin was now offering were of a higher level than what Lin Yuan had previously traded for.","Lin Yuan didn’t focus much on the resources Xie Lin presented, but his excitement surged when he saw Xie Lin take out a fey. It was a light blue turtle, no larger than the size of a palm, yet it carried a shell at least five times larger than its body, making even crawling somewhat difficult.","Lin Yuan thought to himself that after waiting so long, he had finally encountered a new fey compatible with Morbius’ Spirit Lock. It was the first time he had seen such a magical feature in a fey.","Seeing Lin Yuan’s interest in the turtle that struggled to carry its shell, Xie Lin introduced it to him, “Young Master Lin has good taste. I obtained this Spirit World Barrier Turtle from a mid grade blessed land.”"]},{"number":3108,"title":"Chapter 3108 The Abnormal Zhao Wei!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3108 The Abnormal Zhao Wei!","Lin Yuan used Morbius’ True Data to investigate the Spirit World Barrier Turtle.","[Fey Name]: Spirit World Barrier Turtle","[Fey Species]: Swamp-turtle-species/colored-turtle-species","[Fey Grade]: Bronze (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Water","[Fey Quality]: Legend","Abilities:","[Condensation Barrier]: Combine all the energy and spirit qi that it can touch to form a barrier. The barrier can block the interaction between the inside and outside of the barrier and block the detection of the inside of the barrier.","[Energy Discharge]: When attacked by energy, it can choose not to digest this energy. Instead, it can store this energy in the turtle shell and release it from its mouth. The energy released is comparable to the intensity of the energy attack.","Exclusive Skill:`","[Ten Thousand Techniques Body]: All energy attacks that come into contact with the body will immediately be absorbed and converted into raw materials to condense the barrier. The body will only be affected by physical attacks.","The more Lin Yuan looked at the Spirit World Barrier Turtle, the more satisfied he was. It was truly a creature from a blessed land. No wonder it was so powerful!","The exclusive skills and abilities Ten Thousand Techniques Body and Energy Discharge allowed the Spirit World Barrier Turtle to block energy attacks above the Holy Spirit level.","As for whether it could return the energy attack to the opponent through Energy Discharge, it was related to the energy capacity of the Spirit World Barrier Turtle’s turtle shell. With the current strength of the Spirit World Barrier Turtle’s shell, it should be more than enough to withstand the energy attacks of a Diamond fey.","Lin Yuan mainly wanted the Spirit World Barrier Turtle to become his fey because of its Normal ability, Condensation Barrier.","The barrier formed by the Spirit World Barrier Turtle absorbing energy and spirit qi could be combined to form a barrier. This kind of barrier would block the interaction of internal and external energy. Not only that, but it could also block the detection of the outside world.","As long as the Spirit World Barrier Turtle was nurtured, when exploring the abyssal world, the Spirit World Barrier Turtle could build a barrier that could effectively prevent the corrosion of the energy of the abyssal world, allowing all lifeforms to build foundations in the barrier to reproduce.","When the Spirit World Barrier Turtle was only Bronze grade, Lin Yuan had already seen its potential.","If Lin Yuan could tell, so could Xie Lin.","Meanwhile, Xie Lin was still introducing the Spirit World Barrier Turtle to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan scoffed and said, “City Lord Xie, despite all your talk, you didn’t choose the turtle. Is it because you want to nurture it to generate a large amount of pure spirit qi every day?","“From the looks of it, City Lord Xie, you’ve tried to nurture it before. I know you plan to raise the price. While I have plenty of Creator resources, I’m not naive enough to give them away casually.","“Brother Ling is the Palace Master of Fortune Treasure Palace, which collects all kinds of spiritual ingredients. Let Brother Ling help appraise these ingredients to ensure fairness. I trust you won’t distrust Brother Ling.”","Lin Yuan was correct—Xie Lin did plan to raise the price.","These resources were personally saved by Xie Lin. The more Creator resources he could exchange for them, the more advantageous it would be for him. Xie Lin was counting on these resources to curry favor with the Snake Lords.","Xie Lin noticed that Ling Muzhuo had a very close relationship with Lin Yuan, much closer than his own.","Under such circumstances, it was clear who Ling Muzhuo would favor when estimating the price.","However, Xie Lin couldn’t reject this proposal. He feared that if he did, Lin Yuan would refuse to deal with him.","Moreover, rejecting the suggestion would imply a lack of trust in Ling Muzhuo, the Palace Master of Fortune Treasure Palace. Xie Lin did not want to become enemies with Ling Muzhuo at this time.","After some thought, Xie Lin gritted his teeth and said, “I naturally trust Palace Master Ling. Please help settle the price of these resources fairly so that neither Young Master Lin nor I suffer a loss!”","Hearing this, Ling Muzhuo looked at Xie Lin with a faint smile. In such a deal, if one side suffered a loss, the other side would gain an advantage.","Xie Lin was reminding him to be fair when calculating the price. If Ling Muzhuo didn’t have such a good relationship with Lin Yuan, he wouldn’t have helped in evaluating the resources.","This kind of task could be laborious and unrewarding. Trying to please one side could offend the other.","Confirming that Xie Lin was likely from the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, Ling Muzhuo was filled with resentment, recalling Fortune Treasure Palace’s losses in South Face City over the years.","In the process of calculating the price, he showed no mercy and essentially lowered the prices of these spiritual ingredients to the minimum.","It reached a point where Xie Lin felt the pinch but couldn’t refuse the deal.","Ling Muzhuo was somewhat surprised by the high quality of Xie Lin’s stock.","If Xie Lin had asked Fortune Treasure Palace to prepare the materials for the trade, it would have required mobilizing resources from many branches.","These resources were clearly beyond what a City Lord of a large city should possess.","When Xie Lin presented these resources, he must have already decided to relinquish his City Lord status.","“City Lord Xie, you’ve gained a lot during this period in South Face City. You actually gathered so many resources! Most of the resources here are not produced in South Face City. I think you must have spent a lot of effort to collect these resources, right? No matter how precious these spiritual ingredients are, they can’t compare to Creator resources.","“The price I stated is not low. City Lord Xie, the resources you took out can’t be exchanged for so many spirit qi crystals if you traded with anyone else. You have to know that the spirit qi crystals that Young Master Lin took out are not mere Grade 4 Creator resources—they have also reached pinnacle Grade 4!”","Ling Muzhuo’s words made Xie Lin’s teeth itch.","Xie Lin knew how Lin Yuan had offered the spirit qi crystals at the trade fair.","If he completed the transaction of the materials in his hands at the trade fair, the amount of spirit qi crystals he would exchange would be at least 10% more than now.","He needed these spirit qi crystals and could only suffer in silence.","Xie Lin looked at Ling Muzhuo viciously. He had already made up his mind to make Ling Muzhuo pay the price when the Snake Lords came.","As for the method, it was very simple. As long as he revealed that Lin Yuan had a large number of spirit qi crystals, it would be fine.","Even though he hated Ling Muzhuo and Lin Yuan to death, Xie Lin’s superficial skills were still on point. Lin Yuan and Ling Muzhuo were invited to stay in the residence.","However, Lin Yuan was no longer in the mood to feign civility with Xie Lin. His mind was focused on nurturing the Spirit World Barrier Turtle.","The feys produced by mid grade blessed lands were extremely precious. Since Xie Lin was willing to take these things out, it seemed that the Spirit World Barrier Turtle definitely needed a lot of spirit qi!","Lin Yuan was prepared to see how much this little fellow could eat.","Lin Yuan originally wanted to return to the place where he had just arrived in South Face City. But there were too many factions that wanted to trade resources with him.","Since Zhao Chen was not there, Lin Yuan decided to stay in Fortune Treasure Palace for peace and quiet.","The trade fair was hosted by Zhao Chen, so Lin Yuan simply handed over all the alliance members to Zhao Chen to manage.","Lin Yuan could tell that the Zhao family had many thoughts about him. Zhao Chen had been stopping the Zhao family from meeting him.","Zhao Chen also had his own plans for doing so.","Lin Yuan already had the thought of befriending Zhao Chen. As for whether he could grasp it in the end, it would depend on Zhao Chen himself.","...","Lin Yuan took out 1,000,000 spirit qi crystals to see how far the Spirit World Barrier Turtle could go after absorbing them.","Previously, all the feys that Morbius had spirit-locked were basically stuck at Bronze X/Legend because this could maximize their potential.","The reason Lin Yuan was prepared to nurture the Spirit World Barrier Turtle was that he had comprehended a Willpower Rune that was extremely compatible with the Spirit World Barrier Turtle after contracting the Enlightenment Cicada.","As long as he combined this Willpower Rune with the Spirit World Barrier Turtle, regardless of grade or quality, the Spirit World Barrier Turtle would directly improve.","Lin Yuan first used Spirit Lock on the Spirit World Barrier Turtle. The moment he used Spirit Lock on it, he felt the hunger coming from the Spirit World Barrier Turtle.","The Spirit World Barrier Turtle was like an evil spirit that had starved for countless years as it pitifully begged Lin Yuan for food.","Lin Yuan could not help but feel speechless. It turned out that the Spirit World Barrier Turtle was not such a delicate fey.","At present, the Spirit World Barrier Turtle’s size was limited by energy.","Creatures like the Spirit World Barrier Turtle, which originated from mid grade blessed lands, had long lifespans. Since Xie Lin obtained the Spirit World Barrier Turtle, tens of thousands of years had passed.","Apart from investing resources in the Spirit World Barrier Turtle at the beginning, Xie Lin had not spent any more effort on the Spirit World Barrier Turtle.","After starving for tens of thousands of years, the Spirit World Barrier Turtle was only the size of a washbasin. If it continued to starve without spirit qi to absorb, the Spirit World Barrier Turtle would most likely enter a dormant state.","Before letting the Spirit World Barrier Turtle absorb the spirit qi crystals, Lin Yuan planned to let it have a good meal and wait for its body to recover before transforming into Fantasy Breed. Otherwise, without enough energy to replenish itself, even if it transformed into Fantasy Breed, it would affect the Spirit World Barrier Turtle’s potential.","Fortunately, a fey like the Spirit World Barrier Turtle was very special. As long as there was sufficient pure spirit qi to absorb, its condition would recover very quickly.","...","Millions of spirit qi crystals were already a lot for any living being.","However, after these millions of spirit qi crystals were absorbed by the Spirit World Barrier Turtle, it was still not full. From time to time, it would convey its hunger to Lin Yuan, wanting to ask for more spirit qi. Even Lin Yuan could not help but be surprised by its appetite.","No wonder Xie Lin had given up on the Spirit World Barrier Turtle. If he had not established the faith country and no longer lacked spirit qi crystals, Lin Yuan might have given up on nurturing the Spirit World Barrier Turtle as well.","Fortunately, Lin Yuan still had some spirit qi crystals to feed it.","...","After consuming a total of 5.6 million spirit qi crystals, the Spirit World Barrier Turtle returned to its healthiest state.","At that moment, the size of the Spirit World Barrier Turtle was equivalent to a small mountain, able to carry at least 50 people.","The Spirit World Barrier Turtle possessed extraordinary intelligence. Once its body fully recovered, it began urging Lin Yuan to evolve it into a Fantasy Breed.","Due to Spirit Lock, the relationship between the Spirit World Barrier Turtle and Lin Yuan had become extremely close.","The Spirit World Barrier Turtle understood why it had been despised by Xie Lin: it consumed too much. This made the turtle hesitant to ask Lin Yuan for more spirit qi, fearing his dissatisfaction. Otherwise, it would have tried to evolve into a Fantasy Breed while in its best state.","Sensing the turtle’s emotions, Lin Yuan whispered, “Since I’ve decided to nurture you, I’ll provide you with the best resources in the future. If you have any needs, just ask. Don’t deprive yourself of resources.","“You’ve just recovered, and the spirit qi in your body hasn’t reached its limit. Instead of rushing to advance, why not accumulate more experience?”","Lin Yuan then took out a large number of spirit qi crystals and placed them in front of the turtle, indicating it could absorb them at will.","The Spirit World Barrier Turtle had never felt such love since its birth. Now, it finally felt cared for, letting out a happy roar.","It waved its three-story-tall head in front of Lin Yuan and began chewing on the spirit qi crystals without needing his help. With each bite, nearly 20,000 spirit qi crystals were swallowed.","In the future, the Spirit World Barrier Turtle would definitely not lose to Blackie in terms of spirit qi crystal consumption.","Lin Yuan looked at the remaining spirit qi crystals and decided that, apart from Zhao Chen and Ling Muzhuo, he would not trade them with any other factions in South Face City.","...","Over the past two days, there had been turmoil in South Face City, with many factions perishing daily.","All the powerful factions were present, but Lin Yuan was the most talked about person in South Face City.","For the past two days, Lin Yuan had been nurturing the Spirit World Barrier Turtle in Fortune Treasure Palace, choosing not to interact with other factions.","As Lin Yuan’s representative, Zhao Chen was incredibly busy.","Zhao Chen had never experienced so many powerful factions seeking his favor. Even under pressure from his family, he decided to follow Lin Yuan no matter what.","“Fourth Uncle, Young Master Lin has already said that he won’t see anyone. Don’t make things difficult for me. It’s enough for me to be the only one from the Zhao family to interact with Young Master Lin.","“So what if you interact with Young Master Lin again? I’ll mention my father’s injuries to Young Master Lin after this operation ends. However, even if Young Master Lin is willing to help, we have to be able to take out the corresponding resources to trade with Young Master Lin.","“Although Father lost the battle in the family, he still has more resources than I do. Get Father to prepare the resources. I’ll contact you when there’s news from Young Master Lin!”","When Zhao Chen’s father heard the news, he immediately looked for Zhao Chen excitedly. However, Zhao Chen’s father’s attitude toward this matter was far different from his fourth uncle’s. Basically, he would contact him every few hours in hopes of getting a chance to interact with Lin Yuan alone.","Zhao Chen felt that Zhao Wei’s behavior was a little abnormal, as if he had other motives."]},{"number":3109,"title":"Chapter 3109: Sudden Appearance of a Giant Purple Dragon!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3109: Sudden Appearance of a Giant Purple Dragon!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","As a City Lord, Zhao Chen was no longer a child who had followed Zhao Wei for tens of thousands of years. Zhao Chen vaguely felt that Zhao Wei urgently wanted to see Lin Yuan for other purposes.","Zhao Chen started to be wary of his fourth uncle.","In the major factions, internal members of the factions would often fight. Even close relatives might kill each other for benefits, let alone not close ones.","Zhao Wei was desperate to see Lin Yuan, which made Zhao Chen suspicious.","When Zhao Wei requested to meet Lin Yuan, Zhao Chen rejected him again.","“Fourth Uncle, Young Master Lin has been in seclusion and hasn’t even seen me. Even if I wanted to, I couldn ‘t introduce you to him. Moreover, I’ve already become friends with Young Master Lin.","“If you need anything, you can tell me, and I’ll pass the message on your behalf. I believe you ‘ve already heard that those factions who angered Young","Master Lin at the trade fair have been eliminated. I’ve already informed Young","Master Lin about Father, and he will respond to me soon. ”","Zhao Wei, with a dark expression, said, “Little Chen, I’ve treated you like my own child since you were young. Why won’t you introduce me to Young Master","Lin now?”","Zhao Chen looked at Zhao Wei with a complicated expression.","“Fourth Uncle, are you certain you need to meet Young Master Lin in person? If you’re sure, I’ll convey your request. ”","Before this conversation, Zhao Chen had just communicated with Lin Yuan through his communication fey.","Zhao Chen felt relieved after contacting Lin Yuan again after several days.","First, he explained the current situation in South Face City to Lin Yuan, and then he mentioned the factions wanting to trade resources. Although they wanted to meet Lin Yuan, their priority was securing resources.","Lin Yuan responded without hesitation. “Brother Zhao, since the trade fair ended, I’ve decided not to trade Creator resources with outsiders anymore. The alliance already has enough factions. There’s no need to add more. Just help me decline their requests. I don’t intend to meet them. ”","Zhao Chen was relieved to hear Lin Yuan ‘s rejection. If Lin Yuan had been interested in meeting these factions, Zhao Chen wouldn’t have known how to arrange it. Too many factions wanted to meet Lin Yuan, and if they found out about his arrangements, they might blame him.","Because Zhao Wei had been pressuring Zhao Chen to meet Lin Yuan, Zhao Chen had decided to explain the matter to Lin Yuan and arrange a meeting between them.","Zhao Chen was curious about why his fourth uncle wanted to meet Lin Yuan. He had asked Zhao Wei about it before, but Zhao Wei had always been vague.","Lin Yuan agreed immediately to Zhao Chen ‘s request.","“Brother Zhao, if your fourth uncle insists on meeting me, bring him to Fortune Treasure Palace at five o’clock tomorrow evening. I’ll meet him there. ” With Lin Yuan’s confirmation, Zhao Chen could agree to Zhao Wei ‘s request.","He understood how serious and determined Zhao Wei was about meeting Lin","Yuan.","Zhao Chen said, “In that case, I’ll bring Fourth Uncle to meet Young Master Lin tomorrow. However, be aware that Young Master Lin will no longer trade resources. ”","Zhao Wei was delighted to hear Zhao Chen’s words.","” Since you ‘ve agreed, I’ll find you before noon tomorrow. ”","Zhao Chen watched Zhao Wei’s departing figure, feeling relieved.","At least he would soon discover Zhao Wei’s motives through Lin Yuan. If his fourth uncle had ulterior motives, it would be easier for him to take precautions.","Meanwhile, Lin Yuan ‘s attention was still on the Spirit World Barrier Turtle. After feeding it spirit qi crystals for two days, the Spirit World Barrier Turtle had successfully evolved to Fantasy/Platinum.","The Spirit World Barrier Turtle’s growth was much slower than Lin Yuan had expected.","Lin Yuan needed to leave some spirit qi crystals for emergencies, so he stopped evolving it for now. Instead, he planned to nurture the Spirit World Barrier Turtle in the future when he had more spirit qi crystals.","Seeing that Lin Yuan had finished nurturing his feys, Autumn could not help but ask, “Young Master, the people from Faerie Institution and Abyssal Beast Domain have already arrived in South Face City. They hid their auras and did not reveal their identities to the outside world. I can detect their location.","Young Master, do you want to take the initiative to contact them?”","Lin Yuan felt that instead of staying in Fortune Treasure Palace to observe, it was time for him to take the initiative to attack.","Regardless of whether they were competitors or not, it was necessary to interact with Abyssal Beast Domain and Faerie Institution.","This was especially true for Faerie Institution. Firstly, Lin Yuan had several high-grade faeries, so he had a deep relationship with Faerie Institution.","Furthermore, Lin Yuan had robbed Faerie Institution of Emerald Lady.","He had only been in the Sky Beyond the Clouds for a short period, so he needed to befriend more factions for the sake of his development.","Coincidentally, these factions were all qualified to befriend Lin Yuan.","“Autumn, after meeting Zhao Chen’s fourth uncle, I’ll prepare to interact with the people from Faerie Institution and Abyssal Beast Domain. I heard from Winter that Xie Lin also tried to invite these two factions, but in the end, the people from these two forces rejected his invitation. Members of these big forces usually don ‘t take a City Lord like Xie Lin seriously, and Xie Lin doesn’t dare to carelessly leak information about the Ancient Snake Gu Palace. ”","Autumn asked, “Young Master, are you planning to befriend these two parties? Now that the two parties are competitors, there’s not much point in befriending them. In any case, the competitive relationship will still exist.","“These two factions in the West and North Universes have come to the intersection of the South ane East Universes. They must be determined to obtain this blessed land.”","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “It’s good to know the situation of our opponents in advance. Moreover, even if I don’t take the initiative to look for them, they will most likely take the initiative to look for me. ”","The following day...","Lin Yuan asked Ling Muzhuo for information from Fortune Treasure Palace. Through observing this information, Lin Yuan gained a better understanding of the situation in South Face City.","Before Zhao Chen brought his uncle to see him, Lin Yuan accompanied the insecure Spirit World Barrier Turtle so it could absorb spirit qi in the Spirit Lock spatial zone in peace.","In fact, with the Spirit World Barrier Turtle’s ability to absorb spirit qi, even without spirit qi crystals in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, its strength could quickly increase.","In the evening...","Lin Yuan met Zhao Wei.","“Young Master Lin, I’m an elder of the Zhao family in South Face City. I brought you here this time because I have something to discuss with you. I","wonder it I can talk to you In private!”","Zhao Wei was obviously hoping that Lin Yuan would chase Zhao Chen away. Zhao Chen frowned as soon as Zhao Wei said that.","Regardless of the reason, Zhao Wei’s dismissal could be considered a very overboard action.","“Fourth Uncle, what can’t you say in front of me? If you really need anything from Young Master Lin, I can speak up for you. ”","Zhao Wei did not explain to Zhao Chen. Seeing that Lin Yuan did not speak for a long time, Zhao Wei took out a metal box.","“Young Master Lin, you will definitely be interested in what’s in this metal box!","Since Zhao Wei had already put it this way, Lin Yuan could not reject Zhao Wei ‘s suggestion.","“Brother Zhao, since the elder of your family has something to say to me in private, you should leave first. I don’t think the Zhao family has anything too important to do now. After your fourth uncle finishes talking to me, I’ll arrange for someone to bring you back in. ”","Zhao Chen looked at Zhao Wei seriously for a while before leaving Lin Yuan ‘s room.","Autumn stood beside Lin Yuan and looked at Zhao Wei seriously. If anything happened, Autumn would immediately protect Lin Yuan regardless of whether Zhao Wei was Zhao Chen’s elder or not.","After Zhao Chen left, Lin Yuan scrutinized Zhao Wei.","” Since you said that I’ll definitely be interested in the things in the metal box, you can open it now. There aren’t many things in the world that can interest me.”","Ever since Zhao Wei had entered, Lin Yuan had never felt any respect from him.","Regardless of his relationship with Zhao Chen, it was only right for Zhao Wei to show respect to Lin Yuan based on the capabilities he had displayed. His current attitude was a little abnormal.","Either Zhao Wei was not smart enough or Zhao Wei was not relying on the Zhac Paragraph comment feature is","family but other factions.","This metal box was spatial equipment. No one touched this metal box, but it was still shaking slightly as if there was a living creature inside.","As Zhao Wei inserted a key into the metal box, a torrent of energy gushed out?????? from the metal box. This gushing energy instantly froze the surrounding space, as if it had turned Lin Yuan’s room into another dimension.","A purple-gold giant dragon with three pairs of horns appeared in the room.","The moment Zhao Wei saw this dragon with three pairs of horns, he immediately knelt on the ground and kowtowed.","In Zhao Wei’s opinion, this mighty force must have intimidated Lin Yuan and the guard standing beside him.","However, in reality, the moment this aura pounced on Lin Yuan, Autumn had already neutralized it. Lin Yuan was not affected by this aura at all.","Autumn was not in a hurry to attack the moment the purple-gold dragon appeared. He sent a voice transmission to Lin Yuan and said, “Young Master, the dragon summoned by the Zhao family is a main dragon species. In terms of strength, it has already surpassed the Holy Spirit level.","“If I’m not wrong, this dragon-species fey is most likely from the Myriad","Dragon Immortal Valley. I wonder if Zhao Chen is related to the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley or if the entire Zhao family has a deep relationship with them. ”","Lin Yuan pondered for a moment and felt that Zhao Chen most likely did not know about the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley’ s situation.","Firstly, it was because Zhao Chen had met him in Diverse City because of Sun Youcai’s introduction. At that time, Zhao Chen did not know that this top grade blessed land was about to appear, so he would not have schemed against him at that time.","Secondly, if Zhao Chen wanted to facilitate this situation, he could just introduce Zhao Wei directly. There was no need to go through so much trouble.","Zhao Wei relied on this purple-gold dragon to regard Lin Yuan as prey. However, Zhao Wei did not know that the relationship between hunter and prey had already changed.","The suppression between dragon species mainly relied on their bloodline, not strength. If Lin Yuan released Blackie, he would be able to suppress the mainspecies dragon.","Lin Yuan did not do so, nor was he in a hurry to let Autumn take action because he wanted to confirm if this purple-gold dragon was from the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley.","What was the purpose of the Zhao family treating him like this? Was Zhao Wei not afraid that he would break off ties with the Zhao family and they would lose a channel to obtain Grade 5 Creator resources?","If this purple-gold dragon really came from the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, why would a faction from the North Universe arrange for people to be stationed at the intersection of the South and East Universes?","Lin Yuan suddenly felt that the situation had become interesting.","If it was for this top grade blessed land, the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley would not have made arrangements so early. But if not for this top grade blessed land, what else was there in South Face City that the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley would covet?","Lin Yuan could not think of an answer, so he stopped thinking about it.","The purple-gold dragon had been in a deep sleep in the dimensional space inside the metal box. It was not in a good mood because it had just been awakened.","The purple-gold dragon first let out a dragon roar before questioning Zhao Wei.","“The battle has yet to begin. Why did you summon me? I’m sure you know very well what kind of crime it is to wake me up without any reason. ”","Zhao Wei hurriedly said, “Lord Purple Dragon, it’s true that the chaotic battle between the various factions has yet to begin. But this top grade blessed land at the intersection of the South and East Universes can open at any time. Didn’t you say that the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley would wake you up immediately after they arrived?","“I woke you up in advance this time because I discovered a way to obtain Grade 5 Creator resources. He has the Grade 5 Creator resources. If you can control him, you will have another channel to obtain Grade 5 Creator resources in the future!”","Zhao Wei’s tone was extremely flattering and carried a hint of fear.","When the giant purple dragon heard Zhao Wei’s words, it looked at Lin Yuan with a different expression.","“Oh, you’re saying that this little guy who has lived for less than 60 years has Grade 5 Creator resources? You’ve been by my side for a long time. You should know the consequences of lying to me. ”","Zhao Wei lowered his head and said seriously, “Lord, how would I dare to lie to you? My nephew’s feys have all evolved due to the Grade 5 Creator resources he obtained. “"]},{"number":3110,"title":"Chapter 3110: Are You Teaching Me What To Do?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3110: Are You Teaching Me What To Do?","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Zhao Wei paused for a moment and continued. “If I wasn’t 100% sure, I wouldn’t have told you the information!”","When the purple dragon heard Zhao Wei’s words, it immediately became interested in Lin Yuan and looked at him with a scrutinizing gaze.","At the same time, he focused his attention on Autumn.","Autumn had been trying his best to hold back his aura, so he did not show any presence.","However, the purple dragon felt a sense of shock and horror because it could not sense any aura from Autumn’s body.","In a chaotic place like South Face City, how could a person with Grade 5 Creator resources bring a weak person with him? There was only one explanation for this situation and that was that this lifeform was stronger!","Thinking of this, the purple dragon immediately released its dragon aura to test the waters although it was very likely that releasing the dragon might cause the space created by his aura to become unstable.","The dragon might released by dragon-species creatures could not only intimidate other dragon-species lifeforms but it was also effective on non-dragon-species lifeforms. The dragon-species fey’s might was extremely destructive.","The truth was just as the purple-gold dragon had predicted. The aura he released did not affect the child’s guard. Facing his dragon might, this guard acted as if nothing had happened.","This made the purple dragon realize that he had been tricked by Zhao Wei. Rather than saying that the young man in front of him was his prey, it would be more accurate to say that he was the prey now!","The purple dragon looked at Zhao Wei angrily and spoke to Lin Yuan as respectfully as possible. “My servant has failed to recognize how formidable you truly are. He didn’t recognize the two of you as important figures. I will definitely teach him a lesson. I hope the two of you can forgive me!”","Lin Yuan said with a playful tone, “Forgive? How? This subordinate of yours offered us to you as captives. He wants you to control me and obtain the Creator resources in my hands. You’ve already treated me as prey, yet you still want me to forgive you. How can there be such a good thing in this world?","“If I’m not wrong, you should be from the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, right? I’ve always heard that the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, which is made up of dragon-species feys, is greedy. Now that I’ve seen it, it really lives up to its reputation!”","Lin Yuan’s words let the dragon know that this matter would not end peacefully.","“That’s right, I’m indeed from the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley. You’re not mistaken. I’m only an elder in the Myraid Dragon Immortal Valley. There are many other elders who are stronger than me. I’m willing to pay for today’s misunderstanding. Tell me, what compensation do you want?”","The moment the purple dragon could not sense Autumn’s aura, it admitted defeat and wanted to compensate.","In the eyes of the purple dragon, as long he was willing to compensate, the other party would not make things difficult for him. If the two sides really fought in the current situation where the various factions were gathered in South Face City, the two sides would become the target of everyone.","Unexpectedly, the other party was unwilling to settle things peacefully. Instead, he said in an extremely serious tone, “Why? You wanted to control me back then. But now that I’m here, you want to settle things peacefully? How can there be such a good thing? If I had been willing to give you some resources when you decided to control me, would you have accepted?” The purple dragon was enraged.","“What else do you want? Are we going to fight? Even if I’m not your guard’s match, he can forget about taking advantage of me!”","Autumn had initially wanted to watch the show, expecting Lin Yuan would call on him to act later. However, the purple dragon’s words seemed condescending. What did it mean by suggesting he couldn’t gain an advantage in a fight? With the purple dragon’s strength, was there really anything it couldn’t overcome? How ridiculous!","Autumn would not let the purple dragon continue. If Lin Yuan believed the dragon’s words and looked down on him, it would be unjust!","Yet, when he attacked, he had to ensure his aura remained concealed.","Autumn summoned thousands of fallen leaves at once. This was the first time he had called forth so many since he began following Lin Yuan.","These leaves did not all target the purple dragon directly. Only a few dozen aimed at the dragon. Most of the leaves enhanced the special space created by the dragon’s aura, fortifying it.","The few dozen leaves that attached to the dragon’s body emitted a bleak energy that completely stagnated the dragon’s energy flow.","Lin Yuan smiled at the dragon and said, “It seems my guard is much stronger than you. Now, you have two choices: submit to me and become my spy in the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, or die here as the price for trying to control me.","“I’ve said all I need to say. You have five minutes to decide whether you want to live or die. I’ll only give you one chance to think it over. I hope you’ll cherish your hard-won life.”","Lin Yuan began the countdown without another word.","It was a tumultuous time, and Lin Yuan did not want to complicate matters.","Otherwise, he would have been willing to give the purple dragon more time to choose.","As the core elder of the seven main lineages of the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, Long Jie had always been the one to decide others’ fates. This was the first time someone had forced him to decide his own.","If Lin Yuan continued to threaten him, Long Jie would know what to do.","But in the current situation, Long Jie was powerless.","He would soon have to make a choice.","Long Jie feared the young man in front of him would kill him the moment he refused.","Long Jie had always been arrogant. Even while controlling Zhao Wei, an elder of the Zhao family, he hadn’t revealed his name, allowing Zhao Wei to call him only “Lord Purple Dragon”.","But now, in front of Lin Yuan, Long Jie could no longer maintain his arrogance.","In those five minutes, Long Jie’s thoughts were extremely complicated. Lin Yuan’s demand meant betraying the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, a task he was extremely reluctant to undertake. It would disgrace dragons across all universes.","As the five minutes approached their end, Long Jie reluctantly said, “During the competition for the top grade blessed land, I can facilitate your cooperation with the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley. However, they intend to explore this top grade blessed land, and even as an elder, I can’t stop them from exploring it.”","Lin Yuan didn’t even look at Long Jie and reminded him seriously, “You have 1 minute and 18 seconds left.","He said nothing further.","Long Jie was no fool. He understood that if he didn’t agree to the young man’s demand, he would surely be killed when time was up.","If he died in this isolated space, the outside world would be none the wiser. A single strike from Lin Yuan’s guard could prevent him from circulating his energy.","At thatmoment, he had completely lost his ability to resist.","The lifespan of dragons was extremely long. At nearly 200,000 years, Long Jie was still a youth in dragon terms. He did not want to die. Submission seemed the only option.","However, even in submission, Long Jie had his limits. He could not act against the interests of the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley. If his submission threatened their interests, he would rather die.","Long Jie did not know Lin Yuan’s name. When addressing him, Long Jie’s tone had changed.","“Lord, I understand that submission is the only way I can survive. However, as a member of the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, I am unwilling to abandon it. I hope you understand my position. As long as my submission does not threaten the Valley’s interests, I will offer my loyalty to you!”","Lin Yuan narrowed his eyes and said, “You just mentioned the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley wants to fight for this top grade blessed land. I have similar plans. Competition between us is inevitable.","“If fighting for this land makes you feel like you’ve betrayed the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, then die here!”","Although Lin Yuan spoke without revealing any aura, Long Jie’s heart pounded.","Despite his earlier declaration of loyalty to the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, Long Jie hesitated under these dire circumstances.","Ultimately, it was fear of death that made him waver. However, he could not admit to betraying the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley.","Lin Yuan could tell what Long Jie was thinking and said, “The person you control told you that I have Grade 5 Creator resources. As long as you perform well in the future, I don’t mind using Grade 5 Creator resources to trade with the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley. As the middleman of the transaction, you are equivalent to creating value for the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley.” Lin Yuan’s words gave Long Jie a way out.","“In that case, Lord, I’m willing to submit to you. How should I pledge my loyalty?”","Lin Yuan did not take out the Lifespan Mouse for Long Jie to contract. In Lin Yuan’s eyes, Long Jie’s loyalty to him was still not a stable factor. Lin Yuan did not want the Lifespan Mouse’s existence to be leaked.","Lin Yuan said, “I only need to use my divine kingdom to control your holy spirit. There’s no need to use any other means. If I find out that you betrayed me, not only will I take away a holy spirit and turn you into a cripple, but I will also kill you. The Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley won’t have a good ending either.","“If you are obedient, not only will you be able to obtain benefits but the chances of the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley obtaining Creator resources will also be high. You’re a smart person. I don’t think a smart person like you will disappoint me!”","Long Jie’s heart skipped a beat when he heard this. He looked at Autumn with fear and did not doubt Lin Yuan’s words at all.","With Autumn’s strength, he indeed had such ability.","Soon, Long Jie’s three holy spirits were marked with Lin Yuan’s divine kingdom.","Lin Yuan continued to speak to Long Jie. “Now that you’ve become my subordinate, tell me about the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley’s plan! As long as you tell me the plan of the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, I won’t force you to do anything that will harm the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley. The Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley and I will compete for this top grade blessed land with our own abilities.”","Lin Yuan’s words put Long Jie at ease, and he looked at Lin Yuan gratefully. During this process, Lin Yuan had prevented him from harming the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley. This was already the best outcome for him.","“Lord, actually, the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley has already set our sights on this top grade blessed land a long time ago. 1,500 years ago, the Myriad","Dragon Immortal Valley discovered something when we were invited by the Ancient Snake Gu Palace to South Face City.","‘It’s just that at that time, we and the Ancient Snake Gu Palace weren’t sure if a precious treasure was about to appear or if a blessed land was about to open.","“That was when I was sent to South Face City to investigate on behalf of the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley. I didn’t let these elders spread the news, so not many people know about the Zhao family’s situation.","“Lord, I hope you won’t leak the news EITHER. If word gets out, the other elders will definitely use this to suppress me. At that time, it will be disadvantageous to my successor!”","It was not Lin Yuan’s threat that made Long Jie decide to submit to Lin Yuan. Although Long Jie was afraid of Lin Yuan’s threat, he had been conflicted and had not made a decision. It was because Lin Yuan said that Long Jie could become the bridge between him and the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley in obtaining Creator resources that Long Jie was convinced.","Once Lin Yuan’s words came to play, his status in the Myraid Thousand Dragon Immortal Valley would definitely increase with the Creator resources he obtained from Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan looked at Long Jie playfully.","“What, are you telling me what to do? Whether I should leak the information of the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley to the outside world or not, and how the situation develops is entirely up to me. Alright, you don’t have to tell me everything you know. Release your spiritual and soul power.”","Lin Yuan summoned Genius. When outsiders were present, Genius would appear in its human form.","Lin Yuan planned to let Genius use Connected Tails to find out what Long Jie knew. This way, it would be convenient and quick and he could ensure that Long Jie did not hide anything from him.","With Long Jie’s holy spirit under Lin Yuan’s control, Lin Yuan was not afraid that Long Jie’s sudden resistance would affect Genius when it probed Long Jie’s memories.","Genius looked 70% similar to Lin Yuan in human form and looked like Lin Yuan’s younger brother. However, Long Jie could tell at a glance that Genius and Lin Yuan, who looked extremely similar, were not from the same species."]},{"number":3111,"title":"Chapter 3111: The Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley and Ancestral Dragon!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3111: The Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley and Ancestral Dragon!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Long Jie didn’t dare refuse Lin Yuan’s request. He could only relax his mind and soul, making himself defenseless.","Genius pointed forward, and a dazzling tail of light shot from Genius’ back, connecting Long Jie, Genius, Lin Yuan, and Autumn. This allowed them to immediately probe Long Jie’s memories.","The knowledge and memories of a direct descendant from a major faction were extensive. Not only did Lin Yuan learn why Long Jie had come to South Face City, but he also discovered many secrets of the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley and the hidden history of the North Universe.","In the past, the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley was a faction that could rival the Snow-covered Foxes. However, over the years, its development had faltered, causing its status in the North Universe to decline compared to the Snow-covered Foxes.","The Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, home to many dragons, was established on a top grade blessed land. These dragons, living in a prime environment, recklessly absorbed the land’s energy, leading to its depletion 100,000 years ago.","Additionally, an expert in the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, whose bloodline had reached the pinnacle of the main-dragon species, sought further transformation to evolve into an Ancestral Dragon.","After the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley’s internal meeting approved it, this expert sacrificed the dried-up blessed land to use its energy for self-tempering.","Because of this, the various dragon-species in the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley gathered numerous resources in preparation for the birth of the Ancestral Dragon.","The Ancestral Dragon was a supreme being with the highest dragon-species bloodline. Currently, there was only one Ancestral Dragon in the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, who had long been asleep.","Even Long Jie had never seen the Ancestral Dragon. Many believed that the sleeping Ancestral Dragon was a legend. The younger generation of the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley thought so as well.","Only a new Ancestral Dragon could restore the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley to its former glory.","Despite being depleted, the top grade blessed land was still a precious treasure for the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley. It was crucial for dragon reproduction, which was already extremely difficult. Without it, the dragons faced even greater challenges in reproducing.","This was why the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley was determined to obtain the top grade blessed land in South Face City. It was vital for their future.","After examining Long Jie’s memories, Lin Yuan realized that Blackie, whom he had nurtured using almost all his spirit qi crystals, was much stronger than he had anticipated. Regardless of Blackie’s current strength, its bloodline had already reached the Ancestral Dragon level, the pinnacle of the dragon-species bloodline.","Initially, Lin Yuan hadn’t understood how rare the Ancestral Dragon bloodline was for dragons.","At the same time, Lin Yuan was also surprised by the strength of the Snow-covered Foxes. Their power in the North Universe had far exceeded his expectations.","Lin Yuan thought, It looks like I should provide Kong Huan with more resources so that she can gain more trust and love from the Snow-covered Foxes.","If he could obtain this top grade blessed land, Sky City would no longer need to hide in North of the Lonely River after a period of development. Instead, it should start a power struggle in this chaotic world.","Although Connected Tails was an ability, Long Jie could still feel that his memories were being continuously read through this light tail.","Regarding this, Long Jie could only let out a slight sigh. There was nothing he could do.","At that moment, Long Jie heard Lin Yuan ask, “The Myriad Dragon Immortal","Valley respects bloodline. If an outsider Ancestral Dragon joins, will the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley be willing to worship this Ancestral Dragon and listen to its orders?”","Long Jie was puzzled by Lin Yuan’s words. At the same time, he could not help but sigh in his heart. No matter how strong Lin Yuan was, he was not a member of the dragon-species and did not understand their situation at all.","“Lord, the faction is called Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley because it is formed by many dragons. The dragon factions in Myraid Dragon Immortal Valley only joined 40,000 years ago. In the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, bloodline is everything.","“Dragons with high-level bloodlines have the strength to control low-level dragons. It’s no different from the faction formed by the faeries. I’m still considered inexperienced in the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley. The reason why I’m an Elder is that my bloodline has successfully advanced to the main-dragon level.”","Lin Yuan nodded. If that was the case, it was not impossible for him to subdue the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley.","Blackie was a genuine Ancestral Dragon, but there was still an Ancestral","Dragon in the the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, so Lin Yuan had to be wary","of it.","At that moment, Zhao Wei, who was kneeling on the ground not far away, was in a state of fear. He had not expected such a development.","He originally thought that he had discovered an opportunity and wanted to tell Lord Purple Dragon to obtain the reward.","Because of this, he did not hesitate to betray the Zhao family and the nephew he had watched grow up.","In the end, as soon as Lord Purple Dragon appeared, he was controlled by the other party.","Now that Lord Purple Dragon had become the other party’s prisoner, what would his fate be? Zhao Wei felt that his fate was like duckweed. He had no control over it at all!","Lin Yuan did not intend to keep Long Jie here after controlling him.","Lin Yuan looked at the nervous Long Jie and handed a ramet of the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower and a Thoughts Letter Paper to Long Jie.","“Alright, you can leave. He’s yours. If you can guarantee his loyalty, take him away. If you can’t, find a chance to deal with him later.”","Lin Yuan would definitely not let Zhao Wei die here. After all, Zhao Wei was Zhao Chen’s fourth uncle.","Since Zhao Chen was not involved in this matter, Lin Yuan did not intend to let Zhao Chen know what Zhao Wei had done today.","Lin Yuan would never take a fancy to someone like Zhao Wei who would betray his family for opportunities.","Hearing this, Long Jie glanced at the terrified Zhao Wei and said with certainty, “Lord, there’s no way for the lower dragons to betray you. He’s completely under my control. There’s no doubt about that. He definitely won’t reveal the situation casually. I can guarantee it.”","Zhao Wei was still useful to Long Jie. The latter did not want Zhao Wei to be dealt with just like that.","At the same time, Long Jie was still filled with resentment toward Zhao Wei. Regardless of whether it was an opportunity for him to join Lin Yuan, Zhao Wei was the one who had put him in danger.","After protecting Zhao Wei, Long Jie still had to settle scores with Zhao Wei. At the very least, he had to vent the anger in his heart.","After Long Jie left with Zhao Wei, the space constructed by Long Jie’s own energy disappeared.","Lin Yuan’s room returned to its original state.","Zhao Chen, who was standing at the door, had no idea what was going on.","When Zhao Chen saw Zhao Wei walk out of Lin Yuan’s room, he quickly went up to him and asked, “Fourth Uncle, how was your discussion with Young","Master Lin? There shouldn’t be any unhappiness with Young Master Lin, right? If you want to trade Grade 5 Creator resources with Young Master Lin, you can let me negotiate with him!”","Zhao Wei looked at Zhao Chen with mixed feelings. There was guilt and resentment in his eyes.","“How could I have offended Young Master Lin? It’s your blessing to be able to know someone like Young Master Lin. You must grasp this blessing tightly. Don’t let this blessing escape. With a friend like Young Master Lin, your vision is no longer limited to a small family. You can broaden your horizons and set a loftier goal.","“This time, the experts from the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley will participate in the competition for the top grade blessed land in South Face City.","If possible, I can recommend you to join the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley.","Even if you join, it won’t affect your position as the City Lord of Diverse City.”","Zhao Chen’s heart skipped a beat when he heard Zhao Wei’s words. He subconsciously thought, Since a powerful faction like the Myriad Dragon","Immortal Valley has come to fight for this paradise, won’t the pressure on Lin Yuan become even greater?","Zhao Chen’s first reaction was not to consider Zhao Wei’s words or the benefits of joining the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley.","Zhao Chen asked anxiously, “Fourth Uncle, did you tell Young Master Lin about this? Young Master Lin intends to fight for this top grade blessed land. Telling him earlier will allow him to prepare in advance.”","If Zhao Wei had been thinking about Zhao Chen’s future, he would definitely be furious and think Zhao Chen was insensible.","In fact, Zhao Wei’s heart was filled with such emotions. However, when he saw Zhao Chen’s genuine worry, Zhao Wei suddenly felt that perhaps it was Zhao Chen’s personality that attracted Lin Yuan.","Zhao Wei did not answer Zhao Chen. He just patted Zhao Chen’s shoulder and left.","When Zhao Chen entered Lin Yuan’s room, he immediately informed him of the situation.","Due to Zhao Wei’s actions just now, Autumn had some opinions about Zhao Chen. Although Zhao Chen did not participate, he still brought trouble to Lin","Yuan.","However, after hearing Zhao Chen’s words, the trace of dissatisfaction in Autumn’s heart disappeared.","Lin Yuan said to Zhao Chen with a smile, “I already know about the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley. It won’t affect my goal of fighting for a top grade blessed land.”","Zhao Chen completely relaxed when he heard this. “Brother Lin, I’m relieved to hear that.”","Zhao Chen suddenly thought of something and said, “Brother Lin, my fourth uncle suggested that I join the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley just now. What do you think?”","Zhao Chen was very tempted by Zhao Wei’s suggestion. The Myriad Dragon","Immortal Valley could be said to be the best home for all dragon species’ holy spirits. Apart from being a spirit contractor, Zhao Chen had a dragon-species bloodline, and his bloodline talent was quite extraordinary. If he took advantage of the fact that the people from the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley were heading to South Face City, it would be extremely beneficial for his future.","Most importantly, joining the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley would not affect his position as the City Lord of Diverse City. Joining as the City Lord would allow him to obtain an extraordinary status.","It was impossible for the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, a faction of the North Universe, not to want to enjoy the resources of the East Universe. He had given them a chance to do so.","Of course, the matter of Zhao Chen joining the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley could not be known to Honor Absent Palace.","Logically, Zhao Chen only needed to keep this matter in his heart. The reason he told Lin Yuan was that he trusted him enough.","Lin Yuan pondered for a moment before saying in an extremely serious tone, “Brother Zhao joining the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley is indeed an excellent choice for you. No matter when or where, strength is the most important. If you choose to join the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, I can actually use resources to support you to increase your status in the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley.”","Zhao Chen was overjoyed when he heard that. Lin Yuan’s sponsorship would provide him with Creator resources and other aspects that would be of great help to his future advancement and growth.","Zhao Chen was a person who understood the ways of the world.","“Brother Lin, if you’re willing to sponsor me to raise my status in the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, just let me know if you have any requests. I’m willing to do anything!”","Regardless of what it was, Zhao Chen’s tone was extremely sincere.","It was indeed as his fourth uncle had said. Being able to meet Lin Yuan could be said to be the greatest opportunity on his path of growth.","In the past few days, Lin Yuan had planned to keep a low profile. He had already been in the limelight enough. The limelight from before had helped Lin Yuan gather enough manpower. Now, the situation would unfold naturally.","Lin Yuan received news from Winter that two Snake Lords of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace had arrived in South Face City.","Moreover, after these Snake Lords learned from Xie Lin that he had held a trade fair before, they were planning to deal with him.","Lin Yuan could not help but feel frustrated.","Lin Yuan had thought about fighting the Ancient Snake Gu Palace because of the top grade blessed land. But now was not the time.","If they started a conflict with the Ancient Snake Gu Palace now, they other factions would be the one to benefit instead.","Lin Yuan could not help but feel curious. What was the Ancient Snake Gu Palace thinking? Why would they choose to target him now?","He had the ability to hold such a trade fair, which was equivalent to revealing his strength and foundation to the outside world. Under such circumstances, it was indeed abnormal for the Ancient Snake Gu Palace to provoke him.","Lin Yuan asked Winter to explore the inner area of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace to see what was going on.","Soon, Winter sent Lin Yuan a message saying that the Ancient Snake Gu Palace had come up with such a plan to target him because they needed a large amount of pure spirit qi to revive another Snake Lord.","If they revived another Snake Lord at this time, the chances of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace successfully snatching the top grade blessed land would increase. That was why these Snake Lords decided to attack at this moment without caring about the consequences.","Even if they might be targeted by other factions because of this, they would not hesitate.","Lin Yuan was speechless.","The Ancient Snake Gu Palace was used to being domineering. When they saw resources that were useful to them, they would habitually snatch them. Were they not going to send someone over to request for a transaction?"]},{"number":3112,"title":"Chapter 3112: Abyssal Beast Domain and Nightmare Beast!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3112: Abyssal Beast Domain and Nightmare Beast!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Even if the Ancient Snake Gu Palace sent someone to propose a deal to Lin Yuan, he would not agree.","Firstly, Lin Yuan did not have sufficient Creator resources available. He lacked enough even for the Spirit World Barrier Turtle. Moreover, even if he had enough for the Spirit World Barrier Turtle, he was not willing to trade with the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, which was developing the star pirates.","Winter was invited to participate in this operation against Lin Yuan. Both Xie Lin, the City Lord of South Face City, and the Snake Lord of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, highly valued Winter, who had shown strength surpassing the Holy Spirit level.","Winter’s strength was highly advantageous to the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, given that only two Snake Lords could act independently.","At its peak, the Ancient Snake Gu Palace had always been aloof toward outsiders.","Their previous failure led the Ancient Snake Gu Palace not only to absorb snake-species lifeforms but also to treat insect-species creatures as their own. They even accepted some foreign members as guards and offerings.","These two Snake Lords knew that Winter had been very compliant after joining the alliance, which sparked their interest.","However, they had yet to personally invite Winter.","If Winter refused to join the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, the two Snake Lords planned to attack him secretly.","The Ancient Snake Gu Palace had a complete Alchemist inheritance, allowing them to refine the body of an expert into a war weapon.","They achieved their goal by transforming unwilling experts into war weapons. Through special methods, these experts eventually became loyal to the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.","The two Snake Lords did not realize that Winter, whom they considered prey, also viewed the Ancient Snake Gu Palace as prey.","Had the two Snake Lords prepared to confront Lin Yuan directly, Winter might not have held such animosity toward the Ancient Snake Gu Palace. However, their treacherous plans against Lin Yuan fueled Winter’s hatred.","If Winter were not concerned about disrupting Lin Yuan’s objectives, he would have already attacked the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.","The two Snake Lords were indeed wary of Winter, but they never anticipated his alliance with Lin Yuan.","“Young Master, Xie Lin is about to invite you to the City Lord Manor with the excuse of a deal. He will also set up a banquet in the City Lord Manor to entertain you. The Ancient Snake Gu Palace is preparing to use special snake venom and Gu worms to control you and Autumn.","“Although the strongest control method of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace can’t control me and Autumn, their snake poison places on you has a huge impact on the soul. The Ancient Snake Gu Palace is truly vicious!","“I think we need to make some preparations and strive to control the Ancient Snake Gu Palace before the top grade blessed land opens. If we can control the two Snake Lords, we will at least have a higher chance of winning in the competition over the many other factions.”","Winter had always sought stability in his work and was not as conceited as Autumn.","If there were only a few factions like the Ancient Snake Gu Palace participating in the competition, they could ensure that the top grade blessed land would be in Lin Yuan’s hands.","However, excluding the factions from the South and East Universes, there were three top factions from the West Universe and North Universe that had risen to the surface. Faerie Institution, the Abyssal Beast Domain, and the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley were not weaker than the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.","The three factions had traveled thousands of miles to come here. It was obvious that they wanted to compete for this top grade blessed land.","After thinking about it, Winter felt that the best way to ensure that he would not make any mistakes in the competition for the top grade blessed land was to attack one of the powerful factions silently.","However, it was very difficult to create such a silent environment. Now, Faerie Institution actually took the initiative to facilitate this opportunity. Since that was the case, how could he not accept?","Otherwise, Winter would not have made such a rash suggestion to Lin Yuan at this time.","Lin Yuan was rather surprised that the Ancient Snake Gu Palace would attack him at this time.","This was because with the Ancient Snake Gu Palace’s previous interaction with him, they should not be able to accurately know his strength and ability. Lin Yuan was surprised that the Ancient Snake Gu Palace would target him under such circumstances.","However, Lin Yuan was certain that the Ancient Snake Gu Palace would definitely create an extremely secretive environment when targeting him.","At the very least, he could not let Fortune Treasure Palace know about this.","No matter how confident the Ancient Snake Gu Palace was, they would definitely be afraid of being targeted by other factions.","Even he had received news that many factions were heading to South Face City. It was impossible for the Ancient Snake Gu Palace not to know.","“Winter, do you know why the Ancient Snake Gu Palace is determined to target us at a time like this?”","Winter hurriedly said, “Young Master, I’ve investigated the relevant information. According to my understanding, the Ancient Snake Gu Palace has been trying to obtain pure spirit qi through various channels over the years.","“The Ancient Snake Gu Palace has always been in a state of seclusion. According to my observations, the two Snake Lords are rather weak. Even the energy in their bodies is not flowing smoothly. I suspect they want to obtain a large amount of pure spirit qi from you because of these Snake Lords. I can’t think of any other possibility.","“In any case, whatever plans they have after this operation can’t be hidden from us. The situation in South Face City is extremely complicated now. My suggestion is that Spring shouldn’t participate in this operation against the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.”","Lin Yuan did not want to see the upcoming collision with the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.","This was because the current South Face City looked calm and peaceful. The various factions were only engaged in small fights. However, in reality, once there was a storm, it would be like pouring a bottle of water into a pot of oil. Not only would it attract the attention of many factions, but it was very likely that it would also lead many factions into it.","However, all the risks had benefits in secret. Lin Yuan had never fought with a faction like the Ancient Snake Gu Palace before.","Actually, if the Ancient Snake Gu Palace really needed spirit qi crystals, Lin Yuan could consider cooperating with them.","However, the Ancient Snake Gu Palace did not show any intention of cooperating. Furthermore, Lin Yuan was really displeased with their sinister method of occupying South Face City.","Lin Yuan was certain that the Xie Lin was not the only one from the Ancient Snake Gu Palace. The Ancient Water Pythons were also related to the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.","The Ancient Snake Gu Palace had already reached into the Scarlet Territory and their goal was not small!","Lin Yuan did not inform Ling Muzhuo about the upcoming operation.","Although Ling Muzhuo was his ally, he was most likely unwilling to participate in this conflict against the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.","Even if Ling Muzhuo was willing to participate, Lin Yuan did not want to owe him a favor.","Besides, Xie Lin invited only him this time. If he brought Ling Muzhuo with him, there might not be any follow-up actions.","At present, in a secret room of the Zhao family...","Zhao Wei was kneeling on the ground with a terrified expression, his eyes filled with fear.","Long Jie had already transformed into his human form. It was really inconvenient for him to appear in his original form in Zhao family.","Long Jie was reviewing his previous contact with Lin Yuan. After calming down, Long Jie realized that although he had lost his freedom, he had obtained more opportunities. These opportunities were very precious to him.","As an Elder of the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, Long Jie’s strength had basically reached its limit. It was very difficult for him to make a new breakthrough.","The main reason was that Long Jie could no longer obtain more high-grade Creator resources with his current identity. If he could obtain more high-grade Creator resources, Long Jie still had room for improvement.","Long Jie did not dare to believe Lin Yuan’s words fully, but Lin Yuan had indeed given him a chance and a possibility.","After thinking about it, Long Jie felt that he did not suffer a loss.","Long Jie already knew that Zhao Wei’s nephew had a good relationship with Lin Yuan. Under such circumstances, it was inconvenient for Long Jie to deal with Zhao Wei.","Moreover, Zhao Wei had no intention of harming him. He had informed him as soon as he discovered the opportunity. He was sufficiently loyal.","“Get up. You didn’t do anything wrong this time.”","In Zhao Wei’s opinion, his actions had caused Long Jie to lose his freedom and become someone else’s servant. He would definitely end up in a miserable state. He did not expect Long Jie to let him off.","Suddenly, Long Jie thought of something and said, “It’s an eventful period now. You should stay in the Zhao family. Try your best not to let the Zhao family participate in the battle for the top grade blessed land. If you can’t protect the Zhao family, you have to do your best to protect yourself.”","After saying that, an obscure spatial energy surged out of Long Jie’s body and right on the heels of that, Long Jie’s figure disappeared from this secret room of the Zhao family.","Long Jie had already sensed that the people from the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley had arrived in South Face City. Long Jie was prepared to meet the people from the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley.","Long Jie’s meeting with the people from the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley was accompanied by the mission that Lin Yuan had given him. Fortunately, Lin Yuan’s request was not considered betraying the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley.","Originally, Long Jie was quite confident in fighting for this top grade blessed land. The Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley had sent many people this time. Apart from these people on the surface, there were also a few high-level Elders accompanying them.","However, he did not know why the Ancient Snake Gu Palace had leaked the news of the appearance of this top grade blessed land in secret, causing many factions to fight over it.","With so many factions gathered in South Face City, even the strongest faction did not dare to guarantee that they could obtain this top grade blessed land. As the saying went, “Two fists are no match for four hands.”","No matter how powerful a faction was, they could not stand being targeted by thousands of factions. Especially after meeting Lin Yuan, he knew that Lin Yuan also had the intention to fight for this top grade blessed land.","Not only could Long Jie not see through Autumn’s strength, but he could not even resist Autumn’s methods.","In the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, only the sleeping Lord Ancestral Dragon could make him feel such pressure.","As for who was stronger between Lord Ancestral Dragon and Autumn, Long Jie did not know.","The major factions were secretly plotting.","Faerie Institution was the most high-profile when they arrived in South Face City. The four high-level faeries arrived together with more than 20 middle-level faeries and directly moved into a powerful local faction in South Face City. They did not hide their relationship with this local faction at all.","On the contrary, the Abyssal Beast Domain was extremely low-key.","If not for the conflict between the Abyssal Beast Domain and Faerie Institution, they would not have known that the people from the Abyssal Beast Domain had already arrived.","The alliance that Spring joined was formed by the people from the Abyssal Beast Domain.","After the Abyssal Beast Domain arrived in South Face City, it immediately took over the alliance, and Spring reported it to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan was both surprised and delighted.","Currently, the powerful forces in South Face City were seemingly Faerie Institution, the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, Abyssal Beast Domain, and Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley.","Three out of the four factions had interacted with Lin Yuan. Apart from Faerie Institution, which allowed Lin Yuan to control the information of the three factions, he had a large advantage in fighting for the top grade blessed land.","“Young Master, the leader of the team from the Abyssal Beast Domain is from the Nightmare Beasts. Judging from his attire and the tattoo on his face, he should be the Archbishop of the Nightmare Beasts.","“The Abyssal Beast Domain is made up of many factions. There are a total of 12 species that have the power to make decisions and rule. The Nightmare Beasts’ ruling power is enough to rank in the top three.","“The Nightmare Beasts are best at scheming and competing. They like to hide in the dark because of the characteristics of their bloodline. This Archbishop of the Nightmare Beasts is inferior to me, and this is before my strength has fully recovered.","“Young Master, if you have Grade 6 Creator resources, I won’t be restrained when fighting this Archbishop of the Nightmare Beasts. Instead, I can directly defeat him!","“According to my senses, there are indeed experts hiding among the Abyssal Beast Domain, but the strongest is still this Archbishop.","“Compared to Abyssal Beast Domain, Faerie Institution has hidden themselves very well this time. On the surface, Faerie Institution is led by two pinnacle higher faeries. But in fact, there’s a faerie king hidden in the dark.","“If we hadn’t discovered the existence of this faerie king, this conflict between the Abyssal Beast Domain and Faerie Institution wouldn’t have ended so quickly when the Abyssal Beast Domain had the advantage.","“Young Master, the situation in South Face City is more urgent than I imagined.”","Spring had always been cautious. She said this because she valued Lin Yuan’s safety very much. She was afraid that if a dispute arose, she, Autumn, and Winter would be restrained and Lin Yuan would be exposed to danger.","Compared to Lin Yuan’s safety, this top grade blessed land was actually nothing.","Spring knew Autumn and Winter’s personalities very well.","Autumn had always been headstrong. Sometimes, he was even a little rash. As for Winter, it was very likely that he would not be able to understand and grasp relevant information in the City Lord Manor.","Under such circumstances, she had the responsibility to remind Lin Yuan. If she were to threaten Lin Yuan’s safety, it would be the greatest dereliction of duty as his follower.","Lin Yuan’s eyes flickered. This was the first time he had encountered a situation that martial force could not resolve since he had arrived at the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Although Lin Yuan did not have a deep understanding of top grade blessed lands, there would always be top grade blessed lands opening in the Sky Beyond the Clouds every tens of thousands of years.","The opening of a top grade blessed land should not have attracted so many factions to mobilize such powerful forces. Lin Yuan had had this feeling when he probed Long Jie’s memories.","Now that the Abyssal Beast Domain and Faerie Institution had sent out their forces, it further confirmed Lin Yuan’s thoughts."]},{"number":3113,"title":"Chapter 3113: An Ambush Begins!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3113: An Ambush Begins!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“Spring, do you think it’s reasonable for these factions to send such a powerful force to fight for this top grade blessed land?”","Zhao Chen extended an invitation to Lin Yuan with the intention of bringing him to this top grade blessed land to reap some benefits. At first, he did not know that Lin Yuan planned to contend for this top grade blessed land.","When inviting Lin Yuan, Zhao Chen had said that the Zhao family had participated in the emergence of a top grade blessed land before and acquired a substantial amount of resources in the process.","Subconsciously, Zhao Chen had already agreed to participate in the competition for the resources of this top grade blessed land and believed there wouldn’t be much risk involved. However, the current situation was completely different from what Zhao Chen had expected.","As for the Grade 6 Creator resources that Spring mentioned, as long as the Spirit World Barrier Turtle leveled up, Lin Yuan would be able to produce them immediately.","Fortunately, Morbius was producing spirit qi crystals every moment.","If he could take back the two batches of spirit qi crystals he traded with Xie Lin—as long as this top grade blessed land didn’t open in two weeks—he could increase the strength of the Spirit World Barrier Turtle.","By that time, with the resources produced by the Grade 6 Creator, Spring, Autumn, and Winter would be able to increase their strength. It would make them more confident in contending for this top grade blessed land.","Spring pondered for a moment before replying, “Young Master, I was waiting for you to appear after reincarnation in that Class 1 world. I haven’t been in the Sky Beyond the Clouds for quite some time, so I might not be very familiar with the current situation there. Therefore, my judgment may not be accurate.","“If we look at past situations, it’s not quite normal for various factions to deploy such a strong force to contend for this top grade blessed land. Once the contention begins, there will inevitably be losses, and before the contention begins, all factions will surely consider the losses.","“Therefore, when I saw the forces dispatched by the Abyssal Beast Domain and Faerie Institution, I couldn’t help but feel skeptical. I have a feeling that there’s more to this place than just the appearance of a top grade blessed land. Of course, this is just my speculation.”","Spring had never been too confident about things that she could not be sure of.","Upon hearing Spring’s guess, Lin Yuan said in a serious tone, “Spring, in a week’s time, I will begin to provide you with Grade 6 Creator resources. At that time, your as well as Autumn and Winter’s strength will be enhanced.","“The Ancient Snake Gu Palace intends to make a move against me. I’ll confront them with Autumn and Winter. On your end, remain silent for now and avoid exposing your strength. After this operation, once you’ve enhanced your strength with Grade 6 Creator resources, then revealing your prowess won’t be too late!”","In fact, after knowing that Grade 6 Creator resources could restore the strength of Spring, Autumn, and Winter, Lin Yuan had wanted to lie low for a week. In any case, Lin Yuan currently had no plans to trade Creator resources externally, but the Ancient Snake Gu Palace would not give him that time.","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, Spring hurriedly said, “Young Master, if you need me to coordinate actions against the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, I can do so. If I act discreetly, I may not necessarily be detected by the Abyssal Beast Domain.”","Lin Yuan replied in an extremely serious tone, “Spring, the leader of the Nightmare Beasts has just come to South Face City to take over this loose alliance. He’s definitely focused on this alliance right now. You don’t need to take on this risk. The news from the Abyssal Beast Domain is very important to us.","“If the Ancient Snake Gu Palace is indeed making extensive preparations, they won’t choose to confront us head-on even after Autumn and Winter demonstrate their strength.”","While speaking, Lin Yuan’s tone was filled with trust in Autumn and Winter. Furthermore, to ensure that the Spirit World Barrier Turtle could reach the Divine Kingdom level within a week, the spirit qi crystals traded to the Ancient Snake Gu Palace must be retrieved.","Upon hearing that, Spring didn’t say much more. Like Lin Yuan, Spring was very confident in their strengths. Even if their current strength hadn’t fully recovered, they could still suppress the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, even at its peak. Moreover, the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, which had already declined and retreated from the world, stood no chance.","Not long after Winter sent the message to Lin Yuan, South Face City’s City Lord, Xie Lin, personally came to Fortune Treasure Palace to invite Lin Yuan to the City Lord Manor for a chat.","Lin Yuan had been staying in Fortune Treasure Palace, and Ling Muzhuo was the first to know about Xie Lin’s visit. It was indeed somewhat unusual for Xie Lin to come and invite Lin Yuan again to the City Lord Manor, especially considering that Lin Yuan had just had dinner with him there. Ling Muzhuo disregarded Xie Lin’s face and directly took him to see Lin Yuan, asking Xie Lin to wait at the door while he informed Lin Yuan of the information first.","When Ling Muzhuo saw Lin Yuan, he said in an extremely serious tone, “Brother Lin, Xie Lin came to find you and invited you to the City Lord Manor. He must have ulterior motives. Now that various factions are gathered, I believe most of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace’s people are also present. They are undoubtedly planning to take action against you.","“I suggest you not accept Xie Lin’s invitation. At this moment, even if you decline Xie Lin’s invitation, he won’t dare to act. Engaging in conflict now would make us targets regardless of the outcome.”","Lin Yuan could sense Ling Muzhuo’s concern and care for him through his words and expressions.","Lin Yuan said with a smile, “Brother Ling, the situation is ever-changing. If the Ancient Snake Gu Palace is coming after me, it suits my intentions perfectly! It’s a good opportunity for me to understand the true strength of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace and maybe even eliminate a competitor.”","As Lin Yuan spoke, his face revealed an obvious killing intent. Ling Muzhuo had thought that Lin Yuan would panic when he received the news. He had not expected such a reaction. Lin Yuan’s words clearly indicated that he didn’t take the Ancient Snake Gu Palace seriously. His tone suggested that he saw them merely as prey.","Ling Muzhuo was very surprised by Lin Yuan’s confidence, especially since Lin Yuan clearly knew about the existence of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace. Through their previous interactions, Ling Muzhuo felt that Lin Yuan’s understanding of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace may not be less than his own.","In this situation, Lin Yuan showed no signs of panic, so Ling Muzhuo refrained from trying to persuade him further. “Brother Lin, I’ve said I want to form an alliance with you. Since you’re confident about taking on the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, count me in as well. Is there anything I can do in this operation?”","Lin Yuan looked at Ling Muzhuo seriously. Upon seeing the firm expression on Ling Muzhuo’s face, he spoke in a similarly serious tone. “Brother Ling, I don’t appreciate some of the actions of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, and they seem to have ulterior motives against me. My confrontation with the Ancient Snake Gu Palace is purely an act of self-defense, and it’s understandable even if it’s known to other factions.","“Fortune Treasure Palace has always presented itself as friendly, engaging with various factions. It wouldn’t be appropriate for us to get involved in the conflict with the Ancient Snake Gu Palace. Since I’m determined to confront them, I’m confident in defeating them.","“Brother Ling, you don’t have to follow me to the City Lord Manor. If you really want to help me, please do your best to temporarily block any communication from the City Lord Manor after I go there with Xie Lin. As for other matters, I’ll handle them myself.”","Lin Yuan was indeed confident in resisting the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, but he did not know if the Ancient Snake Gu Palace had cooperated with other large factions to form an alliance. Lin Yuan did not wish for a third party to enter the arena to help the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.","Ling Muzhuo patted his chest when he heard Lin Yuan’s request.","“The initial goal of this trip to South Face City is also to contend for the top grade blessed land, and I have enough manpower at my disposal. Even if a Snake Lord breaks through the blockade, I can ensure that they won’t spread the news.","“However, if I mobilize my forces to block the City Lord Manor, I will definitely attract the attention of other factions, which means I won’t be able to maintain the blockade for too long. Otherwise, other factions will send people to investigate the situation and prevent any uncontrollable variables. I estimate that I can only maintain the blockade for a maximum of half a day.”","“Regardless of whether Xie Lin is from the Ancient Snake Gu Palace or not, he is still the chosen City Lord of Honor Absent Palace and a member of the Honor Absent Parliament. If this matter were to spread, it would be very easy for people to seize on and it would attract the attention of the Honor Absent Palace.","“Honor Absent Palace is formed by the convergence of many factions. Any faction in the East Universe that doesn’t comply with Honor Absent Palace’s rules will face retaliation from the coalition of factions that form Honor Absent Palace. While the majority of factions may not adhere to the overt rules, breaking them can only be done covertly.","“Brother Lin, I hope you can pay attention to this matter. I don’t want you to become a target because of this and find it difficult to establish yourself in the East Universe.”","Lin Yuan pondered for a moment before replying. “Half a day is enough. Moreover, it won’t take half a day to fight.”","Lin Yuan picked up the Three Treasures Tea on the table and drank it in one gulp before continuing to speak to Ling Muzhuo. “Brother Ling, don’t make City Lord Xie wait. Bring me there! I want to see what methods and lineup the Ancient Snake Gu Palace has prepared to deal with me.”","In the VIP room of Fortune Treasure Palace...","Xie Lin was extremely dissatisfied with Ling Muzhuo. He had only invited Lin Yuan, but Ling Muzhuo insisted on participating. Xie Lin was afraid of potential variables, which might affect the Snake Lord’s plan.","Xie Lin relaxed when he saw Lin Yuan being brought to the VIP room by Ling Muzhuo.","Xie Lin had never personally experienced the aura released by Autumn, so he wasn’t clear about Autumn’s strength. He only heard from his assistant, Jia Mingda, that Autumn’s aura and strength were astonishing. But no matter how strong he was, could he really surpass a Snake Lord?!","Xie Lin didn’t take Lin Yuan too seriously in his heart. Xie Lin’s worry stemmed from not wanting to escalate this matter and attract the attention of various factions within South Face City.","On this point, Xie Lin and Lin Yuan had the same thoughts.","“City Lord Xie, I’ve brought Brother Lin to you. He was invited by me, so you mustn’t neglect him. Before tonight, ensure that he returns to Fortune Treasure Palace. I’ve arranged a banquet tonight to entertain him.”","Xie Lin laughed at Ling Muzhuo’s words. “I indeed regard Young Master Lin as an esteemed guest. Otherwise, I wouldn’t have personally extended the invitation to him. However, whether Young Master Lin is willing to return tonight depends on his own wishes. Are you suggesting that I should compel Young Master Lin to return if he’s unwilling?”","With that, Xie Lin made a gesture of invitation toward Lin Yuan.","Xie Lin could not help but ask upon seeing Autumn following Lin Yuan, “Young Master Lin, are you still only bringing one servant to the City Lord Manor this time?”","Lin Yuan looked at Xie Lin with a faint smile. “Why? Does City Lord Xie want me to bring more people? Is there any danger in your City Lord Manor? Even if there is indeed danger, shouldn’t it be the responsibility of your City Lord Manor to handle it? After all, you wouldn’t expect the subordinates of a guest like me to work for your City Lord Manor, would you?”","Xie Lin was unaware of the sarcasm in Lin Yuan’s words. In Xie Lin’s eyes, Lin Yuan was just a naive kid with an extraordinary background who had only lived for a few decades. After all, Xie Lin didn’t think that news of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace targeting Lin Yuan would leak out.","It was great that Lin Yuan only brought one guard to the City Lord Manor. This way, the two Snake Lords could control the situation at lightning speed and prevent any accidents from happening.","What Xie Lin was afraid of was that Lin Yuan would become vigilant and bring many people to the City Lord Manor. If Lin Yuan brought too many people, it would be easy for something to happen.","“How could that be? The City Lord Manor can be considered the safest place in the entire South Face City. There’s no danger within the City Lord Manor. I invited Young Master Lin here to express gratitude for your willingness to engage in such significant transactions with me in the past.","“This banquet not only serves as an opportunity to make acquaintance with Young Master Lin but also carries a sense of gratitude. I hope that even if Young Master Lin departs from South Face City, there will still be possibilities for us to engage in further transactions in the future.”","Lin Yuan’s expression didn’t change, but Ling Muzhuo couldn’t stand Xie Lin’s shamelessness and couldn’t help but snort. If Xie Lin wasn’t targeting Lin Yuan but someone else, he would have disappeared without a trace.","In fact, after Ling Muzhuo found out about Xie Lin’s identity, he already knew why Fortune Treasure Palace had suffered such a huge loss in South Face City all these years. Before the accounts were settled, Ling Muzhuo wasn’t this angry. But after finishing the settlement, Ling Muzhuo wished nothing more than to confront Xie Lin directly, regardless of the consequences.","Upon hearing Xie Lin’s words, Lin Yuan showed no emotional change whatsoever. He appeared like a young nobleman out for a stroll, accompanied only by his guard, Autumn, as he followed Xie Lin to the City Lord Manor.","On the way to the City Lord Manor, Xie Lin employed various means to conceal his tracks, and he took the opportunity to explain this to Lin Yuan.","“Young Master Lin, currently, you’ve formed an alliance within South Face City, comprising numerous factions, and its influence is quite formidable. As the City Lord, if I openly interact with you, it will make other factions perceive that we’ve initiated cooperation, which could potentially make us targets of those factions.","“I don’t believe this aligns with Young Master Lin’s desires. Otherwise, you would undoubtedly encounter numerous challenges in your pursuit of top grade blessed lands. It’s therefore advantageous for us to evade the scrutiny of certain other factions.”"]},{"number":3114,"title":"Chapter 3114: Fate Transferring Nine Desolation Scorpion!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3114: Fate Transferring Nine Desolation Scorpion!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Xie Lin made every effort to clarify the situation to Lin Yuan, worried that his explanation might seem implausible. Fortunately, Lin Yuan didn’t dwell on the issue, which brought Xie Lin a sense of relief.","After Lin Yuan entered the City Lord Manor, Ling Muzhuo waited for half an hour and immediately mobilized people to guard the City Lord Manor closely.","At that moment, Ling Muzhuo would stop anyone who entered the City Lord Manor. Ling Muzhuo was deeply concerned about the impending clash between Lin Yuan and the Ancient Snake Gu Palace. He truly valued Lin Yuan, and there were indeed transactions between them.","Ling Muzhuo’s genuine concern for Lin Yuan stemmed from the potential value he could bring to Fortune Treasure Palace and Ling Muzhuo himself.","Ling Muzhuo was reluctant to lose such a valuable ally due to this operation. If something happened to Lin Yuan and he died in the hands of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, Ling Muzhuo would not be able to find a Creator resource channel as convenient as Lin Yuan’s.","After bringing Lin Yuan to the City Lord Manor, Xie Lin heaved a sigh of relief. He brought Lin Yuan all the way to the banquet hall where the three of them had gathered. Xie Lin’s gaze immediately became sharp.","However, Xie Lin did not show it immediately. Instead, he spoke to Lin Yuan. “Young Master Lin, the Creator resources in your hands are very useful to me. I wonder if I can trade with you more?”","Upon hearing this, Lin Yuan laughed in a frivolous manner. “City Lord Xie, you’re really humorous. Who doesn’t need the high-quality Creator resources in my hands? Even if lifeforms in the abyss obtain this pure spirit qi, they can use it to refine their own crystals. However, my Creator resources are not something that you can trade for at will. I’ll only entertain the idea if you can offer superior resources compared to before.”","Xie Lin sneered. “I don’t have any better resources on hand. I’ve already traded them all with you. This time when I called you here, it wasn’t for a trade but to directly obtain Creator resources from you. I believe, you should be willing to extend me credit for the sake of survival, shouldn’t you?”","As soon as Xie Lin finished speaking, several auras shot toward Lin Yuan and Autumn. These auras did not have any killing intent toward Lin Yuan. They even deliberately avoided him, afraid that if they were too strong, they would cause him to become demented or die here. If Lin Yuan died there, the trading channels would be cut off. However, these auras were filled with decisive killing intent toward Autumn.","Lin Yuan’s unyielding attitude caused the Ancient Snake Gu Palace’s Snake Lord to be dissatisfied.","The Snake Lords were prepared to test whether Lin Yuan, with his sole guard eliminated, would remain as audacious as he currently appeared without any support.","Despite being targeted by so many auras, Autumn did not immediately reveal his strength. Instead, he allowed these auras to target him. Then, he only used his strength to resist against the strongest among them. What Autumn wanted to do was to attract as many experts as possible from the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.","Ever since Lin Yuan entered the City Lord Manor, Winter had been prepared to receive him at any time.","The division of labor between Autumn and Winter was clear. Firstly, Autumn would lure the experts of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, and Winter would prevent the experts from escaping. Then, they would surround the Ancient Snake Gu Palace from the outside.","At this moment, the two Snake Lords of Ancient Snake Gu Palace appeared.","The strength Autumn displayed greatly surprised the two Snake Lords, especially the weaker Snake Lord. He seemed to be extremely wary of Autumn, fearing that Autumn might have plans to use him as a scapegoat in case of resistance.","At this level of strength, these experts possessed remarkable resilience and almost always had some cards up their sleeves. Even those with slightly greater strength couldn’t guarantee gaining an advantage in a confrontation.","Both Snake Lords harbored murderous intent toward Lin Yuan, who stood beside Autumn.","The fact that Lin Yuan who had lived for more than 50 years could have such an expert as a guard meant that his faction must be on par with the Ancient Snake Gu Palace in terms of strength. Moreover, judging from Lin Yuan’s Creator resources, it was not impossible for his faction to be stronger than the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.","Now that they had trapped him and his guard within the City Lord Manor, killing them to ensure that no information leaked out would be preferable to facing retaliation from this faction later on.","In the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, there was no such thing as cooperation. Otherwise, they would not have used such a method to target Lin Yuan. The two Snake Lords were prepared to use their trump cards, but what puzzled them was that after using their trump cards, the two of them fell into a disadvantageous position in the battle.","Autumn said coldly, “You should be from the Ancient Snake Gu Palace. What’s your Ancient Snake Gu Palace’s motive for targeting my young master now? Let go of him and let this matter go. I won’t hold it against you. If not, don’t blame me for fighting with all I’ve got. Even if I can’t kill the two of you, it’s not difficult for me to drag one of you down with me.”","Autumn’s words were meant to provoke the two Snake Lords into calling for reinforcements from the Ancient Snake Gu Palace after realizing they couldn’t handle Autumn alone.","After saying that, Autumn deliberately released a little of his strength, allowing his aura to faintly overwhelm the strongest Snake Lord. The strength revealed made the two Snake Lords reveal grave expressions.","Facing Autumn’s threat, the two Snake Lords were extremely wary. After living for so many years and reaching such a level of strength, nobody would willingly choose to die. The two Snake Lords were astonished at why Autumn’s aura had surged so significantly.","Especially the weaker Snake Lord, who was afraid that Autumn might go berserk and target him, said to the stronger Snake Lord, “Third Brother, why don’t we let them go now? Otherwise, the two of us might not be able to take him down. Moreover, even if we do, we might not be able to obtain the pure spirit qi we want.”","As he spoke, the Snake Lord looked at Xie Lin with a malicious gaze. The two Snake Lords had asked Xie Lin about Lin Yuan’s strength. Xie Lin said that Lin Yuan had brought a guard with him, but he didn’t say that this guard was so powerful.","The Snake Lord, who was clearly stronger, said firmly, “We can’t allow them to leave. If we let them go, how could we ensure they do not seek revenge later? Eighth Brother has been asleep for so many years. Don’t tell me you can’t even understand the current situation?","“More than half of the factions that came here have a grudge against our Ancient Snake Gu Palace. Once the news spreads, the Faerie Institution will definitely be the first to attack us. Back in the day, Second Brother killed a higher faerie in order to level up. The Faerie Institution won’t just let this go easily. We must keep them here!”","As he spoke, the Snake Lord let out a hiss, and right on the heels of that, several auras rushed over. However, these auras were inferior to the two Snake Lords.","Xie Lin noticed the gaze of one of the Snake Lords directed toward him, realizing that this operation he had facilitated had stirred dissatisfaction in the Snake Lords due to the inherent risks involved. He had to do something. Otherwise, if the Snake Lords came to","settle scores with him later, he would be in trouble!","Thinking of the experts recruited by the alliance, Xie Lin hurriedly sent a signal to gather these experts.","At this time, Winter was thinking that he was the most suitable person to enter the venue. When he received the news from Xie Lin, Winter showed a cold smile on his face.","The Ancient Snake Gu Palace was really bold to plan to assassinate Lord Saint. It had been years since Winter had utilized his true strength to assist Lord Saint in combat. Serving and fighting for Lord Saint was Winter’s utmost desire as a loyal follower. Moreover, Winter had not fought for so many years and had long wanted to stretch his muscles.","It was impossible for the Ancient Snake Gu Palace to only send two Snake Lords. Winter knew that the Ancient Snake Gu Palace definitely had a backup plan.","After sensing the auras of the two Snake Lords, Winter had already guessed why the Ancient Snake Gu Palace wanted so many spirit qi crystals. It was to revive these Snake Lords and provide them with energy.","The reason the Ancient Snake Gu Palace had been in seclusion for so many years was not because they were targeted by many wary factions. Instead, it was because the Ancient Snake Gu Palace had discovered a way to obtain longevity.","Winter sensed the aura of the Fate Transferring Nine Desolation Scorpion from the two Snake Lords of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace. The Fate Transferring Nine Desolation Scorpion was a lifeform that was comparable to the Enlightenment Cicada.","Due to the Lifespan Mouse, Lin Yuan looked down on the Fate Transferring Nine Desolation Scorpion, which had strong side effects. Despite this, for other powerful lifeforms in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, embedding scorpion poison granted them near-immortality. Though their consciousness was limited, each implantation weakened them, and a large amount of pure spirit qi was needed to recover their strength, the Fate Transferring Nine Desolation Scorpion remained the most invaluable asset.","Before Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter went to that Class 1 world to establish Epoch God Palace, the news of the Fate Transferring Nine Desolation Scorpion appearing in the Sky Beyond the Clouds had spread.","It turned out that the Fate Transferring Nine Desolation Scorpion had been taken by the Ancient Snake Gu Palace. This was truly a stroke of immense fortune! It was unfortunate that the Ancient Snake Gu Palace’s fate wasn’t favorable, as they’d set their sights on Lord Saint!","Implanting the venom of the Fate Transferring Nine Desolation Scorpion indeed granted endless lifespan, but the corresponding cost was that one’s strength would not be able to progress further.","These Snake Lords had lived in the Sky Beyond the Clouds for countless years. After capturing them, as long as Lin Yuan could pry open their mouths, he could easily know the development of the Sky Beyond the Clouds over the years.","To Lin Yuan now, this was no less valuable than this top-grade blessed land itself as it would probably be very difficult to find old fellows like these Snake Lords in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Even a faerie king wouldn’t have such a long lifespan.","These two Snake Lords were quite displeased with Xie Lin’s decision to gather these allies. However, they understood that this was indeed the best way to enhance their own strength and leverage. Anyway, these experts that Xie Lin had gathered wouldn’t be able to recognize them. If anyone did happen to recognize them, they could conveniently be killed for sustenance.","They could take this opportunity to eliminate these experts. If they could not be persuaded to pledge allegiance, using them as sustenance would still be a form of loyalty to the Ancient Serpent Gu Palace in its own way!","Xie Lin immediately gave the order after these experts arrived, “Now, go and take care of that guy over there. Before joining the alliance, you all swore to stand together with the alliance. I believe none of you will break your word. Now, if you help us out here, I’ll provide you with a substantial amount of resources. You’ll also have priority access to the resources produced by this top-grade blessed land!”","Xie Lin’s words were indeed enticing, but the experts present were not fools. They all possessed the ability to think for themselves. Autumn’s aura was clearly the strongest among them, much stronger than theirs. If they helped Xie Lin at this moment and offended such a powerful enemy, wouldn’t that be akin to inviting death? Who would want to die if they could live?","Xie Lin’s face darkened when he saw that the experts he had gathered had no intention of making a move.","Just then, Xie Lin heard Winter speak. “I can help. It’s just that I need more benefits when it’s done. I recognize him. He should be Young Master Lin, who trades Creator resources with various factions, right? If you can obtain pure Creator resources after this, I need you to give me a share!”","Winter was displaying an insane amount of greed outwardly, a greed that greatly displeased both Xie Lin and the two Snake Lords. If Xie Lin and the two Snake Lords really obtained pure spirit qi, they wouldn’t just refrain from trading with Winter. On the contrary, Winter would naturally become prey for the Snake Lords of the Ancient Serpent Gu Palace.","Although they weren’t going to give out this resource, Xie Lin and the two Snake Lords agreed to Winter’s request.","Even though Winter agreed to help, the other experts did not take action. They were already thinking of leaving the City Lord Manor. The main reason why they joined the City Lord Manor in the beginning was because they wanted to obtain a stable channel to obtain resources. However, the more they interacted with these experts, the more they felt that something was wrong with Xie Lin’s situation.","Winter had already stood behind the weaker Snake Lord and spoke. “His strength far surpasses mine. I can only help with feigned attacks or deal with that little guy over there. If you want me to fight him to the death, I can’t do it.”","Winter’s words once again gained the trust of the two Snake Lords. In such a critical situation, the two Snake Lords were no longer prepared to keep Lin Yuan alive. They immediately said, “In that case, help us deal with the little guy standing over there.”","“A guard who can’t even protect their master won’t have a place to go even if they leave here. Consider joining our Ancient Serpent Gu Palace. By joining us, I can grant you immortality. As long as you behave obediently, having an endless lifespan is not difficult at all. If you miss this opportunity, there won’t be such a good opportunity after your master’s death!”","This Snake Lord’s words were not only intended to recruit Autumn and gain his loyalty but also aimed to unsettle Autumn’s mind. Both Snake Lords could see Autumn’s loyalty to Lin Yuan. It was basically","impossible to recruit such a loyal person and make him betray his savior."]},{"number":3115,"title":"Chapter 3115: Supreme Poison Valley!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3115: Supreme Poison Valley!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","How could a person who was willing to fight back even when facing death allow their master to be attacked or controlled?","The task assigned by the Snake Lord seemed simple at first glance, but in reality, it was meant to make Winter share Autumn’s anger, then seize the opportunity to severely hurt Autumn. However, before the Snake Lord could finish speaking, a chilling cold suddenly came from behind.","Right on the heels of that, the weaker Snake Lord lost control of its body. It was as if his body had been frozen solid.","Once Winter acted, it was with full force. Seeing the Snake Lord about to regain control of the body, a large amount of frost fell, completely sealing the Snake Lord into ice crystals.","Although the Snake Lord caused several cracks to appear on the ice crystal when he struggled, he was ultimately unable to escape the control of the ice crystal as he wished.","After attacking the weaker Snake Lord, Winter immediately attacked the stronger Snake Lord.","Autumn nodded at Lin Yuan, and the latter entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","He did not give the surrounding the Ancient Snake Gu Palace experts a chance to target him and threaten Autumn and Winter with his safety. When Autumn and Winter had resolved everything, they would naturally inform Lin Yuan. At that time, Lin Yuan would come out of the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Autumn and Winter had informed Lin Yuan that the two Snake Lords had the aura of special insect lifeforms like the Fate Transferring Nine Desolation Scorpion.","Under the explanations provided by Autumn and Winter, Lin Yuan came to understand the true nature of the Fate Transferring Nine Desolation Scorpion.","Although Lin Yuan already had a way to obtain an endless lifespan, he was still very curious about lifeforms like the Fate Transferring Nine Desolation Scorpion. Lin Yuan could not trade the Lifespan Mouse, but he could trade the Fate Transferring Nine Desolation Scorpion’s venom.","Lifeforms that increased their lifespan through the venom of the Fate Transferring Nine Desolation Scorpion needed to absorb the venom again every tens of thousands of years. Otherwise, not only would their bodies accelerate aging, but the onset of the venom would also subject these lifeforms to an excruciating state of torment. Therefore, those who used the poison of the Fate Transferring Nine Desolation Scorpion to prolong their lives needed to continuously trade for the scorpion’s poison to survive.","Once this spiritual material for extending lifespan hit the trading market, it would command an extraordinarily high price. To some extent, spiritual materials that could increase lifespan would be more valuable than even the most high-end Creator resources. After all, even Grade 5 Creators had no means to achieve immortality.","In the Spirit Lock spatial zone, Lin Yuan took out Morbius’ newly produced spirit qi crystals and quietly strengthened the Spirit World Barrier Turtle.","This time, Autumn and Winter had to use schemes to fight against the Ancient Snake Gu Palace. This made Lin Yuan deeply realize the need to increase Autumn and Winter’s strength.","Sensing Lin Yuan’s expectations, the Spirit World Barrier Turtle used all its strength to absorb the pure spirit qi in the spirit qi crystals.","Its strength increased at an extremely fast speed, and it finally broke through the barrier of Myth Breed and advanced to Suzerain/Creation.","After nearly three hours, Lin Yuan received Autumn and Winter’s message.","After leaving the Spirit Lock spatial zone, Lin Yuan realized that there were four severely injured giant snakes lying in front of Autumn and Winter.","Winter stood up as usual, but Autumn’s face was a little pale. It was obvious that he had suffered serious injuries.","When he saw Lin Yuan’s concerned gaze, he smiled and patted his shoulder. “Young Master, my injuries are not serious. Furthermore, my roots are not injured. It won’t take long for me to recover. Having not lifted a finger for so many years then getting injured by these few old folks who haven’t even fully recovered is truly embarrassing!”","Despite sustaining injuries in the battle just now, Autumn still held a contemptuous attitude toward the Snake Lords.","Winter reported the situation to Lin Yuan in a serious tone, “Young Master, despite some unexpected incidents, the operation went smoothly and no one escaped. This eliminated the risk of information leaking to the outside world.","“Autumn was injured because none of us anticipated that there were actually four Snake Lords heading toward South Face City instead of just the two apparent ones. Among them, the other two Snake Lords attacked in secret, resulting in Autumn sustaining some injuries.","“As Autumn mentioned, his injuries are not severe and will soon recover, which will not affect the subsequent plans for the contest over the top grade blessed land.","“Young Master, I’ve always wanted to pry open the mouths of these Snake Lords, but they are a tough nut to crack. They’re unwilling to answer my questions. Hence, I still need Young Master to make the decision!”","When Winter spoke to Lin Yuan, the Snake Lord, who was the most severely injured and felt that his life was rapidly draining away, could not help but let out an angry hiss. He then told Lin Yuan with a threatening tone, “If you dare to attack the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, we will not let you off. Not only the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, but you will also have to bear the wrath of the Supreme Poison Valley. Our Ancient Snake Gu Palace has already merged into the Supreme Poison Valley...”","When the Snake Lord roared at Lin Yuan, Autumn used actions to let him know how powerful he was.","Autumn and Winter had long known that the Ancient Snake Gu Palace had joined the Supreme Poison Valley.","The Supreme Poison Valley was the sacred land of all poison-type lifeforms in the world. It was considered one of the three strongest factions in the South Universe and was enough to contend with the official factions in the South Universe. It was no wonder that the Ancient Snake Gu Palace was so confident","in their actions.","While other factions may fear the Supreme Poison Valley, Autumn and Winter did not. They secretly speculated that it was highly likely the venom of the Fate Transferring Nine Desolation Scorpion obtained by the Ancient Snake Gu Palace was bestowed upon them by the Supreme Poison Valley.","Otherwise, with the Ancient Snake Gu Palace’s strength, it would be more or less difficult to obtain the Fate Transferring Nine Desolation Scorpion.","Winter’s foot rested upon the head of this Snake Lord, and Lin Yuan observed the defiant expression still present on his face.","Lin Yuan said lightly, “If he’s going to be this disobedient, just kill him. There’s no need to extract information from his mouth. There are plenty of other channels to gather intelligence. Since he doesn’t even have the awareness as a captive prisoner, it’s better to help him sober up properly!”","Lin Yuan did not have a good impression of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace to begin with. Moreover, they had just targeted Lin Yuan and wanted to kill him.","Lin Yuan intended to obtain the information he wanted from the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.","After all, these snake-type lifeforms of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace had existed for countless years because of the Fate Transferring Nine Desolation Scorpion’s venom.","The four Snake Lords were all superiors in the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, and the information they knew was about the same.","Lin Yuan only needed to ensure that one of the Snake Lords was willing to speak. There was no need for all of them to open their mouths.","These Snake Lords were showing too much defiance. Instead of wasting effort interrogating them, it was better to drop some hints and make them understand a simple truth: disobedience and lack of cooperation only led to a dead end. There were no other paths available.","Lin Yuan’s words made the four Snake Lords’ expressions change. The Snake Lord that had just moved out of the Supreme Poison Valley was not afraid of Lin Yuan.","The Supreme Poison Valley was domineering and extremely protective.","This Snake Lord did not believe that anyone would dare to disrespect the Supreme Poison Valley.","However, Autumn did not give this Snake Lord much time to think. With a forceful stomp, Autumn viciously crushed the head of this brightly colored Snake Lord, splitting his head open. Autumn’s kick didn’t kill this Snake Lord directly, but the latter could truly feel the killing intent contained in Autumn’s kick.","This Snake Lord let out a shrill roar and was about to beg for mercy, but Autumn’s attack followed extremely quickly. The continuous attacks finally made the Snake Lord lose its breath.","When Autumn attacked this Snake Lord, he had injected his roots power into its body.","Autumn’s roots power, which contained a bleak aura, imprisoned the Snake Lord’s soul.","Not only did Autumn’s actions prove that Lin Yuan really dared to make a move, but Autumn also said to Lin Yuan after his action, “Young Master, these Snake Lords are too powerful. They can’t be controlled by your Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake.","“However, with the bloodline of the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake, it can absorb the remains of this Snake Lord. After absorbing such a complete body, the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake’s strength will definitely increase greatly!","“In order to fight for this top grade blessed land, it’s not convenient for us to bring captives with us. If the remaining three Snake Lords are unwilling to speak, why don’t we get rid of them all? I don’t want them to cause any trouble in the future!”","After saying that, Autumn released his aura and enveloped the three Snake Lords with it, as if Lin Yuan would immediately get rid of them as soon as he opened his mouth.","Autumn said this to express his true thoughts to Lin Yuan and also to force these Snake Lords to speak.","Lin Yuan felt a little regretful. If only the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake was stronger. If the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake could control these Snake Lords through its bloodline, not only could it increase Lin Yuan’s strength, but it could also obtain a large amount of information. In such a case, there was no need to think of a way to make these Snake Lords speak.","Lin Yuan summoned the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake and let it devour the corpse. The Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake was a glutton to begin with. Previously, it had not been able to devour many snake-species feys by Lin Yuan’s side.","Most of the 50 star pirates’ snake-type feys were controlled by the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake. Only the ones with poor potential were treated as food by the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake.","Compared to controlling so many snake-type feys, the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake actually wanted to have a good meal. Now that it saw such high-quality food, the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake happily wheedled at Lin Yuan. After obtaining Lin Yuan’s permission, it directly swallowed the dead Snake Lord’s body.","The Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake spoke to Lin Yuan in a voice that alternated between male and female. “Master, it will take me half a year to refine the snake body just now. After half a year, can you provide the body of another Snake Lord for me to devour? After devouring the bodies of the two Snake Lords, I can basically try to control the remaining two. Although I prefer to treat them as food compared to controlling them, it’s more beneficial for you to control more powerful snake-species","feys!”","Despite the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake’s gluttony, it was very sensible and didn’t tell lies.","The Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake indeed felt that these Snake Lords were more useful alive. Moreover, these living Snake Lords could be considered the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake’s own power in its own hands.","Upon hearing the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake’s words, Lin Yuan was delighted. He had originally intended to get rid of these Snake Lords, but since the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake had said so, Lin Yuan would keep two of them for a year. A year was not long. These two Snake Lords had combat strength that","surpassed the Holy Spirit level and were at the pinnacle of the domain mountain-class. It was very difficult to recruit such experts.","Not only did Lin Yuan hear the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake’s words, but the Snake Lords also heard it. These Snake Lords could sense the bloodline of the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake that was actually of a higher level than theirs! They felt an extremely strong control from the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake and did not doubt that the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake could control them. If the bloodline of the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake was lower, it would have exploded and died after devouring the body of a Snake Lord.","The Snake Lords felt an unprecedented sense of urgency. Apart from being afraid that they would be controlled by the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake, this sense of urgency was more because they did not want to become its next target.","In the situation where they were treated as food, these three Snake Lords couldn’t care much anymore. All three of them had experienced troubles with their lifespan. As they had joined the Supreme Poison Valley and received a gift from them, they could rely on the Fate Transferring Nine Desolation Scorpion’s venom to survive for a long time. These three Snake Lords had faced the temptation of endless lifespan. How could they be willing to become food and die now?","However, one of the three Snake Lords had to be their food. These three Snake Lords had already turned from their original companions to competitors.","One of the Snake Lords spoke first. “I can tell you what you want to know!”","As soon as this Snake Lord spoke, the other two Snake Lords immediately could not hold it in anymore and hurriedly expressed their willingness to exchange the intelligence for their lives.","However, Lin Yuan did not give the three Snake Lords a chance.","Lin Yuan said in an extremely serious tone, “You all heard it. I’ll only leave one of the three of you behind. As for which two of them will stay, and who will be your food, I’ll give you a chance to fight for it yourself.","“I’ll give you half an hour to present all the information you know on the paper through your spiritual energy. The two people who wrote the most detail will be left behind. The one who wrote less will be disposed of. This method is extremely fair to all three of you.”","When the three Snake Lords saw that Lin Yuan was clearly not giving them a chance to speak, they stopped begging for mercy and wasting time. Instead, they began to rack their brains to think of what secrets they could write to survive.","To be honest, the information these three Snake Lords knew was about the same. They were all higher-ups of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.","This made the three Snake Lords lose their confidence.","Winter took out two silver-blue ice crystals and said, “Young Master, if you plan to let the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake control two Snake Lords in a year, instead of letting these two Snake Lords enter the Spirit Lock spatial zone, why don’t you let the two Snake Lords enter my sealed ice crystal?"]},{"number":3116,"title":"Chapter 3116: Snake Lord in Control!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3116: Snake Lord in Control!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","“Seal these two Snake Lords in the sealed ice crystals. My extremely cold roots power will make these two Snake Lords fall into a deep sleep. If we put the two of them in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, even if Autumn and I put a restriction, everything in the Spirit Lock spatial zone will probably be destroyed by them once they break free.","“If we happen to be fighting for this top grade blessed land, we won’t restrict them for a while. You can’t trust their promises until you have absolute control over them.”","Lin Yuan was still thinking about how to make arrangements for the remaining two Snake Lords, but Winter’s words had solved his problem.","Half an hour passed quickly.","The three Snake Lords used heaven and earth as paper and spiritual energy as ink to write rapidly on the paper. They manifested all the information they knew on the paper.","Lin Yuan, Autumn, and Winter each investigated the information written by the three Snake Lords. After investigation, the three of them had a clear understanding of the situation in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Winter couldn’t help but sigh. “Young Master, the situation in the Sky Beyond the Clouds has really changed a lot over the years. When I returned to the Sky Beyond the Clouds this time, I always had a feeling that it had become much more peaceful than before. I thought it was my imagination, but it seems that I didn’t feel wrong. The reason for this is that all factions are now focused on the abyss.","“The resources in the abyss were extremely abundant. However, because the environment was not suitable for lifeforms in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, and even experts found it difficult to obtain a way to replenish their energy in it, the abyss became a forbidden place. Now, the various factions in the Sky Beyond the Clouds had used many stupid methods to replenish their energy in the abyss. Hence, various factions start to send a large number of people to explore it.","“The exploration of the abyss sparked discontent among its inhabitants, leading powerful lifeforms there to seek revenge in their own manner. The conflict between the two factions escalated steadily.”","Winter believed that the exploration of the abyss had both positive and negative aspects. On the one hand, it offered the opportunity to acquire additional resources, which were crucial for the growth of a powerful lifeform. On the other hand, it triggered retaliation and conflict between the inhabitants of the Sky Beyond the Clouds and those of the abyss. This escalation of tensions greatly increased the likelihood of a large-scale war.","After reading the information organized by the three Snake Lords, Autumn said, “This guy in the middle of Young Master has reported the least information. Should I help you get rid of him? We’ve wasted a lot of time here. It’s time to leave. As for the others, we can give them a choice. Will they submit to us and cooperate with our subsequent actions, or will they wait to be eliminated like the Snake Lord in the middle?”","As he spoke, Autumn’s sharp gaze swept across these experts who had reached the pinnacle of the Holy Spirit level and even faintly surpassed the Holy Spirit level.","Autumn’s words sent a shiver down the spines of these experts. They harbored no illusions about the possibility of being eliminated. They were well aware that in such chaotic circumstances, it was wiser to steer clear of trouble. Refusal to comply would undoubtedly result in their silence.","These experts all came from different factions and had a high right to speak in these factions. Some of them were even leaders of factions.","Coming to South Face City to join the City Lord’s side was not to fight for this top grade blessed land, but to obtain some benefits from it.","These experts hailed from diverse factions and held significant sway within their respective groups. Some even held leadership positions. Their decision to align with the City Lord in South Face City wasn’t solely driven by the desire to vie for control of the top grade blessed land, but rather to secure personal benefits from the arrangement. They thought Xie Lin’s side was the safest, but they didn’t expect Xie Lin to come from an evil faction like the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.","In fact, from the moment the two Snake Lords arrived, these experts felt that they were being controlled by Xie Lin. Two of the experts tried to break free from Xie Lin’s control and resisted, but they were all suppressed by these Snake Lords.","If they stayed under Xie Lin’s control, it would undoubtedly not end well. In a way, Lin Yuan’s current actions could be considered a lifeline for these experts present. Without hesitation, they all chose to join Lin Yuan’s side.","Xie Lin looked at this scene in shock. In his heart, he didn’t want to believe the authenticity of everything in front of him. He had called these people over to be prey, but the real prey were actually the four Snake Lords.","One of the four Snake Lords had already died, and the other Snake Lord was most likely about to be killed.","Xie Lin’s faith crumbled. However, even if Lin Yuan harbored no affection for Xie Lin, he couldn’t kill him now. As the City Lord of South Face City, Xie Lin would be of great help to Lin Yuan’s next move.","Lin Yuan addressed Autumn and said, “Since the Snake Lord in the middle has given us the least information and is unwilling to be controlled by us, Autumn, send him off.”","The Snake Lord in the middle hurriedly begged for mercy, “I’m in charge of the deployment of combat members. I’ve never cared about the content of intelligence. I hope you can give me another chance. I’m willing to submit. I definitely won’t lose if it’s anything else!”","Normally, if a Snake Lord was willing to submit, Lin Yuan would definitely be willing to give it a chance. However, the current situation was different. If he did not kill a Snake Lord for the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake, it would not be able to reach the level of controlling the other two Snake Lords. This Snake Lord who had the least information happened to be the weakest among the three Snake Lords, so dealing with this Snake Lord was the best choice.","Lin Yuan did not give the Snake Lord a chance, so Autumn did not hold back.","Lin Yuan asked the two Snake Lords, “Apart from the four of you, has the Ancient Snake Gu Palace arranged for others to head to South Face City?”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s question, the two fearful Snake Lords hurriedly said, “Apart from the four of us, Lord, there are no other arrangements in the Ancient Snake Gu Palace. Currently, only the four of us have truly awakened.”","As the Snake Lord spoke, he could not help but sigh. Previously, when he found out that a top grade blessed land was about to be opened in South Face City, he had a completely disdainful attitude and believed that no faction possessed the strength to compete with Ancient Snake Gu Palace.","However, before they could even act, two Snake Lords died, and their own defeat was declared when the opposing side took control of their actions. This outcome was truly lamentable.","Upon hearing that, Lin Yuan’s heart stirred, “There are a total of eight Snake Lords in your Ancient Snake Gu Palace. Since the other four Snake Lords are in deep sleep, I’m very curious where the other four Snake Lords are. How can we wake them up? I’m sure you’d love to see your old pals get together. I can give you a chance.”","The two Snake Lords understood the meaning behind Lin Yuan’s words. He was clearly asking them to reveal the positions of the other Snake Lords. He was preparing to wipe out Ancient Snake Gu Palace once and for all!","If they revealed the location of the other four sleeping Snake Lords, it would be equivalent to betraying their old friends. However, given the current situation, it was definitely impossible not to reveal it.","The strongest Snake Lord said, “Lord, the other four Snake Lords are on Snake Island, the base camp of our Ancient Snake Gu Palace. The reason the four of us who woke up this time went out and coveted this top grade blessed land is that we wanted to use this opportunity to revive the other four Snake Lords. If you want to find them, I can bring you to Snake Island.","“It’s just that it requires a large amount of pure spirit qi to revive them. Moreover, there’s a certain requirement for the concentration of this spirit qi. It’s very difficult to revive them. But Lord, if you can revive them, they will definitely be very willing to submit to you. If you have the intention to plot against the Supreme Poison Valley, I think we should be able to help you!”","In a situation where the other party was completely in control, since there was no room for resistance, smart people knew how to obtain opportunities for themselves. The Snake Lord who spoke was a smart individual. It was a publicly acknowledged fact in the Sky Beyond the Clouds that snake-species feys were cruel. However, they were also very obedient after being conquered by experts. It could be said that the snake species was an extremely strong species.","Lin Yuan was indeed very interested in the other four Snake Lords because they could be directly controlled by the future Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake, allowing Lin Yuan to obtain many high-end combat power.","“We’ll talk about this later. The two of you will be sealed in the ice crystal Winter created for the time being. I’ll let you out later. It won’t be too late to bring me to the lair of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace when that time comes!”","After taking in the two Snake Lords, Lin Yuan looked at Xie Lin. Feeling too lazy to talk nonsense with Xie Lin, he directly let the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake control Xie Lin. The Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake couldn’t control the two Snake Lords, but it was not a big deal to control Xie Lin.","After the Ancestral Contract Brahma Snake controlled Xie Lin, Lin Yuan proceeded to take control of the holy spirits and Holy Spirit experts. Then, these experts continued to follow under Xie Lin’s command, maintaining the original alliance just like before.","Currently, no faction within the Sky Beyond the Clouds was aware that the Ancient Snake Gu Palace was now under Lin Yuan’s control. This operation not only allowed Lin Yuan to take control of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace, but it also ensured that he would have a greater chance of obtaining it in the future.","At the same time, Lin Yuan gained a certain understanding of the situation in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. He learned that what these factions really cared about was not the top grade blessed land itself, but a ruin hidden there. This top grade blessed land was most likely to suppress this ruin and prevent the existence of this ruin from appearing.","This information was obtained from the three Snake Lords who were trying to survive. At that time, the three Snake Lords were controlled and there was no possibility of them escaping.","Lin Yuan felt that this information was most likely true. The veracity of this information could soon be verified.","When Lin Yuan left the City Lord Manor and arrived at the entrance, he saw Ling Muzhuo waiting there with an anxious expression.","Ling Muzhuo heaved a sigh of relief when he saw Lin Yuan. “Brother Lin, how’s your situation? Did those fellows from the Ancient Snake Gu Palace make things difficult for you?”","Upon seeing Ling Muzhuo’s genuine concern, Lin Yuan did not hide the truth. Although he did not elaborate on the process, Lin Yuan told Ling Muzhuo that he had cleared out the Ancient Snake Gu Palace.","The reason he did not mention that the Ancient Snake Gu Palace was under his control now was that Lin Yuan would not be able to get the help of these two Snake Lords during the competition for the top grade paradise and the ruins. Hence, there was no point in saying it.","Ling Muzhuo couldn’t conceal his astonishment upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words. He had never expected that Lin Yuan would be able to get rid of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace members with Autumn. However, this was good news for Ling Muzhuo. At the same time, it made him feel that he should be on good terms with Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan asked Ling Muzhuo tentatively, “Brother Ling, your Fortune Treasure Palace has many channels to obtain information. Can you help me investigate why so many factions are gathered in South Face City? Is it really just for this top grade blessed land? If it’s really just for this top grade land, Faerie Institution wouldn’t have secretly arranged for a faerie king to accompany them, right?”","Lin Yuan’s words made Ling Muzhuo’s expression turn serious. “Brother Lin, where did you get this information? Our Fortune Treasure Palace has not heard that, besides the two high faeries, Faerie Institution also has a faerie king following them in secret.”","Apart from abundant resources, Fortune Treasure Palace had always been proud of its rich channels. However, Ling Muzhuo did not know what Lin Yuan was talking about. If he knew that Faerie Institution had sent a faerie king, Fortune Treasure Palace would have definitely sen more than three guardians to contend for this top grade blessed land.","After spending some time interacting with Lin Yuan, Ling Muzhuo could clearly see that Lin Yuan was a very prudent individual. He wouldn’t speak unless he had accurate information to back his words.","Lin Yuan didn’t mention that this information was discovered by Spring. Even to an ally like Ling Muzhuo, Lin Yuan wouldn’t casually expose Spring’s involvement. Thus, he found a random excuse, “I obtained this information from the Snake Lords of the Ancient Snake Gu Palace. The news is most likely true. These Snake Lords have been lying in ambush in South Face City for some time. They should have a","good understanding of the various factions heading to South Face City. Therefore, I have a feeling that these factions are not gathered here just for this top grade blessed land. Brother Ling, you didn’t receive any news before?”","Ling Muzhuo laughed bitterly. “Brother Lin, do I look like I received the information in advance? If I had obtained the information in advance, how could I not have brought guardians? If Faerie Institution has really brought along a faerie king, then it is definitely not as simple as a top grade blessed land. There must be some other reason that we don’t understand! Leave this to me. I’ll try to see if I can find out the truth in two days.”","Initially, Ling Muzhuo’s expression was still rather calm. But now, Ling Muzhuo had already realized that things were gradually spiraling out of control."]},{"number":3117,"title":"Chapter 3117: Lin Yuan’s Destiny!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3117: Lin Yuan’s Destiny!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","With a top grade blessed land already sparking conflict among multiple factions, the prospect of any additional ones would likely pose a risk of death even for those present in the region.","Ling Muzhuo had always been unwilling to put himself in danger.","Lin Yuan could tell from Ling Muzhuo’s expression that he was unaware of this.","After returning to Fortune Treasure Palace, Lin Yuan took the spirit qi crystals that the four Snake Lords had yet to absorb to feed the Spirit World Barrier Turtle.","The aura of the top grade blessed land was constantly becoming stronger, and it had already begun to show signs of opening at any time. All the factions were surprised by this. They hadn’t expected this top grade blessed land to open so quickly.","At this moment, the Spirit World Barrier Turtle that had been devouring a large number of spirit qi crystals in the Spirit Lock spatial zone had a breakthrough in its aura. The Spirit World Barrier Turtle had successfully advanced to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, which allowed Morbius’ grade to increase as it wished.","The Spirit Lock spatial zone started undergoing a drastic change. Everything in the Spirit Lock spatial zone was spat out, including the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope.","The Wind Speed Rapid Antelope rarely came to the outside world. Sensing that the spiritual energy in the outside world was many times thinner than in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope said in disdain, “Master, I want to go back. Can you let me go back? I still have a lot of spirit qi crystals to check! The speed at which spirit qi crystals are produced has become much faster than before.”","The Wind Speed Rapid Antelope lived in the Spirit Lock spatial zone all year round and had long been raised to be abnormally delicate. It was indeed very unaccustomed to the outside world.","Lin Yuan rubbed the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope’s head and said, “It’s not that I don’t want you to go back. The Spirit Lock spatial zone is transforming now. You can only enter after the transformation is over. After the Spirit Lock spatial zone finishes transforming, the concentration of spirit qi in there will be even higher. At that time, you will be much more comfortable than before!”","Lin Yuan was looking forward to the changes in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. Morbius had told Lin Yuan that there would be a huge change in the next transformation of the Spirit Lock spatial zone, but when he asked what kind of changes would happen, Morbius could not tell.","The transformation of the Spirit Lock spatial zone did not take too long.","Two days later, Lin Yuan brought the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope and took everything that was spat out from the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","The buildings originally built in the Spirit Lock spatial zone were not damaged at all by the expansion. Lin Yuan could clearly feel that the concentration of spirit qi in the Spirit Lock spatial zone had increased by a lot. The small spirit pool had now become an ocean. Lin Yuan could not see the end of it. This allowed Blackie to swim freely in the spirit pool even if it had evolved into a main dragon, no matter how huge its body was.","After Lin Yuan’s exploration, he realized that the Spirit Lock spatial zone was so large that he could not see the end of it. At the same time, many stone pillars appeared in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. These stone pillars were not activated and looked no different from ordinary decorations. However, Lin Yuan could sense that these stone pillars contained boundless energy.","For a moment, Lin Yuan did not know what use these stone pillars had.","As soon as the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone, it began to manipulate the wind-elemental energy into chains and began to choose and arrange the resources in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. Soon, the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope collected the newly produced spirit qi crystals and handed them to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan picked up the spirit qi crystals and examined them with delight. The spirit qi crystals produced by the Spirit Lock spatial zone had indeed reached the level of a Grade 6 Creator, which was excellent news for Lin Yuan.","With Grade 6 Creator resources at his disposal, Lin Yuan could not only help Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter enhance their abilities but also fulfill his earlier promises to those Grade 5 Creators.","Due to the transformation of the Spirit Lock spatial zone, the spirit qi crystals it produced would now consistently be Grade 6. Lin Yuan realized that in the future, Grade 5 Creator resources would serve only as currency. Utilizing Grade 6 Creator resources to meet the needs of his feys and subordinates was undoubtedly a better approach.","Lin Yuan instructed, “Wind Speed Rapid Antelope, organize the previously produced low-grade Creator resources and separate them from these higher-grade Creator resources.”","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s instructions, the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope obediently shook its head twice. Then, it began to organize the resources according to Lin Yuan’s instructions.","Lin Yuan handed over the Grade 6 Creator resources to Autumn, who was his bodyguard.","Before being unable to produce Grade 6 Creator resources, Lin Yuan had not asked about Autumn’s situation. After all, Lin Yuan would not be able to help him even if he wanted to. However, now that the Spirit Lock spatial zone could steadily produce Grade 6 Creator resources, Lin Yuan asked about Autumn’s injuries.","“Autumn, you previously said that your strength has yet to fully recover. How many Grade 6 Creator resources do you need to recover your strength?”","Lin Yuan handed the Grade 6 Creator spirit qi crystals to Autumn.","When Autumn sensed the Grade 6 Creator spirit qi crystals, he was shocked and could not help but exclaim inwardly, In this life, Lord Saint’s improvement speed is much faster than in his previous life. He can actually produce Grade 6 Creator resources now!","Autumn was very clear about his situation, so he answered Lin Yuan’s question very seriously, “Young Master, Grade 6 Creator resources are extremely precious. As long as we have Grade 6 Creator resources to activate our system, we can recover as much as possible even if there are no Creator resources in the future. The dozens of spirit qi crystals you gave me are enough to restore my strength to 70% of my peak state. It makes me more confident that I can guarantee your safety!”","Upon hearing this, Lin Yuan inwardly noted that it seemed Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter had a much lower demand for spirit qi crystals than he had anticipated, at least significantly less than he had expected.","Lin Yuan continued to ask, “If I continue to provide you with more Grade 6 Creator resources, can you continue to increase your strength after your injuries recover?”","Winter replied confidently when he heard Lin Yuan’s question, “Young Master, Grade 6 Creator resources are the main consumption of our strength. With our strength, Grade 5 Creator resources are not much for us to increase our strength. If you can continue to provide us with Grade 6 Creator resources, the four of us will be able to improve our strength.”","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “In that case, in the future, the strength of the four of you will improve rapidly in a very short period. Later, secretly send a portion of the spirit qi crystals that have reached the level of a Grade 6 Creator to Spring and Winter so that they can also increase their strength!”","Lin Yuan heaved a sigh of relief. Now that Spring, Autumn, and Winter’s strengths had increased as he wished, he would have more confidence in fighting for this top grade blessed land and the ruins in the future.","Lin Yuan felt intrigued by the idea of a blessed land that required another top grade blessed land to suppress it. Lin Yuan was certain that this ruin was extraordinary.","The conflict between the Abyssal Beast Domain and Faerie Institution had halted, but the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley had started an intense conflict with the Abyssal Beast Domain. It was so intense that Long Jie had no choice but to ask Lin Yuan for help.","Lin Yuan felt a little helpless. He had no intention of protecting the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley in this operation. Since the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley had participated in the competition for this top grade blessed land, the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley would have to bear all the consequences themselves.","Lin Yuan was plotting against the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley rather than seeking to provide protection for them.","Upon seeing Long Jie’s distress message through the Thoughts Letter Paper, Lin Yuan was abnormally cold to Long Jie’s distress call.","[Lin Yuan]: Your Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley has not submitted to me. You are the only one who has submitted to me. At most, I will protect you when you are in danger. The safety of the other members of the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley has nothing to do with me. You can use this opportunity to help me investigate the Abyssal Beast Domain. Could it be that the Abyssal Beast Domain isn’t only led by that leader of the Nightmare Beasts?","Long Jie felt disheartened when he realized Lin Yuan was unwilling to help the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley through its difficulties, but he couldn’t fault Lin Yuan for his earlier words—they were entirely reasonable.","Lin Yuan didn’t have any obligations to Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley. His willingness to protect Long Jie in such circumstances already showcased remarkable righteousness. Nonetheless, the fact that Long Jie didn’t have to die was a relief.","Long Jie hurriedly replied to Lin Yuan’s question.","[Long Jie]: Lord, if it’s just the leader of the Nightmare Beasts leading the Abyssal Beast Domain, how could they possibly disregard our Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley and initiate conflict with us at this time? I’ve heard from the Elders in our clan that this operation involves a secret even greater than this top grade blessed land. That’s true. If not for my understanding of the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, the clan wouldn’t have sent three Grand Elders over.","[Long Jie]: When thinking about it, It makes sense. Given my understanding of the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, they wouldn’t dispatch three Grand Elders unless there were extenuating circumstances. It’s just that this time, the preparations from the Abyssal Beast Domain are obviously more extensive than ours. Moreover, after the last conflict, it’s surprising that they’ve formed a strong alliance with Faerie Institution for reasons unknown. If not for the alliance between Faerie Institution and the Abyssal Beast Domain, the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley wouldn’t be in such a passive position.","Lin Yuan could not help but frown. The Abyssal Beast Domain had actually joined forces with Faerie Institution.","According to the information that Lin Yuan had received, the Abyssal Beast Domain and Faerie Institution had clearly had a conflict before, but now, both sides had joined forces, which surprised Lin Yuan. When these two factions joined forces, there would definitely be many hidden situations occurring. Only when both sides faced common interests could they have the intention to join forces to fight the enemy.","The Abyssal Beast Domain and Faerie Institution were both powerful factions. If they joined forces, Lin Yuan would face considerable pressure in the fight for the top grade blessed land.","After some thought, Lin Yuan said, “If Faerie Institution and the Abyssal Beast Domain have the intention to destroy the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, you can send a message to the manager of the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley. Just say that if the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley is willing to let me take charge of everything in this operation, I can protect them from a calamity!”","Lin Yuan ended his conversation with Long Jie.","Spring sent Lin Yuan a message informing him that the Abyssal Beast Domain was preparing to attack the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley.","Spring and the others were mobilized for the operation.","Currently, the alliance Spring belonged to was filled with resentment. However, its members were powerless against the Abyssal Beast Domain. Those who refused to participate in the operation were killed by the Abyssal Beast Domain’s experts.","Spring told Lin Yuan that the Abyssal Beast Domain had at least three additional leaders. These leaders had been present for only half a day, yet the key figures of the Abyssal Beast Domain had already finalized a cooperation agreement with Faerie Institution. This indicated that the Abyssal Beast Domain and Faerie Institution had premeditated this plan.","The collaboration between these two powerful factions in the West Universe suggested a significant objective. Moreover, the alliance between them, based on mutual benefits, was difficult to disrupt.","The Abyssal Beast Domain had dispatched four leaders, while Faerie Institution sent a faerie king, all operating in secrecy. Without thorough preparations, the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley would likely face severe consequences.","Billions of years ago, the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley had sought to suppress the Seamless Beast Region. However, it had since lost its ability to influence the Abyssal Beast Domain.","The Abyssal Beast Domain had surpassed the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley in every aspect. Firstly, the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley had failed to discover a new top grade blessed land for many years. Secondly, the Ancestral Dragon of the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley was too greedy. In his quest for power, he compromised the foundation of the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley.","Faerie Institution and the Abyssal Beast Domain aimed to eliminate the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley. The grudge between the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley and the Abyssal Beast Domain ran deep. With Faerie Institution and the Abyssal Beast Domain united, there was no chance of recruiting the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley.","Lin Yuan asked Spring if there were more factions heading to South Face City.","Spring gave Lin Yuan an affirmative answer. At that moment, various factions still surged into South Face City, including overlord-level factions.","The Snow-Covered Foxes of the North Universe did not send anyone over, but the Great Sun Phoenix, which also dominated the North Universe, sent at least three Phoenix Lords.","Fortunately, Autumn had already given the Grade 6 Creator resources to Spring in advance. Spring was also recovering her strength with the pure spirit qi of these Grade 6 Creators.","Spring, Autumn, and Winter had recovered 70% of their original strength.","Morbius grade advancement was very timely. Otherwise, in such a dangerous situation, even Autumn would instruct Lin Yuan to give up on the fight for the top grade blessed land.","Ever since Lin Yuan entered the Returning Saint Pool and underwent the cleansing process, he had a feeling that he had seen through fate. For some reason, Lin Yuan felt that the ruins behind this top grade blessed land were related to him. No matter how intense the competition was, even if he did not snatch this top grade blessed land, he had to snatch the ruins behind this top grade blessed land!","Lin Yuan’s sense of destiny for this ruin was the same as when he had first entered the Returning Saint Pool."]},{"number":3118,"title":"Chapter 3118: The Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley’s Request for Help!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3118: The Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley’s Request for Help!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","For the past few days, Ling Muzhuo had been inquiring for information. The more he probed, the tighter his frown became.","Ling Muzhuo had already confirmed Lin Yuan’s words. With so many factions adding so many people, it was definitely not as simple as fighting for this top grade blessed land.","Now, South Face City had become an iron bucket. After these overlord-level factions came to South Face City, they controlled it, causing South Face City to be in a state where one could only enter but not leave. Without exception, those factions that wanted to leave South Face City would be dealt with. The competition in the Species Ranking was not as shocking as the competition in South Face City.","Ling Muzhuo had been trying to contact Lin Yuan for the past few days, but Autumn said that Lin Yuan was busy and could not meet anyone. This made Ling Muzhuo even more worried.","Even if Ling Muzhuo wanted to stand on Lin Yuan’s side, he was unwilling to put Fortune Treasure Palace in danger.","Upon seeing Lin Yuan, Ling Muzhuo was prepared to tell him the truth before advising him.","If they did not fight for this top grade blessed land and the hidden opportunity, these factions would not make things difficult for Lin Yuan and Fortune Treasure Palace.","Ling Muzhuo had already heard the news that Faerie Institution and the Abyssal Beast Domain were about to attack the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley.","After seeing Lin Yuan, Ling Muzhuo suddenly felt at ease.","“Brother Lin, South Face City has completely turned upside down. All parties...”","Before Ling Muzhuo could finish, Lin Yuan said, “I’m aware of the current situation in South Face City. I’m still prepared to participate in the battle for this top grade blessed land. Apart from this top grade blessed land, I will fight for the other opportunities to the end.","“Brother Ling, you will face many dangers in such a battle. It’s understandable if you don’t want to participate. I will still remember your friendship for helping me previously.","Lin Yuan took out a brocade box and handed it to Ling Muzhuo with a smile.","Ling Muzhuo opened the brocade box and saw that there were six spirit qi crystals that were clearly sparkling and translucent. Ling Muzhuo opened his eyes wide the moment he sensed it. Ling Muzhuo could feel the extremely pure spirit qi in the spirit qi crystals.","This kind of spirit qi was much more advanced than the spirit qi concocted by Grade 5 Creators.","Even if he had not come into contact with Grade 6 Creator resources before, Ling Muzhuo was sure that these ten spirit qi crystals were genuine Grade 6 Creator resources.","The fact that Lin Yuan had given these Grade 6 Creator resources to him was enough to show his relationship with him.","Looking at Lin Yuan’s determined gaze, Ling Muzhuo, who always sought stability, could not help but grit his teeth and say, “Brother Lin, I’ve never liked to face risks. But this time, no matter what the situation is, I’ll choose to take your side. According to what I said before, I’ll shoulder the responsibility with you if anything happens.”","Apart from his friendship with Lin Yuan, Ling Muzhuo also had a lot to do with Lin Yuan taking out these Grade 6 Creator resources.","The fact that these Grade 6 Creator resources were taken out meant that Lin Yuan really had a genuine Grade 6 Creator backing him.","On the surface, the Sky Beyond the Clouds was ruled by the four official factions. But in fact, the ones who really controlled the Sky Beyond the Clouds and had the most say were indeed those Grade 6 Creators. If there was a conflict between the decision of Honor Absent Palace and a certain Grade 6 Creator, in the end, it would not be this Grade 6 Creator who gave in but Honor Absent Palace who would modify the decision.","Ling Muzhuo knew very well what Grade 6 Creator resources represented.","With the resources produced by this Grade 6 Creator, increasing his strength could be said to be a very simple matter.","In the end, Ling Muzhuo decided to place all his hopes on Lin Yuan no matter how critical the situation was.","Lin Yuan was silent for a moment before he said, “Brother Ling, to be honest, I can’t guarantee that there won’t be any mistakes in this operation. If you lead Fortune Treasure Palace in helping me fight for this top grade blessed land, you will definitely face a lot of risks.","“Faerie Institution and the Abyssal Beast Domain are preparing to work together to attack the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley. I’ll most likely help the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley. I can’t let the alliance between the Abyssal Beast Domain and Faerie Institution dominate. I’m sure other factions will be involved in this operation. Before the top grade blessed land opens, the competition between the various factions in South Face City will most likely end.”","Ling Muzhuo had expected Lin Yuan to participate in the conflict between tthe Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley and Faerie Institution and the Abyssal Beast Domain.","If Lin Yuan wanted to fight for this top grade blessed land and the other opportunities there, it was inevitable that he would clash with other factions. Taking advantage of this opportunity was the best choice.","After Faerie Institution and the Abyssal Beast Domain targeted the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, if Lin Yuan did not respond, they would most likely choose to find trouble with him.","Compared to letting Faerie Institution and the Abyssal Beast Domain take the initiative to cause trouble, Lin Yuan’s initiative would not weaken his momentum. At the same time, he could use the excuse of helping the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley to obtain benefits from it.","At present, the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley’s camp was in chaos. The three Grand Elders had not expected that they would immediately become targets of Faerie Institution and the Abyssal Beast Domain after arriving.","The Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley and Abyssal Beast Domain had always been enemies. The two sides had been enemies for hundreds of millions of years. Previously, they had never heard of the close relationship between the Abyssal Beast Domain and Faerie Institution.","Although Faerie Institution was domineering, they rarely participated in the battles between large factions.","The current situation made these Grand Elders not know what to do.","If it was a collision between the three major factions, the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley would not be in such a sorry state.","The key was that the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley had not expected such a situation to happen. The three Grand Elders sent were not enough to deal with the current situation.","The combination of the Abyssal Beast Domain and Faerie Institution clearly wanted to exterminate the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley.","Not to mention the three Grand Elders, even the ordinary experts of the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley did not want to die here.","When the panic reached its peak, Long Jie knew that it was time for him to speak.","As an Elder, Long Jie had an extraordinary status in the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley. After meeting the three Grand Elders, Long Jie said directly, “With the current situation, the Abyssal Beast Domain and the Faerie Institution have no intention of leaving us a way out. I met a young man previously. He’s related to a pinnacle Grade 5 Creator and might even be able to take out Grade 6 Creator resources. He’s also in South Face City now. I can try to ask him for help!”","Hearing Long Jie’s words, the three Grand Elders were all moved.","No matter how arrogant the dragons were, they hoped that they could survive rather than die.","The Grand Elder in the lead hurriedly said, “Since that’s the case, Long Jie, why aren’t you asking them for help? Faerie Institution and the Abyssal Beast Domain are coming aggressively. If we don’t have helpers, we won’t be able to hold on at all. At that time, you can promise them that the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley will prepare a generous gift.”","Long Jie Jie did not move. Instead, he said, “Lord Long Yin, the Young Master I know is here for the opportunity here. He most likely doesn’t like the resources we promised. After all, he can throw out Creator resources like trash.","“You know the person I’m talking about. It’s Young Master Lin who caused a commotion in South Face City. I’ve already contacted him in advance. His request is for the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley to give up on fighting for the blessed land and help him snatch the resources. He can protect our Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley.","“I didn’t mention this before because I felt that this Young Master Lin’s request was too ridiculous. If this wasn’t a life-and-death situation, I wouldn’t have told the three of you about this situation. Lords, please make a decision on the specifics!”","Long Jie still had to stay in the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley in the future. He did not want to be labeled as a traitor. Therefore, he did not participate in the matter after it was brought up. Instead, he handed it to the three Grand Elders to make a decision. No matter what decision these three Grand Elders made in the end, Long Jie could accept it.","If he did not choose to seek Lin Yuan’s help, he would assist the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley to fight to the end.","Long Jie would have contacted Lin Yuan and asked him to protect him at the critical moment.","The Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley was very against Elders having connections with external forces. Long Jie had his own selfish motives and did not want to affect his status and reputation in the future.","One of the hot-tempered Frand Elders slammed the table angrily when he heard Long Jie’s words.","“What? He wants our Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley to cooperate with him and give up this top grade blessed land? He has nerve to grow a mouth like that! I don’t agree. This top grade blessed land is very important to us. How can we give up on fighting for this blessed land?","Hearing the Grand Elder’s words, Long Jie could not help but purse his lips. It seemed that this Grand Elder still did not understand the situation. Now that the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley was already at the mercy of others, how could they have the qualifications to negotiate terms and put on airs?","Among the three Grand Elders, Long Yin, whom Long Jie had been communicating with, had the most authority. Only Long Yin’s decision was the most valid.","Long Jie looked at Long Yin calmly and waited for his reply.","Long Jie thought that he was intelligent. But after some thought, Long Yin could basically confirm that Long Jie and this Young Master Lin definitely did not just know each other. If they only knew each other, Long Jie would not have made such a suggestion and treated this Young Master Lin as a straw to clutch at.","It was obvious that Long Jie trusted this Young Master Lin very much and was certain that this Young Master Lin would be able to end the storm if he joined.","Long Yin was very curious as to why Long Jie trusted this Young Master Lin so much.","Long Yin had interacted with Long Jie before. In Long Yin’s eyes, Long Jie was a suspicious fellow by nature. The more suspicious he was, the more he should not believe others.","Long Yin did not want to agree either. The Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley had not sent three Grand Elders over for the so-called ruins.","The Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley had also heard some corresponding information. They were doing this for this top grade blessed land itself.","This was because without this top grade blessed land, the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley would become even more unsustainable and the other overlord factions would become stronger and stronger. However, the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley had been going downhill all these years and was secretly mocked by countless factions.","However, even the Grand Elder did not dare to say anything about Lord Ancestral Dragon’s actions.","Yet, after doing that, the prestige of the Ancestral Dragon in the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley continued to decrease.","This was especially true for some dragons with noble bloodlines. After the dragon vein was absorbed by Lord Ancestral Dragon, these dragons had not given birth to a newborn for tens of thousands of years.","If they did not obtain another top grade blessed land, a few dragons in the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley would probably be extinct!","However, after much consideration, Long Yin was certain that there was no way out if he did not ask for help.","Long Jie was prepared to take this opportunity to get to know the so-called Young Master Lin that Long Jie mentioned.","If Young Master Lin really had so many Creator resources and was willing to trade with the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, it would not be a problem for them to not obtain this top grade blessed land.","Still, Long Yin felt that the possibility of that was very low. In Long Yin’s eyes, it was one thing to trade Grade 4 Creator resources to outsiders—only a fool would trade Grade 5 Creator resources.","“Long Jie, please contact Young Master Lin. If we survive because of you, I will personally reward you and suggest that you become a new Grand Elder!”","After saying that, Long Yin patted Long Jie’s shoulder and encouraged him.","This made Long Jie extremely happy. Becoming a Grand Elder was Long Jie’s goal. Now, there was actually a chance to achieve it!","It was not easy to become a Grand Elder.","With Long Yin as his guarantor, becoming a Grand Elder was a sure bet.","Long Jie immediately contacted Lin Yuan.","The Grand Elder who had not spoken told Long Yin, “Brother Yin, aren’t your promises to Long Jie a little lacking in consideration? With your experience, you should be able to see that Long Jie is colluding with this Young Master Lin. It’s still unknown if Long Jie is controlled by this Young Master Lin. How can we let such a fellow become a Grand Elder? If such a guy can become a Grand Elder, then what authority do we Grand Elders have?”","Long Yin said helplessly, “Apart from getting Long Jie to contact this Young Master Lin, do you have a better way? If there’s a better way, we naturally don’t need Long Jie to contact this Young Master Lin. Won’t it be better if we live to make it out of South Face City and make it back to the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley alive?","“The fact that we can return alive is equivalent to saving more strength for the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley. With our limited resources and without us old fellows holding down the fort, the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley won’t be able to gain a foothold in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","“Also, didn’t you hear that Young Master Lin has a lot of Creator resources? If Long Jie is also a Grand Elder, he might be able to help us trade for Grade 5 Creator resources!”"]},{"number":3119,"title":"Chapter 3119: Ruins Appear!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3119: Ruins Appear!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","As a mature and successful leader, Long Yin had to think far enough. He could not just limit himself to immediate benefits.","Long Yin was much better at this than the others.","Long Yin thought, Young Master Lin can’t disappoint me.","Otherwise, not only would he not be able to save the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley but Young Master Lin would also follow in the footsteps of the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley.","At that moment, Lin Yuan was with Ling Muzhuo. After receiving the news, he immediately arranged for Winter to return to his place.","He then said to the eager Autumn, “Autumn, since you can’t wait anymore, make a scene in South Face City!”","As Lin Yuan spoke, Autumn let out a long howl.","Even though Autumn’s strength had not completely recovered, he had clearly reached his peak state since the reincarnation of the Saint. Autumn could not wait to show Lin Yuan his strength.","Winter returned to Lin Yuan’s side, smiled, and said, “Young Master, Autumn has really been holding it in recently. It’s time to give him a chance to show off.","“Autumn’s ability is the most suitable for combat among the three of us. He has recovered 70% of his strength. Unless the beast god from the Abyssal Beast Domain comes personally or the faerie emperor of Faerie Institution come here, Faerie Institution and Abyssal Beast Domain can’t stop Autumn’s attack with just a few beast archbishops or faerie kings.","“Young Master, actually, the current situation in South Face City is a good opportunity for us. Although we can’t control these factions, we can control their people in South Face City and encroach on them. Even without me and Spring, Autumn alone can do this. Don’t forget that Spring and I have also recovered our strength.","“Young Master, just watch the three of us perform this time! Spring and I have already discussed it. She and I will be responsible for keeping you safe. She has been staying in the Abyssal Beast Domain. It won’t be too late for her to appear when we encounter a situation that requires her to appear.”","Winter, who had recovered his strength, spoke much more confidently than before. It had been a long time since he had recovered his strength, and he was extremely excited.","The Abyssal Beast Domain’s attack on the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley was extremely fast. They basically did not give the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley any room to resist.","The Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley naturally would not give up without a fight. They resisted abnormally fiercely, and a shocking battle occurred between the two sides.","Initially, the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley did not want to fight. Long Yin asked Long Jie to call for reinforcements, but they did not come. This made Long Yin want to lower his head. If it really did not work, he would lower his head to the Abyssal Beast Domain.","In any case, even if they asked Young Master Lin for help, the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley would not have the qualifications to fight for this top grade blessed land.","If the Abyssal Beast Domain could let him leave this place, surrendering might not be the best choice.","However, the Abyssal Beast Domain did not give him a chance to surrender at all. Instead, every move he made would cost him his life. After angering the three Grand Elders of the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, their attacks also became abnormally fierce.","Many innocent forces were involved in the battle between the two forces in South Face City.","As the experts of the Abyssal Beast Domain and Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley fought, many lifeforms were killed by the aftershock.","In the end, Faerie Institution failed to take down the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley even after the Abyssal Beast Domain mobilized four archbishops. The two higher faeries of Faerie Institution joined the battlefield.","The faerie king who had been hiding in the dark was not idle either. He suddenly attacked and severely injured a Grand Elder of the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley.","It was obvious that Long Yin was familiar with this faerie king. He shouted at the faerie king, “Our Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley has never been on bad terms with Faerie Institution before. Isn’t Faerie Institution afraid of the revenge from the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley? If Faerie Institution stops now and doesn’t interfere in the battle between the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley and Abyssal Beast Domain, I can let bygones be bygones!”","Long Yin’s words did not have any effect. The faerie king mocked in an extremely disdainful tone, “If these words were said 100 million years ago, I might still be a little afraid. How is the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley qualified to compete with Faerie Institution now? Aren’t you thinking too highly of the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley by saying that?","“Today, the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley will come to an end here. If you don’t resist, I won’t kill you directly. I can still leave one of you alive so that you can be a prisoner.”","When he said this, the arrogance of this faerie king was felt by all the factions present.","Long Yin could be said to be enraged. No matter what, Long Yin could not allow a Grand Elder to become a prisoner of another faction!","At that moment, Long Jie was extremely anxious. He had already sent Lin Yuan his request for help and had agreed to all of his requests.","There was no reason for Lin Yuan not to respond. Could it be that Lin Yuan was afraid of Faerie Institution and the Abyssal Beast Domain?","If that was the case, even if he did not help the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, he should care about his own life.","Just as Long Jie was about to ask for help again, a bleak and extremely arrogant aura attacked this faerie king.","Sensing this aura, the faerie king immediately responded.","However, this faerie king could not completely block this aura even after using all his strength. He let out a miserable grunt.","An abnormally arrogant tone exploded between heaven and earth.","“My family’s Young Master protects the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley. Faerie Institution and the Abyssal Beast Domain should quickly retreat. Otherwise, don’t blame my Young Master for being merciless!”","As Autumn’s aura attacked the faerie king, he also attacked the two higher faeries and the four archbishops of the Abyssal Beast Domain. Apart from these seven units, the other targets Autumn targeted had even lost the ability to breathe smoothly.","The various factions present were not unfamiliar with Autumn. He was the guard who had always been by Lin Yuan’s side.","Previously, he had shown his face in front of various factions.","Those who knew of Autumn had felt his aura during the trade fair. At that time, in order to suppress the situation, Autumn had even used his aura to suppress the various factions present. Had those factions underestimated Autumn’s strength?","The guard beside Young Master Lin was actually able to fight seven experts alone. The seven experts actually did not even have the chance to resist. One had to know that there was also a faerie king from Faerie Institution!","When Long Jie saw Autumn’s figure, his anxious heart immediately relaxed.","Facing Autumn’s strength, Long Jie was also very surprised. Long Jie did not expect that Autumn would suppress all the people of Faerie Institution and the Abyssal Beast Domain with his aura as soon as he appeared.","The faerie king tried to resist Autumn’s aura as he said, “Faerie Institution and the Abyssal Beast Domain are preparing to attack the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley. Aren’t you afraid of causing a misunderstanding with Faerie Institution?”","This faerie king used Faerie Institution and the Abyssal Beast Domain to pressure Autumn.","Autumn snorted heavily. “Whether the Faerie Institution misunderstands or not is your own business. What does it have to do with me? It has nothing to do with my Young Master.","“Faerie Institution has been tyrannical all these years. Don’t tell me you think you’re invincible? Don’t forget why Faerie Institution had the chance to survive until now. If it wasn’t for that Lord’s pity back then, Faerie Institution would have been devoured by the various factions as soon as it was established. How could it be as prosperous as it is now?","“That Lord’s pity allowed your Faerie Institution to have a place to live. I don’t think he wanted to see Faerie Institution slaughtering so domineeringly.","“Faerie Institution’s situation is special. You shouldn’t have joined the competition for mortal resources. Otherwise, one day, Faerie Institution will have to bear the evil consequences that you should have suffered. Don’t forget that you faeries are a resource coveted by all parties.”","Autumn’s words were earth-shattering. He did not give Faerie Institution any face at all.","These words made the faerie king’s expression change. The faerie king knew about the matter that Autumn had just mentioned. To Faerie Institution, it was not an exaggeration to say that it was a secret.","Back then, Faerie Institution was indeed indebted to a Lord. This Lord lived above everything and did not leave his name. He only knew that the believers called this Lord a Saint.","Even ordinary high-level faeries did not know such a secret, so how did this person know?","This faerie king was not a fool. After sensing the aura released by Autumn, he knew that today’s operation was destined to be impossible.","“Since that’s the case, the Young Master you mentioned wants to protect the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley and we’re not your match. We won’t take any action against the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley in South Face City.","“However, if our two factions attack other factions in the future, I hope your Young Master won’t interfere again. Faerie Institution is not to be trifled with!”","With that, the faerie king prepared to leave with his subordinates.","Autumn snorted. “How dare Faerie Institution express your dissatisfaction with my Young Master? And did I ask you to leave? My Young Master has the intention to fight for this ruin and other opportunities in South Face City apart from this ruin.","“I’ll give your Faerie Institution a chance to submit and work for my Young Master in South Face City.”","After saying that, Autumn looked at the faerie king calmly, waiting for their response.","The faerie king’s expression turned abnormally ugly upon hearing Autumn’s words.","He had already chosen to retreat. Yet, not only did this expert in front of him not give him a chance to retreat, but he even wanted to treat the Faerie Institution as a prisoner. How bold!","This faerie king naturally wasn’t willing to accept such a request.","After the faerie king protested, Autumn did not give him any chance to resist. He directly attacked him.","After a series of attacks, the faerie king fell to the ground heavily injured.","After dealing with the faerie king, Autumn looked sharply at the other high-level faeries, the four archbishops of the Abyssal Beast Domain, as well as the three Grand Elders of the Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley.","Autumn could sense that a top grade blessed land was about to open. Before opening this top grade blessed land, Autumn prepared to help Lin Yuan take care of the situation in South Face City.","Because of his insufficient strength previously, Autumn seemed to be somewhat restrained.","Now, his strength had recovered to 70% of his peak. As Lin Yuan provided more and more Grade 6 Creator resources, not only could he maintain his current strength but also had the possibility of advancing to the next level.","Autumn felt that there was no longer any faction in this world that was worthy of his fear.","Within a day, Autumn had reshuffled the factions in South Face City with his own ability, causing all the factions in South Face City to lose the intention to fight for this top grade blessed land.","The faerie king who was used to being domineering gritted his teeth.","If it was not for the fact that he could not compete with Autumn at all, this faerie king would have given it his all if there was even the slightest possibility.","However, the disparity in level between the two sides was too great. Resisting under such a huge disparity was no different from hitting a rock with an egg. The act of striking a stone with an egg was not desirable.","Faeries always cherished their lives.","After Autumn released his strength, South Face City was maintained in a strange quiet atmosphere at the most chaotic time.","Even those factions that came to South City not for the sake of competing for the top grade blessed land but with other factions as their targets did not dare to take any action. They were afraid that if they did something wrong and angered Young Master Lin, they would be killed!","Soon, the top grade blessed land opened as scheduled. The factions that had come to South Face City to obtain this top grade blessed land could only watch helplessly as Lin Yuan developed this top grade blessed land.","The top grade Palm of Blessed Land created by a Grade 5 Creator could contain this top grade blessed land.","After Lin Yuan finished exploring this top grade blessed land, he stored it away.","The moment Lin Yuan loaded up this top grade blessed land, the so-called ruins appeared.","The moment this ruin appeared, the entire world was sealed by a special ability.","This made the Abyssal Beast Domain, Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, Faerie Institution, and even the Great Sun Phoenixes, want to compete.","Under Autumn’s suppression, the factions that were fighting each other even developed thoughts of forming an alliance. Autumn could be said to be extremely disdainful of this.","After receiving Lin Yuan’s order, Spring not only hid in the alliance under the Abyssal Beast Domain, but she also stood up to help Autumn control the situation.","Once again, they suppressed the various factions and completely cut off their thoughts of resistance.","As Spring, Autumn, and Winter sensed the ruins, the three of them were pleasantly surprised.","The three of them sensed Lord Saint’s aura from this ruin. In other words, this ruin was very likely left behind by Lord Saint in his previous life. If it was not left behind by Lord Saint in his previous life, it would definitely be related to Lord Saint in his previous life."]},{"number":3120,"title":"Chapter 3120: Saint’s Companion Seed!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3120: Saint’s Companion Seed!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","The three of them told Lin Yuan about this situation. Lin Yuan was surprised, but a look of understanding appeared on his face. No wonder he had such a strong sense of destiny toward this ruins.","Spring, Autumn, and Winter wanted to accompany Lin Yuan into the ruins but were blocked by the space passageways. The space passageways contained a huge force that prevented anyone from entering.","However, Lin Yuan was not rejected by this space passageway.","Facing such a situation, Spring, Autumn, and Winter did not know if they should support Lin Yuan’s entry. Lin Yuan would be in danger if he went in alone. Spring, Autumn, and Winter would not be able to help him.","After this ruins appeared, Lin Yuan could clearly feel its attraction to him. After much consideration, he decided to enter the ruins.","Seeing that Lin Yuan had made up his mind, Spring, Autumn, and Winter did not say anything else.","After entering the ruins, Lin Yuan felt that he had entered a ball of warm water. This feeling was very similar to when he had first stepped into the Returning Saint Pool. The energy in the ruins could be directly absorbed by Lin Yuan, imperceptibly increasing his strength.","At that moment, Lin Yuan was certain that this ruins should have been left behind by him in his previous life.","Lin Yuan gradually fell into a deep sleep. If the ruins in Epoch God Palace’s Returning Saint Pool were to help Lin Yuan awaken his physique, then the ruins here were purely helping Lin Yuan enhance his strength.","When Lin Yuan woke up from his slumber, the ruins were empty.","Apart from the inheritance of energy, there was also a portion of the inheritance of memories in this ruins.","Lin Yuan had never expected that the vast abyssal world was only a part of the Spirit Lock spatial zone. The stone pillars that had appeared in the Spirit Lock spatial zone were the key to fusing the abyssal world into the Spirit Lock spatial zone again.","Previously, Lin Yuan had only intended to explore the abyssal world. Now, it was a must for him. This was because this concerned the completeness of the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Lin Yuan asked Genius and learned that he had not slept for long in the ruins. He had only slept for less than seven days.","Sensing the boundless energy in his body, Lin Yuan momentarily lost his understanding of his own strength.","However, with Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter around, there were very few opportunities for Lin Yuan to display his strength.","When he left the ruins, Spring, Autumn, and Winter were waiting at the entrance.","Upon seeing Lin Yuan walk out of the ruins, the three of them heaved a sigh of relief.","Autumn was the first to speak. “Young Master, it’s great that you came out safely! All the factions in South Face City have been gathered in the City Lord Manor. After you come out, it’s time to decide how to deal with these factions.”","Lin Yuan’s thoughts and decisions had changed to a certain extent before and after he came out of the ruins.","After meeting with these factions, Lin Yuan had no intention of letting them leave directly. Instead, he chose to gather these factions and wanted to take them under his wing. Not only did Lin Yuan want to take these factions under his command, but he also wanted to control the four universes as soon as possible.","This inheritance allowed Lin Yuan to establish his goal and understand why he had reincarnated in his previous life. Apart from being restricted by his own strength, he had to seek the possibility of transcendence in his previous life. It was also to protect the huge Sky Beyond the Clouds and prevent the outside world from invading it.","In Lin Yuan’s previous life, he had divided the Spirit Lock spatial zone from the abyssal world for this purpose.","In this life, Lin Yuan’s growth was much stronger than in his previous life. In his previous life, Morbius’ spirit-locked feys had not received optimal nurturing at the beginning, so they had stopped at the Domain Mountain class.","In this life, Morbius’ upper limit was not as simple as the Domain Mountain class.","Moreover, it was not as easy for Morbius to produce Creator resources in its previous life as it was in this life.","It was no longer impossible for Lin Yuan to resist the invasion of the energy in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Lin Yuan had great confidence in this.","After Lin Yuan made his decision, he immediately took action. None of the factions present were willing to surrender. However, their predicament was worse than they expected. In this situation, it was impossible for them not to surrender and submit.","In the end, the Abyssal Beast Domain, Great Sun Phoenixes, and Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley chose to join Lin Yuan.","As for the faerie king from Faerie Institution, no matter how unwilling he was, he had no choice.","Lin Yuan could tell that this faerie king was not sincere in submitting to him. In the past, Lin Yuan had wanted to control these experts in South Face City before plotting against the faction behind them.","Now, Lin Yuan had changed his mind and allowed these people to contact the faction behind them.","Then, Spring, Summer, and Winter would control the entire Myriad Dragon Immortal Valley, Great Sun Phoenixes, Abyssal Beast Domain, and Faerie Institution, taking these four factions under their control.","Thousands of years passed in the blink of an eye.","These thousand years were very short for the Sky Beyond the Clouds, but the changes in these thousand years were even greater than the changes in the hundreds of millions of years before.","In the past thousand years, a faction named Sky City had appeared out of nowhere and started to take control of the Sky Beyond the Clouds at breakneck speed.","The various factions thought that Sky City’s actions would be resisted by the various factions. However, not only did those familiar and powerful factions not stop Sky City’s actions, but they even helped Sky City make this happen.","More than 2/3 of the factions in the Sky Beyond the Clouds were controlled by Sky City, including many overlord factions.","In the beginning, these overlords were controlled by Sky City because of the situation.","However, these overlords soon obtained a lot of benefits from Sky City.","Sky City had actually given these overlord factions the opportunity and channels to trade for Grade 6 Creator resources.","Furthermore, Sky City treated all the overlord factions equally. Every overlord faction that joined Sky City had the opportunity to trade for Grade 6 Creator resources.","With so many Grade 6 Creator resources leaking out, the various factions began to suspect how many Grade 6 Creators there were in Sky City.","Sky City’s actions over the past thousand years had attracted the attention of many Grade 6 Creators.","In a few operations, Lin uan even angered a Grade 6 Creator.","However, after this Grade 6 Creator aggressively found Sky City, there was no eventual conflict with Sky City. Instead, he joined Sky City and became a member.","All of a sudden, the rumors about Sky City in the Sky Beyond the Clouds became blurry.","Another few thousand years passed in the blink of an eye.","On the back of a huge soaring whale that stretched as far as the eye could see, a young man was looking down at the rivers and mountains below him.","A woman in a moon-white robe stood beside Lin Yuan and said emotionally, “Little Yuan, almost 6,000 years have passed since we came here from the main world. When I first came, I was still worried about whether we could establish ourselves in this world. Now, you have basically become the ruler of this world.”","Lin Yuan said after pondering for a moment, “Master, based on the current situation, I’m not far from ruling the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Apart from the relatively remote areas in the West Universe, the four universes are basically under control.”","Initially, Lin Yuan had thought that the four official factions would have a huge impact on him. However, after some time, he realized that they did not pose much of an obstacle to him.","On the contrary, as Lin Yuan controlled more and more powerful factions, the official factions of the four universes helped him. This was because the official factions were formed by those powerful factions. After Lin Yuan controlled enough factions, the official factions of the four universes had subtly become his mouthpieces. They could help Lin Yuan do many things that were not easy to do.","The Moon Empress looked into the distance.","“Little Yuan, you have provided the best conditions for all lifeforms in the main world. I wonder when they will be able to break through the restrictions of the main world and come to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.”","When Lin Yuan saw the Moon Empress’ expression, he knew that she was missing her old friends from the main world.","“Master, Fan Lou has been keeping an eye on them all this time. If anyone from our original world successfully transcends and enters the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Fan Lou will bring them over immediately.","“Actually, if you miss them too much, you can also head to the main world. We contracted the Lifespan Mouse for them before we left. They should still be alive now.”","The Moon Empress gently shook her head. “Everyone has their own opportunities. With my current strength, entering the main world will most likely affect it. I’d better wait for them to come to the Sky Beyond the Clouds! You’ve created a paradise for them in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.”","The Moon Empress paused before she continued. “Little Yuan, when you control the Sky Beyond the Clouds, your target should be the abyssal world, right?”","Lin Yuan nodded seriously. He needed the power of the Sky Beyond the Clouds to help him control the abyssal world with the stone pillars and reunite the abyssal world with the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","With the help of the creatures in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, it would not be difficult for Lin Yuan to achieve this goal.","Ever since Lin Yuan returned to Sky City, he had invested numerous Grade 6 Creator resources into the members of Sky City.","There were more than 1,500 members of the white-clothed followers, Battle Sequence, and Reserve Sequence. Every one of them had basically reached Long Jie’s level in South Face City.","The Moon Empress had already become a Grade 6 Creator.","Genius kept asking the heavens through its exclusive skill. Its strength had already faintly surpassed the level of a Grade 6 Creator.","However, in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, there was no measurement standard for Creators above Grade 6, and Grade 6 Creators had already reached the end.","The entire Sky Beyond the Clouds was under Lin Yuan’s control. He had allowed the Sky Beyond the Clouds to settle down for tens of thousands of years.","Through Morbius, they harvested spirit qi crystals from the various areas in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Then, spirit qi crystals would be sent to the entire Sky Beyond the Clouds to provide for them.","Lin Yuan’s investment in the various factions had allowed the Sky Beyond the Clouds to reach its strongest state in history.","Under Lin Yuan’s control and support, the various species had completely submitted.","In the past 10,000 years, Lin Yuan had been developing Endless Summer and the others’ divine kingdom abilities. He had also allowed the Hundred Questions Beast army to nurture some special feys needed to explore and conquer the abyssal world.","Currently, every member of the Hundred Questions Beast Army had reached the level of a Grade 5 Creator. Meanwhile, dozens of Hundred Questions Beasts had become Grade 6 Creators because of their outstanding talent.","The enhancement of the Hundred Questions Beasts’ army allowed them to produce resources with an extremely high research efficiency. In the past 10,000 years, at least hundreds of special feys had been developed.","With Lin Yuan’s command, the Sky Beyond the Clouds started the largest exploration and conquest in history.","At present, the Sky Beyond the Clouds started a brand new historical process. The conflicts between the various factions in the Sky Beyond the Clouds basically stopped. The star pirates that were originally rampant in the Sky Beyond the Clouds had completely disappeared.","If the various factions explored the abyssal world well, they would be rewarded.","Lin Yuan used Creator resources of various levels as a prize. These Creator resources were extremely attractive to the major factions of the Sky Beyond the Clouds. In addition, Lin Yuan had also provided hundreds of feys as support, so the various factions did not have to worry about being corroded by the abyssal world’s power.","Secondly, he could recover his energy in the abyssal world.","The originally mysterious abyssal world map was constantly lit up.","In less than 3,000 years, Lin Yuan had successfully extracted two stone pillars from the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","The moment this inconspicuous stone pillar was inserted into the abyssal world, the expelled abyssal world lifeform would automatically fuse into the Spirit Lock spatial zone through this stone pillar. After this map fused into the Spirit Lock spatial zone, the stone pillar changed its appearance.","As the Spirit Lock spatial zone became larger, the original abilities of the Spirit Lock spatial zone increased to varying degrees.","Lin Yuan thought, It’s only a matter of time before I completely control the abyssal world.","While the various factions were helping Lin Yuan explore the abyssal world, Morbius successfully reached the Domain Mountain class.","Morbius’ appearance was still the same as Lin Yuan’s, but it had always been displayed with three question marks.","Saint Companion Seed/Saint Companion","Lin Yuan was momentarily at a loss for words.","Morbius was indeed his companion lifeform on various levels.","Currently, Morbius had reached its pinnacle state in his previous life. However, it had been nurtured by Lin Yuan in the best way, so it did not feel anything.","Morbius had been helping Lin Yuan collect spirit qi crystals for over 10,000 years. Now that Lin Yuan had saved trillions of spirit qi crystals, there was no need for Morbius to keep collecting spirit qi crystals like before.","After a long time, Lin Yuan finally had a chance to talk to Morbius face-to-face. It was not like before, where they communicated telepathically."]},{"number":3121,"title":"Chapter 3121: You Are My Pride!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3121: You Are My Pride!","Translator: Atlas Studios Editor: Atlas Studios","Morbius gave Lin Yuan a big hug and said with a smile, “My friend, your growth speed in this life is really fast. Even my strength will increase rapidly. I feel that the inherent bloodline in my body has been broken after my advancement. This means that I was definitely not as strong as I am now in my previous life.","“I can choose my Domain Mountain ability. My ability is related to purification and absorption. It shouldn’t be too difficult for me to absorb and devour the energy from the other side of the abyssal world with this ability.”","Lin Yuan said with a smile, “I’m relieved to hear that. This way, we can completely resolve the invasion of the Sky Beyond the Clouds from the other world. To allow the Sky Beyond the Clouds to coexist perfectly with the other world.","“If we can achieve this, we will have achieved our goal. I’ve fulfilled the long-cherished wish of my previous life. I’ve completely bid farewell to the past and embarked on a brand new journey.”","Morbius said after a moment of silence, “My friend, after reaching Domain Mountain class, I completely recovered the memories that I sealed in my previous life.","“In my previous life, the two of us did not get along very well at the end. Your duty was to protect the world. However, I did not feel that there is any need to protect the world. I still feel that way in this life.","“Absorbing the energy from the other side of the abyssal world is beneficial for both of us. And like you, I can start a new journey.”","Morbius silently looked at Lin Yuan for a long time before a satisfied smile appeared on its usually expressionless face.","Morbius added inwardly, What new journey can I have? My new journey is simply to keep you company, my partner.","Time passed quickly. As stone pillars stood in the void world one after another, these ruins pillars continuously merged into the Spirit Lock spatial zone, causing it to continuously strengthen.","As the Spirit Lock spatial zone continued to be completed, Morbius’ strength also increased further.","The various factions in the Sky Beyond the Clouds were all pawns who occupied the abyssal world and cleaned up the lifeforms.","The various factions naturally knew that Sky City had used a special method to make the territory of the abyssal world disappear, but they did not dare to say anything about it.","Sky City’s dominance over the Sky Beyond the Clouds was unprecedented.","After merging more than half of the abyssal world into the Spirit Lock spatial zone, Lin Yuan went to the world outside the void world to sense the environment.","Lin Yuan realized that Morbius could already absorb and convert the energy of the outside world.","This allowed Lin Yuan to fuse the entire world into the Spirit Lock spatial zone without worry.","During his exploration, Lin Yuan had seen many special creatures.","These living beings were not strong, but they were all in extremely special conditions and looked very different from the lifeforms in the native world of the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","The world on the other side of the void world contained abundant resources that were very useful to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Lin Yuan collected these resources. Among them, he discovered a type of Magic Establishment Stone and Morbius defined the energy in the other world as magic power.","The Magic Establishment Stone was a material that could isolate magic power. It had a huge production rate in the other world.","If he filled the borders of the original void world with Magic Establishment Stones, he could effectively isolate the invasion of magic power into the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Magic Establishment Stones were extremely easy to collect, but it required numerous people to collect them.","Lin Yuan asked Genius to study magic power, which was very similar to the energy in the abyssal world.","The energy in the abyssal world was a special type of energy mutated from the combination of spirit qi and magic power.","Under the research of the Hundred Questions Beast army, it did not take long for them to develop feys that were very amiable and could exempt contractors from the influence of magic power.","The creatures that Lin Yuan had captured from the outside world provided the materials for Genius’ research, and everything went exceptionally smoothly.","Lin Yuan chose a portion of talented spirit contractors from the faith country and got them to contract the special feys that the Hundred Questions Beast army had developed that could block magic power. He then began to mine and collect the Magic Establishment Stones.","Lin Yuan had arranged for experts to ensure the safety of those involved in mining and assembling the Magic Establishment Stones. For thousands of years, these workers had not faced any danger.","The most perilous moments occurred when they encountered powerful native creatures from the other world. However, these creatures rarely displayed aggression toward the Sky Beyond the Clouds’ native miners.","Lin Yuan dispatched various construction-savvy species to the area. They built a meandering city wall made of Magic Establishment Stones, enclosing the entire Sky Beyond the Clouds.","After completing these tasks, Lin Yuan fully integrated Morbius’ Spirit Lock spatial zone.","The city wall made of Magic Establishment Stones isolated the invasion of magic power and maintained a paradise for the lifeforms in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Lin Yuan had not taken the initiative to attack the Grade 6 Creators in the four universes for tens of thousands of years, but these Grade 6 Creators had chosen to join Sky City.","As the saying went, “He who understands the times is a wise man.”","These Grade 6 Creators, who had absolute power in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, did not want to become prisoners.","Sky City was already unstoppable. Instead of letting Sky City attack them, it was better to join Sky City and become a part of it.","In any case, more than one Grade 6 Creator had already expressed their allegiance to Sky City.","At this moment, Sky City was holding a banquet. The leaders of the various factions were all present.","Chu Ci had become the most popular person in the entire Sky Beyond the Clouds and all the factions knew that she was Lin Yuan’s younger sister.","Many young talents from the Sky Beyond the Clouds tried their best to woo Chu Ci.","Who wouldn’t want to be a son-in-law? Marrying into Sky City would significantly elevate both their status and that of their factions in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","However, none of these young talents managed to catch Chu Ci’s eye.","At present, Chu Ci had no intention of starting a family at all. Her brother had yet to start a family, so what was there to be anxious about?","The Moon Empress did not participate in this banquet. She was in seclusion, preparing to attempt to transcend the limits of a Grade 6 Creator.","Wen Yu and Liu Jie sat on both sides of Lin Yuan.","All the factions knew that the three people sitting before them were the most powerful in the entire Sky Beyond the Clouds.","This was especially true for Liu Jie, who had spent years exploring and conquering the Sky Beyond the Clouds, ultimately gaining control of the abyssal world.","Liu Jie led the white-clothed followers to dominate various factions.","Regardless of which faction Liu Jie and the white-robed followers approached, that faction would be subdued.","Wen Yu was in charge of the Astronomical Parliament. The leaders of the 100 strongest factions in the Sky Beyond the Clouds were members of it.","This banquet was held for Lin Yuan’s purpose.","After the various factions had eaten and drunk their fill, Lin Yuan spoke in an extremely solemn tone. “I believe all of you are already clear about the power of magic power, which is completely different from spirit qi. I called you here this time because I’ve decided to begin exploring the world outside the Magic Establishment Stone Wall.","“Every faction present will obtain 500 feys that can only help isolate mana before they leave. Although we haven’t found a way to survive in a mana environment, the resources from the other world are very useful to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.”","Lin Yuan’s words marked the beginning of a new era in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","In just tens of thousands of years, they had broken the inherent structure of the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Under the rule of Sky City, the Sky Beyond the Clouds entered a peaceful state.","Not only that, but the Sky Beyond the Clouds was also expanding their territory for the first time. They were extremely far-sighted to be able to become the leader of lording factions.","Lin Yuan seemed to want to use their factions as a pawn when he found them. However, this also established their faction’s advantage and allowed him to be one step ahead of the other factions.","The leaders of the various factions immediately agreed and expressed their support for Lin Yuan’s decision.","After the banquet ended, Lin Yuan, Wen Yu, and Liu Jie washed up and sat on the grass in Sky City.","Liu Jie downed a glass of strong liquor and laughed heartily.","Everything that happened when the three of them sat on the grass in the Return from Faraway Mansion and decided to build Sky City was still vivid in their minds.","Tens of thousands of years passed in the blink of an eye, but the heart they had at the beginning had never changed.","It was rare for Wen Yu to drink a large glass of wine and chat with Lin Yuan and Liu Jie.","As they toasted each other, the three of them passed out on the grass.","The wine brewed from Grade 6 Creator resources was very intoxicating.","A ray of moonlight quietly shone on Lin Yuan, Wen Yu, and Liu Jie. Right on the heels of that, a beautiful figure appeared in front of them.","With a wave of her hand, the moonlight weaved into three quilts and gently covered Lin Yuan and the other two.","The Moon Empress squatted down and looked at the drunk Lin Yuan with a flushed face. A beautiful smile appeared on her cold face.","“Little Yuan, since the day I took you in as my disciple, you have always been my pride.”"]}]);
